(40917,	2003,	316,	'...that there is spiritual growth upon knowing about forgiving..\r\n..it is command to forgive one another.\r\n..that it is possible that any believer who does not forgive a brother\'s offense,God will do the same.',	'2017-09-30 02:33:26',	'2017-09-30 02:33:26'),
