(40927,	362,	8523,	'no',	'2017-10-06 14:32:13',	'2017-10-06 14:32:13'),
(40928,	3828,	5806,	'God expects His people to bind and loose those things He desires. God has given us the power and He is waiting on us to operate in that power and authority. The trouble is many of us are waiting on God to do all the work and come fix everything for us.\r\nThe same message can be preached in two separate places and have two completely different results. These results are contingent on the church\'s willingness to pray and break through. In the place where things desired by God have been bound or loosed there can be a tremendous result. On the contrary, nothing may occur in a place not really breaking through in prayer to operate in the power and authority of God.\r\nGod needs the cooperation of His people in the earth. God has placed a burden on His people to pray and without prayer that burden will continue to get heavier until the pressure we feel is unbearable. Prayer is the only avenue we have to understand what God desires to do in the earth. Living for God may not always be easy but without prayer it is impossible.',	'2017-09-30 16:15:29',	'2017-09-30 16:15:29'),
(40929,	3828,	5807,	'Pray and seek the knowledge of God\'s will for me. That by the power of Christ in me, my burdens will be a light and momentary suffering.',	'2017-09-30 16:15:29',	'2017-09-30 16:15:29'),
(40930,	3828,	5808,	'Living for God might be the hardest thing some of us have ever done in life, however it will be the most rewarding!',	'2017-09-30 16:15:29',	'2017-09-30 16:15:29'),
(40931,	361,	8536,	'movies\r\nstudies\r\nresults for subjects I\'m bad in',	'2017-10-05 16:10:22',	'2017-10-05 16:10:22'),
(40932,	361,	8537,	'movies\r\nstudies\r\nresults for subjects I\'m bad in',	'2017-10-05 16:10:22',	'2017-10-05 16:10:22'),
(40933,	361,	8538,	'I will be a follower of God no matter what it takes',	'2017-10-05 16:10:22',	'2017-10-05 16:10:22'),
(40934,	361,	8539,	'I will trust God even though it seems impossible because all things are possible with God',	'2017-10-05 16:10:22',	'2017-10-05 16:10:22'),
(40935,	2003,	331,	'With this lesson,we learned that God is the just judge..and He will pass righteous judgement.\r\nBitterness can be a root of offense that will defile us.\r\nNot to be afraid to examine out own hearts and be submitted to Godly counsel.',	'2017-09-30 17:00:32',	'2017-09-30 17:00:32'),
(40936,	2003,	332,	'When we bring our offering to the altar and realized of someone has against you..then leave your offering and first reconcile w/ that brother and then come,offer the gift to our God.',	'2017-09-30 17:00:32',	'2017-09-30 17:00:32'),
(40937,	2003,	333,	'We should not allow ourselves to cover up w/ offense. Let\'s pursue peace by releasing offenses we\'ve had,and be not defiled.',	'2017-09-30 17:00:32',	'2017-09-30 17:00:32'),
(40938,	2003,	346,	'An offense is truly a bait of Satan.\r\nHarboring an offense will only gets us colder and colder in serving God..\r\n..that praying for those who persecute us is an act of interceeding like a close relative.',	'2017-09-30 17:48:06',	'2017-09-30 17:48:06'),
(40939,	2003,	347,	'Not to entertain offenses anymore, because it will just lead us to spiritual downfall.',	'2017-09-30 17:48:06',	'2017-09-30 17:48:06'),
(40940,	2003,	348,	'What we do with the offense,surely will going to determine our future.',	'2017-09-30 17:48:06',	'2017-09-30 17:48:06'),
(40941,	4055,	181,	'Offences come from our congregation more than from the world.\r\nOur expectations create the level of offences that come.\r\nOffences ultimately lead to hatred towards our brother.',	'2017-10-06 03:02:35',	'2017-10-06 03:02:35'),
(40942,	4055,	182,	'That I will apply the flow of a lively sea to my spiritual life.',	'2017-10-06 03:02:35',	'2017-10-06 03:02:35'),
(40943,	4055,	183,	'Charity is the antithesis of hatred and works to bring down strongholds.',	'2017-10-06 03:02:35',	'2017-10-06 03:02:35'),
(40944,	4055,	196,	'What you do with the offense determines your future.\r\nNo one can get you out of God\'s will but yourself.\r\nGod will not violate your will.',	'2017-10-06 03:07:12',	'2017-10-06 03:07:12'),
(40945,	4055,	197,	'No matter what happens in life I will strive to be in the will of God for my life.',	'2017-10-06 03:07:12',	'2017-10-06 03:07:12'),
(40946,	4055,	198,	'It is amazing that of all the things that God hates, sowing discord or gossiping is worse than anything else a person can do to offend Him.',	'2017-10-06 03:07:12',	'2017-10-06 03:07:12'),
(40947,	2005,	211,	'What you do with the offense will determine your future.\r\nGod knows the treatment we\'ve got from anybody\r\nThere is no treatment will gone to us that does not gone out to God\'s attention',	'2017-10-01 11:37:56',	'2017-10-01 11:37:56'),
(40948,	2005,	212,	'Not to touch or strike or in any form the God\'s anointed.',	'2017-10-01 11:37:56',	'2017-10-01 11:37:56'),
(40949,	2005,	213,	'Praise God!',	'2017-10-01 11:37:56',	'2017-10-01 11:37:56'),
(40950,	2005,	226,	'It is unrighteous thing to avenge yourselves\r\nWhen God avenges, it is a righteous thing\r\nWhen God is not speaking, he is speaking, meaning, \"Don\'t change anything.\"',	'2017-10-01 12:13:25',	'2017-10-01 12:13:25'),
(40951,	2005,	227,	'Not to pick up the bait!',	'2017-10-01 12:13:25',	'2017-10-01 12:13:25'),
(40952,	2005,	228,	'Praise the Lord',	'2017-10-01 12:13:25',	'2017-10-01 12:13:25'),
(40953,	973,	1216,	'We live according to the laws of our society, yet we live by a higher law too.\r\nWhen you honour civil authorities - despite their wickedness, you will allow God to have His way\r\nBible even says to honour the king, Herod, who chose to listen Jews and kill Jesus.',	'2017-10-07 15:34:10',	'2017-10-07 15:34:10'),
(40954,	973,	1217,	'Building good reputations so that I can be vessels for the word of God.',	'2017-10-07 15:34:10',	'2017-10-07 15:34:10'),
(40955,	973,	1218,	'God\'s expectation on us is so high. He gives us so complicated thinking and value system like judging what is good and righteous but ask us to simply honour the authorities.. honouring and loving God beyond all our thinking and value system.. because we are counter culture people',	'2017-10-07 15:34:10',	'2017-10-07 15:34:10'),
(40956,	2007,	346,	'Your sin by holding an offence separated you from God, not God from you.\r\nPeople who are strong in the Spirit don\'t get injured easily by offenses,\r\nThere is a huge differences between forgiveness and reconcillation',	'2017-10-26 07:20:19',	'2017-10-26 07:20:19'),
(40957,	2007,	347,	'I will keep on praying for myself and my co brethren to be able to build our spiritual muscles against offense. I will be more patient and understanding knowing each of us is different,',	'2017-10-26 07:20:19',	'2017-10-26 07:20:19'),
(40958,	2007,	348,	'Since i started this lesson, i have learned a lot. Trusting God to be able to love everybody and have patient to everyone.',	'2017-10-26 07:20:19',	'2017-10-26 07:20:19'),
(40959,	1997,	226,	'Avenge not yourself\r\n\r\nRomans 12:19-20 says, Dearly beloved, avenge not yourselves, but rather give place unto wrath: for it is written, Vengeance is mine; I will repay, saith the Lord. Therefore if thine enemy hunger, feed him; if he thirst, give him drink: for in so doing thou shalt heap coals of fire on his head.\r\n\r\nGod commands us not to avenge ourselves for judgment His. The decision on whether the person will be saved or delivered is in the hands of God. If we intervene by taking matters into our own hands, we will slow down the judgment process for the person who genuinely mistreated us. So, it\'s better to wait and let God take charge.\r\nIsaiah 55:12\r\n\r\nFor ye shall go out with joy, and be led forth with peace: the mountains and the hills shall break forth before you into singing, and all the trees of the field shall clap their hands.\r\n\r\nThis should be the feeling when it\'s time to leave a ministry or a church we are attending. There ought to be joy and peace. \r\n\r\nThis was the feeling that I had when I left my previous church.\r\nGenesis 4:7\r\n\r\nIf thou doest well, shalt thou not be accepted? and if thou doest not well, sin lieth at the door. And unto thee shall be his desire, and thou shalt rule over him.\r\n\r\nSin lies at the door. An offense lies at the doorway. When we allow it to enter, It has a domino effect in our lives. Our root system shrinks hence, it is easy for us to wander and we become vagabonds. Then, we also develop a persecution complex wherein we irrationally think that everybody is out to get us.',	'2017-10-03 09:02:29',	'2017-10-03 09:02:29'),
(40960,	1997,	227,	'To become rooted where God chose to plant me.',	'2017-10-03 09:02:29',	'2017-10-03 09:02:29'),
(40961,	1997,	228,	'No matter how offended I will become, for it is impossible not to be offended regardless on how long you\'ve been walking this christian journey, to wait on the Lord until he is done refining me.',	'2017-10-03 09:02:29',	'2017-10-03 09:02:29'),
(40962,	2004,	286,	'Importance of the word to believe, means to obey\r\nJesus Christ as a Rock of offense, who offended many people\r\nAs a preacher Jesus allowed them to preach the word of God even it will offend his member. to preach the truth, a person preach the character of God.',	'2017-10-02 12:59:49',	'2017-10-02 12:59:49'),
(40963,	2004,	287,	'to separate, what is from God and from evil.',	'2017-10-02 12:59:49',	'2017-10-02 12:59:49'),
(40964,	2004,	288,	'Encountering offenses not for us to depart from the church of God but to check ourselves',	'2017-10-02 12:59:49',	'2017-10-02 12:59:49'),
(40965,	2004,	301,	'When is the right to offend and not to offend\r\nDo not use liberty (privilege) as an opportunity for the flesh, to serve your self but use  it served one another. Difference between Slave and servant\r\nReceiving brothers weak in faith . . .  Idol discussion,',	'2017-10-07 07:40:13',	'2017-10-07 07:40:13'),
(40966,	2004,	302,	'To be more sensitive or careful in my action, words with regards to avoid offending one another.',	'2017-10-07 07:40:13',	'2017-10-07 07:40:13'),
(40967,	2004,	303,	'Our priority not to stumble our brothers in Christ, but rather teach them concerning the truth we have, so next time they will understand what where coming from the word the of God.',	'2017-10-07 07:40:13',	'2017-10-07 07:40:13'),
(40968,	2004,	316,	'Forgiveness is our heavenly Father\'s character.\r\nAs a born again Christian, we need to let go our offences and learn to forgive and forget regardless if he didn\'t know he offend us.\r\nIf we refuse to forgive our salvation will be in danger.',	'2017-10-07 08:44:20',	'2017-10-07 08:44:20'),
(40969,	2004,	317,	'To ask God to heal my offenses and submit to His word so I can learn to forgive and forget.',	'2017-10-07 08:44:20',	'2017-10-07 08:44:20'),
(40970,	2004,	318,	'In times of pain or offenses, always think that our God Jesus Christ never give up on the cross thinking our salvation. . .',	'2017-10-07 08:44:20',	'2017-10-07 08:44:20'),
(40971,	233,	3421,	'The Care ministry gives the saints the opportunity to put into training what they have been taught.\r\nSaints need to be taught, trained and given the liberty to minister instead of being held in check .\r\nThe aim of a trainer is to impart to others his experiences and hope his trainee will impart what they have received to others.',	'2017-10-13 04:44:27',	'2017-10-13 04:44:27'),
(40972,	233,	3422,	'I endeavor to be taught and trained to do the work of the Lord.',	'2017-10-13 04:44:27',	'2017-10-13 04:44:27'),
(40973,	233,	3423,	'Na',	'2017-10-13 04:44:27',	'2017-10-13 04:44:27'),
(40974,	4015,	151,	'The only exception to disobeying authority is when they tell you to do something contrary to the word of God.\r\nGod can use unbelievers and uses parents to speak into their children\'s lives\r\nWives should submit to the husbands even if theyr\'e cruel',	'2017-10-03 07:00:04',	'2017-10-03 07:00:04'),
(40975,	4015,	152,	'To be completely submissive and obedient towards my parents.',	'2017-10-03 07:00:04',	'2017-10-03 07:00:04'),
(40976,	4015,	153,	'Your\'e parents are your authority even when you move out, until you get married.',	'2017-10-03 07:00:04',	'2017-10-03 07:00:04'),
(40977,	90,	3241,	'An intimate relationship with God will automatically lead to fruit bearing. \r\n\r\nIf I\'m not growing, or the Church is not growing, something is wrong...\r\nA child that never grows up is considered afflicted (or handicapped)\r\nWe stand in the way of spiritual conception because our flesh does not want to be inconvenienced, does not embrace the changes that will take place. \n\nWhen members dont want to stay because the church is \"getting too big\", its likened to an older sibling who is jealous over a newborn sibling- not enough time and attention given and they do not want to participate in caring for the newborn.',	'2017-10-04 18:37:17',	'2017-10-04 18:37:17'),
(40978,	90,	3242,	'Be more intentional in preparing to be able to receive and care for souls. Pastor told us to ask God for ten new names too!',	'2017-10-04 18:37:17',	'2017-10-04 18:37:17'),
(40979,	90,	3243,	'I gotta constantly bring my motives to God and have the right motives for being in Church. Its not about me. \n\nI need God given revelations consistently to defeat the spirit of religious tradition in my life and in my culture.',	'2017-10-04 18:37:17',	'2017-10-04 18:37:17'),
(40980,	1194,	76,	'What is really going to set us apart is when we choose to live above the standards of this world.\r\nWhen you honor the authorities that He sent in your life, you open up yourself to receive from Him.\r\nYou don\'t fear God unless you submit to authority. If you can\'t even submit to your earthly authorities, how are you going to submit it to God?',	'2017-10-03 07:40:51',	'2017-10-03 07:40:51'),
(40981,	1194,	77,	'When my authorities say hurtful and insensitive things or things that I don\'t agree with, I will still choose to honor them.',	'2017-10-03 07:40:51',	'2017-10-03 07:40:51'),
(40982,	1194,	78,	'It\'s not about how much I give, it\'s about how much honor I show to my authorities. When I honor my authorities, I will be blessed. Even when I do not agree with them, I will choose to respect them because I must honor what God honors. I want to be like Hannah who still chose to respect her authority even though he called her drunk. Because of her respect towards him, she received the thing she was crying out for.',	'2017-10-03 07:40:51',	'2017-10-03 07:40:51'),
(40983,	4015,	166,	'An attitude of humility is of utmost importance.\r\nFaith is not faith at all unless theres corresponding obedient actions\r\nWhen we really grow in our faith is when everything is going wrong, but we are still working in obedient actions.',	'2017-10-03 08:26:53',	'2017-10-03 08:26:53'),
(40984,	4015,	167,	'To gain more of an attitude of humility.',	'2017-10-03 08:26:53',	'2017-10-03 08:26:53'),
(40985,	4015,	168,	'There is nothing we have that God hasn\'t given us.',	'2017-10-03 08:26:53',	'2017-10-03 08:26:53'),
(40986,	1997,	241,	'Teknon vs. Huios\r\n\r\nTeknon means immature sons while Huios means mature sons. The latter demonstrates the character of a parent, in our case, our Father in Heaven through Jesus Christ. \r\n\r\nIt\'s not enough to be called sons of God. We ought to progress in the Kingdom so that we can better represent God in the world.\r\nFormula for being Unoffended: 1 Peter 3:8-10\r\n\r\nFinally, be ye all of one mind, having compassion one of another, love as brethren, be pitiful, be courteous: Not rendering evil for evil, or railing for railing: but contrariwise blessing; knowing that ye are thereunto called, that ye should inherit a blessing. For he that will love life, and see good days, let him refrain his tongue from evil, and his lips that they speak no guile.\r\n\r\nIn the Old Testament, when a brother intentionally offends you, an eye for an eye and a tooth for a tooth is legal. However, we have a new covenant in Christ. This time around when we are genuinely mistreated, we are commanded to bless our enemies instead of cursing them and to overcome evil with good because this is how we become Huios of our Father.\r\n1 Peter 4:1 King James Version (KJV)\r\nForasmuch then as Christ hath suffered for us in the flesh, arm yourselves likewise with the same mind: for he that hath suffered in the flesh hath ceased from sin;\r\n\r\n1 Peter 4:1 New Living Translation (NLT)\r\nSo then, since Christ suffered physical pain, you must arm yourselves with the same attitude he had, and be ready to suffer, too. For if you have suffered physically for Christ, you have finished with sin.\r\n\r\nTalk about dying to self. Daily! \r\n\r\nWe get easily offended because we do not train ourselves to suffer. When Jesus was praying in the garden of Gethsemane, I believe that he is arming himself, his mind on how he\'s going to suffer, be betrayed and humiliated. He armed his mind to submit to the Father\'s will and not give in to his flesh.',	'2017-10-04 10:53:03',	'2017-10-04 10:53:03'),
(40987,	1997,	242,	'To meditate on God\'s word so that I can hide it in my heart. And when the opportunity strikes to be blessed by God (through suffering, trials, challenges) my mind is equipped to yield to His will and not my own.\r\n\r\nJoshua 1:8 \r\nThis book of the law shall not depart out of thy mouth; but thou shalt meditate therein day and night, that thou mayest observe to do according to all that is written therein: for then thou shalt make thy way prosperous, and then thou shalt have good success.\r\n\r\nPsalm 119:11\r\nThy word have I hid in mine heart, that I might not sin against thee.',	'2017-10-04 10:53:03',	'2017-10-04 10:53:03'),
(40988,	1997,	243,	'My situation right now looks so ugly. I was able to plead innocent the first time it happened because of my ignorance in His Word. But this time around, I\'m guilty as charged. However, God says that he makes all things beautiful in his time.\r\n\r\nMy conversation with God right now:\r\n\r\nMe: Lord, I failed.\r\nJesus: No, you learned.\r\n\r\nPRAISE GOD!',	'2017-10-04 10:53:03',	'2017-10-04 10:53:03'),
(40989,	3857,	196,	'No man no woman no child no devil can get you out of the will of God.\r\nGod will not violate your decision to go to hell.\r\n\"What God was doing in Joseph those 12 years was developing in him the character for him to handle the leadership He wanted to bring him into.\"',	'2017-10-08 00:34:59',	'2017-10-08 00:34:59'),
(40990,	3857,	197,	'I want to make sure that I don\'t hold my father\'s actions against him. I want to pray for my father when I see him and make an effort to move past all the years of emotional and physical abuse that or family went through because of him. I plan to have faith that Good knows what He\'s doing in my life. I plan to abandon the anxiety that comes with worry and rely on what God is urging me to do. I need to pay!',	'2017-10-08 00:34:59',	'2017-10-08 00:34:59'),
(40991,	3857,	198,	'I worry that my emotions will get the best of me when I see my father face to face. I worry that he won\'t respond how I want him to and I\'m going to lose my cool. I\'m afraid that I\'m going to wait too long and miss my chance because I\'m waiting for conditions to be right.',	'2017-10-08 00:34:59',	'2017-10-08 00:34:59'),
(40992,	263,	3391,	'Home Churches mehod is how the church thrives in most extreme environment and yet continue to prosper even they are not allowed to worship publicly. The private part of care ministry allows the group to grow and expand!\r\nIt is a pity that a non apostolic church is using the apostolic church structure and flourishing (without apostolic truth) whilst the apostolic church who knows and preach the truth is unable to flourish using traditional church structure and struggling.\r\nWe cannot build a church through the pulpit.',	'2017-10-04 18:18:23',	'2017-10-04 18:18:23'),
(40993,	263,	3392,	'Very inspired to know that church can flourish as grow just by having small groups. In the most restricted environment in places like Russia and China, Churches can stilll grow using the care group structure. By seeing progress in my small group, it has validated this small group concept can and will work!!!',	'2017-10-04 18:18:23',	'2017-10-04 18:18:23'),
(40994,	263,	3393,	'Once again shepherd does not never sheeps but sheeps beget sheeps. It is for us to continue to put in the necessary time and resources to see people grow. Although tiring and trying at times, our reward is in heaven. This is to make the blood He shed counts!',	'2017-10-04 18:18:23',	'2017-10-04 18:18:23'),
