(40998,	2002,	3196,	'The Care ministry  allows people to establish relationships with God and to other people in the church.\r\nThe Care ministry opens opportunities for people to have real responsibilities and real in taking care and nurturing people.\r\nThat Shepherd do not produce sheeps but rather sheeps produce sheep.',	'2017-10-04 13:24:46',	'2017-10-04 13:24:46'),
