(41187,	2310,	257,	'that i want to be more hunger in revelation knowledge and have a passion to teach others to cement the foundation on them.',	'2017-10-06 18:12:48',	'2017-10-06 18:12:48'),
(41188,	2310,	258,	'now i know that my prayers are not in vain because i have a communications with a living God, (Jesus) i believe in Him, a sure foundation, i will not haste and He answers.',	'2017-10-06 18:12:48',	'2017-10-06 18:12:48'),
(41189,	3892,	5716,	'We must summit ourselves to God and then we can resist the devil.\r\nWe must fight for our prayer time.\r\nThe key to getting an answer in prayer, is going a little farther. We must keep praying until we press through.',	'2017-10-06 19:34:03',	'2017-10-06 19:34:03'),
(41190,	3892,	5717,	'To pray everything out thoroughly, and keep praying through distractions until I\'m able to focus and press through.',	'2017-10-06 19:34:03',	'2017-10-06 19:34:03'),
(41191,	3892,	5718,	'To be focused in my prayer and make sure I\'m setting aside time daily for prayer.',	'2017-10-06 19:34:03',	'2017-10-06 19:34:03'),
(41192,	3892,	5731,	'We must pray regularly and have a close relationship with Jesus. He wants to know us and for us to know him as a Father.\r\nOur lives and our actions should be always done to glorify the Lord.\r\nOur prayers can be hindered by our actions and relationships with others.',	'2017-10-06 20:11:28',	'2017-10-06 20:11:28'),
(41193,	3892,	5732,	'To live in such a way that it will Glorify Jesus.',	'2017-10-06 20:11:28',	'2017-10-06 20:11:28'),
(41194,	3892,	5733,	'It is so important to remember that we represent Jesus and the kingdom of God and that our lives should reflect that. That our lives are a witness to others.',	'2017-10-06 20:11:28',	'2017-10-06 20:11:28'),
(41195,	2116,	3211,	'There has to be connection of member to member in the body of Christ\r\nSpent time together (house to house); Public gathering\r\nFaithful not only in attendance but also obedient in the apostles\' doctrine',	'2017-10-06 23:45:40',	'2017-10-06 23:45:40'),
(41196,	2116,	3212,	'There has to be connection of member to member in the body of Christ',	'2017-10-06 23:45:40',	'2017-10-06 23:45:40'),
(41197,	2116,	3213,	'What I learned from this lesson was that, in the body of Christ we are all spiritually connected. Mentioning good points about not being faithful in the apostles\' doctrine but  obedience to the Word of God.',	'2017-10-06 23:45:40',	'2017-10-06 23:45:40'),
(41198,	2004,	331,	'Offense need to deal immediately, not let it go too long\r\nThe root of bitterness defile us.\r\nThe way of Absalom handled the offense against his brother and destroyed his life.',	'2017-10-07 09:52:24',	'2017-10-07 09:52:24'),
(41199,	2004,	332,	'Keep going and forgive people who offended me, for the Lord God is in control of my situation.',	'2017-10-07 09:52:24',	'2017-10-07 09:52:24'),
(41200,	2004,	333,	'Bait of Satan, Trap of devil to delay the purpose of God in our life or not to fulfill it',	'2017-10-07 09:52:24',	'2017-10-07 09:52:24'),
(41201,	1997,	301,	'Personal Rights vs. Truth\r\n\r\nJesus offends many people because of the truth that he is teaching to the people. However, he does not want to offend others just so he can exercise his own personal rights. He is God in the flesh and it is his prerogative to assert his rights. Yet, that was not why he came on earth. His mission is to save the lost by teaching the truth and giving his life.\r\nWounding a weak conscience\r\n\r\n1 Corinthians 8:11-12 says, And through thy knowledge shall the weak brother perish, for whom Christ died But when ye sin so against the brethren, and wound their weak conscience, ye sin against Christ.\r\n\r\nIt\'s easy to give in to our flesh when we\'ve been hurt by someone. However, we have a choice. We can either be a Teknon or a Huios. Let\'s choose the latter especially when we\'ve been in the church for many years.\r\nStumble vs. Edify\r\n\r\nOur ultimate priority is to edify our brethren especially those who have legitimately wronged us. If we cause a brethren to stumble the Bible says that it is better for us to be off dropped in the middle of the lake with a millstone around our neck. For we might be the cause of those brethren who are weak in conscience to leave the body and never have eternal life.',	'2017-10-09 07:51:51',	'2017-10-09 07:51:51'),
(41202,	1997,	302,	'To ask God that His grace will abound in me enough to forgive a brother who committed a criminal offence against me. Hence, saving the relationship we have as brethren so as to keep the unity in the body.',	'2017-10-09 07:51:51',	'2017-10-09 07:51:51'),
(41203,	1997,	303,	'Personal rights? After this session, I don\'t have any because I am already rightfully owned by God.',	'2017-10-09 07:51:51',	'2017-10-09 07:51:51'),
(41204,	2004,	346,	'wounds (offenses) never heal overnight\r\nBuild spiritual exercise to build muscles against offenses\r\nA true reconciliation comes from repentance',	'2017-10-07 10:36:11',	'2017-10-07 10:36:11'),
(41205,	2004,	347,	'To intercede for them (offender) like an close relative',	'2017-10-07 10:36:11',	'2017-10-07 10:36:11'),
(41206,	2004,	348,	'Please when we are on  that situation try to be an atmosphere we wanting to achieve when we confront our brother about an offence (Love, Mercy, Forgiveness)',	'2017-10-07 10:36:11',	'2017-10-07 10:36:11'),
(41207,	973,	1231,	'serve them sincerely as you serve Christ. You replace them with Jesus.\r\nWork hard but not just to please your masters when they are watching as slaves of christ, do the will of God with all our heart. work with enthusiasm. as though you were working of the Lord rather than the people.\r\nSlaves do minimum requirement while servants do maximum potentials.\r\nWhen your boss doesn\'t recognise you, you shouldn\'t react, you should act.',	'2017-10-12 17:06:42',	'2017-10-12 17:06:42'),
(41208,	973,	1232,	'to pray for my heart and focus not to be taken by anything else and to always remind myself the purpose of working.',	'2017-10-12 17:06:42',	'2017-10-12 17:06:42'),
(41209,	973,	1233,	'Sometimes I feel stupid to work hard and colleagues look at me as troublesome or too strict colleague because boss will compare them with me and they feel judged. I should remind myself daily that I am not trying to please my boss by flattering or showing the hardworking attitude but I am doing it because it is right things to do and it pleases God and also myself. It is real struggle when we make all small single decisions at work but I am glad that I have been trying for it.',	'2017-10-12 17:06:42',	'2017-10-12 17:06:42'),
(41210,	2004,	3211,	'That the Life does not exist outside the body for life of the flesh in is the blood\r\nMinistry at home that gives more spiritually growth to every one\r\nFood has connection with the fellowship, spiritually bonding effect when gathered together',	'2017-10-14 12:55:47',	'2017-10-14 12:55:47'),
(41211,	2004,	3212,	'To keep in our mind how to plan, execute, reach, disciples and maintained the souls entrusted to us.',	'2017-10-14 12:55:47',	'2017-10-14 12:55:47'),
(41212,	2004,	3213,	'During my early days in Amkor where we had our gathering and meet every Saturday, its was one of my happiness moment in my spiritual growth. We gathered, had bonding, sharing the gospel to the visitors, worshiped and eat with them. that was also the moments I saw how God work within us as one team. Lord Jesus thanks you!',	'2017-10-14 12:55:47',	'2017-10-14 12:55:47'),
(41213,	2116,	3226,	'Maturity is a process in our lives/ Growth takes place overtime\r\nEveryone that received the Holy Ghost should be a teacher to somebody\r\nThe more we give, the more we will get from God',	'2017-10-07 22:58:42',	'2017-10-07 22:58:42'),
(41214,	2116,	3227,	'Everyone that received the Holy Ghost should be a teacher to somebody',	'2017-10-07 22:58:42',	'2017-10-07 22:58:42'),
(41215,	2116,	3228,	'This lesson gives a clear instructions and basing it also with biblical truths about our goal as individuals and as a church. Just as Christ mission to save which was lost, same goes with us because we received the spirit of Christ.',	'2017-10-07 22:58:42',	'2017-10-07 22:58:42'),
(41216,	3828,	5821,	'Just having the same goal while praying together does not constitute \"being of one accord.\" To effectually pray in one accord we must agree in the Spirit and put aside our personal desires. We must come together and flow into the will of God so that Heaven and earth can be moved.\r\nThe Church needs to unify and pray with harmony in the Spirit for the will of Heaven to perform. We must pray for God\'s eternal purpose. We must break through and become the tap so God\'s Spirit can flow out of us to impact this world and eternally affect someone.\r\nGod wants to work harmoniously through the Body of Christ which is His Church. As the members begin to flow together and join with the Spirit of God, the Holy Ghost will reveal to us what to pray for, and this kind of prayer is what produces miracles, signs, and wonders.',	'2017-10-08 15:44:45',	'2017-10-08 15:44:45'),
(41217,	3828,	5822,	'Individually work to deny the flesh and pray for the small personal problems, so that I am better prepared to pray collectively with the Church in the Spirit to serve the primary purpose of God, eternal salvation for all mankind.',	'2017-10-08 15:44:45',	'2017-10-08 15:44:45'),
(41218,	3828,	5823,	'We must place principles above personalities to reach the unity that produces \"one accord.\"',	'2017-10-08 15:44:45',	'2017-10-08 15:44:45'),
(41219,	3803,	181,	'A brother offended is harder to win than a strong city\r\nSea of Galilea - Gives and Takes = Life\nDead Sea - Only takes = Death\r\nThe person that can hurt you the most is the one closest to you',	'2017-10-08 04:03:00',	'2017-10-08 04:03:00'),
(41220,	3803,	182,	'I want the Love of God in my life. I can love others to the point that when they offend me 7 times in a day, I can turn around and forgive them.',	'2017-10-08 04:03:00',	'2017-10-08 04:03:00'),
(41221,	3803,	183,	'Isolation happens within the soul. It\'s a thought process.',	'2017-10-08 04:03:00',	'2017-10-08 04:03:00'),
(41222,	3991,	181,	'We set expectation on people and if they don’t meet it, they offend us.\r\nAn offense is the bait of Satan to capture you\r\nWhen you are offended you are captured by the devil to do his will',	'2017-10-08 04:05:05',	'2017-10-08 04:05:05'),
(41223,	3991,	182,	'Not set high expectation to allow the offense/hurt happen.',	'2017-10-08 04:05:05',	'2017-10-08 04:05:05'),
(41224,	3991,	183,	'We as believers set ourselves for offense because of our expectations. \r\nHe mentioned “Do I really have the right the be offended?” And I go truly want to walk with God- “no I do not have that right”',	'2017-10-08 04:05:05',	'2017-10-08 04:05:05'),
(41225,	3991,	196,	'Offense leads to betrayal\r\nJoseph could have easily entertained the bought of “what if” but nobody can get you out of the will of God\r\nGod word will always come to pass as long as you don’t get offended',	'2017-10-08 04:34:37',	'2017-10-08 04:34:37'),
(41226,	3991,	197,	'Stop trying to think I have it all planned out better than what God has for me, it’s so easy for us to  try to tans in the way',	'2017-10-08 04:34:37',	'2017-10-08 04:34:37'),
(41227,	3991,	198,	'We have to stay obedient to the harvest knowing God is faithful.',	'2017-10-08 04:34:37',	'2017-10-08 04:34:37'),
(41228,	3803,	196,	'I am the only one to destroy the call of God over my life.\r\nJoseph could\'ve easily gotten offended but he made the decision to not get offended. In the end, Joseph turned around a blessed his brothers.\r\nThe people\'s meditate on his word. We have to feed on God\'s faithfulness even if we don\'t see God\'s promise come to pass.',	'2017-10-08 04:37:41',	'2017-10-08 04:37:41'),
(41229,	3803,	197,	'Faint not. I need to keep a reminder in my life that God is faithful through it all. I\'m setting my mind on His faithfulness.',	'2017-10-08 04:37:41',	'2017-10-08 04:37:41'),
(41230,	3803,	198,	'How I handle the opposition in my life will determine my outcome. As long as don\'t get offended God\'s purpose will\nbe done in my life.',	'2017-10-08 04:37:41',	'2017-10-08 04:37:41'),
(41231,	2310,	271,	'that we cannot question God for what He done when He shake the heaven and the earth because it will be His will, for five reasons; to bring closer from foundation, to remove what is dead, to harvest what is ripe, to awaken and to unify or mix together.\r\nthat all in our thoughts are strongholds.\r\nthat we need to be more hunger for God.',	'2017-10-08 16:06:12',	'2017-10-08 16:06:12'),
(41232,	2310,	272,	'that i have a wisdom and discerning in spirit, so i will not be deceive because every good and perfect gift comes down from the Father of lights.',	'2017-10-08 16:06:12',	'2017-10-08 16:06:12'),
(41233,	2310,	273,	'in my thoughts, that when God shakes us and found that you will remain in His sheep yard, i think that we are all assets of God. like the commendation of our Lord Jesus to Peter. and the key for this is do not be offended, for God shakes us whether we like it or not.',	'2017-10-08 16:06:12',	'2017-10-08 16:06:12'),
(41234,	2008,	241,	'When you defend yourself, you forfeited your spiritual right to protection.\r\nWhen you defend yourself, you create an atmosphere in your heart that makes you a prime candidate for offence.\r\nSpiritual growth is not a function of time, not a function of learning, but a function of suffering.I',	'2017-10-12 12:53:13',	'2017-10-12 12:53:13'),
(41235,	2008,	242,	'I will stop defending myself and I will bear in mind that I\'ve got spiritual protection. Other people can say and do everything and anything they want against me, but God knows everything and I know He is using these to prepare me for greater blessings.',	'2017-10-12 12:53:13',	'2017-10-12 12:53:13'),
(41236,	2008,	243,	'I just realized, that I was, at some  point in my life, being beaten from all sides. I tried as much as I can to defend myself, and the more I defended myself, the more I got offended. But now with this lesson, I learned that when being persecuted or unfairly treated, I will just have to pray and rejoice. This way, I am staying in God\'s spiritual protection and avoiding myself from being bitter and more offended.',	'2017-10-12 12:53:13',	'2017-10-12 12:53:13'),
(41237,	2310,	286,	'that God uses offense to uproot which is not planted.\r\nthat Jesus offended many, the pharisees, citizens of his hometown, even his staff and family.\r\nthat believing is an act of obeying, while unbelief is disobedience',	'2017-10-08 18:17:42',	'2017-10-08 18:17:42'),
(41238,	2310,	287,	'to reach the goal of a Christian, to be form in His image',	'2017-10-08 18:17:42',	'2017-10-08 18:17:42'),
(41239,	2310,	288,	'given that Jesus is the rock of offense, but He said that, blessed is he, whosoever shall not be offended in Me. so i love Him so much for sometimes He correct me by His words because He first love us.',	'2017-10-08 18:17:42',	'2017-10-08 18:17:42'),
(41240,	90,	3256,	'We cannot do the work of the Lord alone. Or we will burn out.  All must be involved. God has a work plan for His people.\r\nIn leading, we shouldn\'t be caught up with what we can gain out of it.\nGod raises up those who do the work for Him and not themselves.\r\nGod wanted Moses to spend more time with Him, so he can point them to Him!',	'2017-10-08 18:35:57',	'2017-10-08 18:35:57'),
(41241,	90,	3257,	'I must involve all members of my care group, as far as possible, in the work of the ministry.',	'2017-10-08 18:35:57',	'2017-10-08 18:35:57'),
(41242,	90,	3258,	'This reminds me of the discipleship strategy that Pastor shared: \nI do, you see, we talk\nYou do, I sethink, we talk\nYou do, new disciple see, you all talk\n\nAlso... This reminds me of the importance of personal quality time with God. Spending that time with Him so I\'m connected to Him and therefore able to connect my members to Him.',	'2017-10-08 18:35:57',	'2017-10-08 18:35:57'),
(41243,	2310,	301,	'that we lays down our personal rights or offending somebody for our personal rights and our action will offend somebody.\r\nthat we have not right to judge one another and be not a stumbling block to a brother whose faith are weak.\r\nthat offenses may bring us to grow or stumble. because when we preach the truth, God used it to uproot what is not in Him.',	'2017-10-10 07:53:58',	'2017-10-10 07:53:58'),
(41244,	2310,	302,	'that i want to serve God and my neighbors my whole life until my last breath and not be a stumbling block to my brothers.',	'2017-10-10 07:53:58',	'2017-10-10 07:53:58'),
(41245,	2310,	303,	'every friday, we conduct a discipleship session in alitap, a rural area. the couple whose our brethren would love to prepare a lunch for us, but we suggested not to do this for we thought these thing become burden to them. but they refused for the reason it is the way for them to served God. so we allow them to do what is in their heart and we realized that if we insist, we hinder the opportunity for them to sow. these cause avoid us to offend them.',	'2017-10-10 07:53:58',	'2017-10-10 07:53:58'),
(41246,	2310,	316,	'that the important of forgiveness leads us to salvation and the consequences of unforgiving will cost them their salvation.\r\nthat we forgive even when we unjustly treated.\r\nwe cannot pay off our sins, we deserve help. we deserve to burn in the lake of fire forever. so we need help. and its Jesus who wash away our sins.',	'2017-10-10 17:19:52',	'2017-10-10 17:19:52'),
(41247,	2310,	317,	'that my hope does not disappoint, because the love of God has been poured out in my heart by the Holy Ghost whose in me.',	'2017-10-10 17:19:52',	'2017-10-10 17:19:52'),
(41248,	2310,	318,	'I just want to praise Jesus who testify on me when i have a horse and i gave it to a horseman who\'d like to used it in his farm and for breeding purposes. our agreement is that we have an equal share for every pony produce by my horse but the person i trusted had a motive when there were two ponies are born. he gave to me the one pony and insist to me that the mare is for him now. I got mad on him, and i pray to Jesus that control Him my emotion. and i forgive and pray this man. I was happy on that moment because i gave the pony to the person i trust. and our agreement is to continue the objective to multiply and share the horse for farm use to the needy. and i used to evangelized their family when i went to Cagsiay 3. To God be all the glory!',	'2017-10-10 17:19:52',	'2017-10-10 17:19:52'),
(41249,	90,	3271,	'The Greek original of Ephesians 4:12 does not break up into three segments because there is no use of comma. The five fold ministry is to equip the saints for the work of the ministry and the growth of the Body of Christ/ Church. The purpose of the five fold ministry is not supposed to be split into three parts, but rather seen as ONE.\r\nThe focus of the ministry is not the barn (in the Church). The focus of the ministry is the FIELD!!! Jesus didn\'t tell the sinners to come, but for the saints to go (out)! It was a home-based ministry that began in the first Church.\r\nAsking myself, \"Are my church\'s programs/ are my group\'s programs focused on ministry or facility?\"',	'2017-10-09 15:34:43',	'2017-10-09 15:34:43'),
(41250,	90,	3272,	'Include members in the work of the ministry. Teaching and equipping is one thing, and applying the discipleship strategy is another - both must come hand in hand.',	'2017-10-09 15:34:43',	'2017-10-09 15:34:43'),
(41251,	90,	3273,	'This message just reminds me not to focus on how our building looks - the Church is really all about the people - the Body of Christ! It does not really matter where we go or where we meet. This is why our funding go more into missions (home and overseas) than in renovation of any sort.',	'2017-10-09 15:34:43',	'2017-10-09 15:34:43'),
(41252,	90,	3286,	'The parallels between the natural examples and spiritual principles that God uses as a comparison must be exact, or we won\'t have the most accurate understanding. The parallels must match perfectly! Then we will know if we are doing exactly what God wants us to do.\r\nEach cell is connected to the circulatory system, and each cell receives \"fuel\" from the circulatory system to grow and divide (multiplication of cells).  If they stay connected to the flow, it grows naturally...leading to cell division (multiplication).\n\nEvery cell is connected to every cell around them. Mutually dependent. My eternal salvation is considered mutually dependent on others.\r\nThe father dimension of leadership provides leadership, authority, decision-making, correction and protection. The mother dimension of leadership provides tenderness, emotional support, patient training and nurturing.',	'2017-10-11 19:50:42',	'2017-10-11 19:50:42'),
(41253,	90,	3287,	'I am my brother\'s keeper. I need to remember that, and I have shared responsibility. We should be able to count on each other in the Body of Christ.',	'2017-10-11 19:50:42',	'2017-10-11 19:50:42'),
(41254,	90,	3288,	'Recently I was tempted to cut myself from the flow. But I stuck around and God is showing me again, I believe, the need to stay connected and the love and care and liberty I will have when I do. The mutual dependence.',	'2017-10-11 19:50:42',	'2017-10-11 19:50:42'),
(41255,	2044,	16,	'Anything that takes priority over instantly obeying God is a sin.\r\nDeception is deceiving because you believe that you are right when you are wrong. We can be blind to our ways.\r\nSubmission occurs when there is disagreement. It is easy to be submitted when things are going your way but true submission is when it is against your way and you have to make a decision between the two.',	'2017-10-09 16:46:30',	'2017-10-09 16:46:30'),
(41256,	2044,	17,	'To not just be a hearer of the Word but be a doer of it, applying it daily to my life.',	'2017-10-09 16:46:30',	'2017-10-09 16:46:30'),
(41257,	2044,	18,	'It is good to understand the modus operandi of the devil so that we are able to be stay aware and not fall into his trap',	'2017-10-09 16:46:30',	'2017-10-09 16:46:30'),
(41258,	3890,	46,	'99.9% obedience is still rebellion\r\nSaul deceived himself into believing he followed Gods plan\r\nYou are in trouble when you think you serve God through your rebellion',	'2017-10-09 17:35:30',	'2017-10-09 17:35:30'),
(41259,	3890,	47,	'Your lifestyle speaks louder than your words.  I will stay focused on God and keep a lifestyle of obedience to honor God and to be a living testimony',	'2017-10-09 17:35:30',	'2017-10-09 17:35:30'),
(41260,	3890,	48,	'The #1 commandment of the satanic bible is \"do what you will\".  This one point is enough to make you understand the importance of obedience.',	'2017-10-09 17:35:30',	'2017-10-09 17:35:30'),
(41261,	3892,	5746,	'We are to replace the kingdom of satan with the kingdom of God.\r\nIt is important that we know who\'s side we are on and that we pray and go after the kingdom of satan with 100%. There is no fence walking with the kingdom of God.\r\nWe should never be afraid of satan because we know who our father is. We need to be impacting the world and the environment around us and not the other way around.',	'2017-10-09 22:36:05',	'2017-10-09 22:36:05'),
(41262,	3892,	5747,	'To be available to God by praying for his will to be done. To stand strong in the revelation of who my father is and the power and authority he has given me. Not to be afraid when there is spiritual warfare but to know and trust that God has me covered.',	'2017-10-09 22:36:05',	'2017-10-09 22:36:05'),
(41263,	3892,	5748,	'God desires to do things on the Earth,but he needs us praying and asking. He waits for men to prayer before he acts.',	'2017-10-09 22:36:05',	'2017-10-09 22:36:05'),
(41264,	2044,	31,	'To obey is better than sacrifice\r\nGrace is not the big coverup but grace empowers us to serve Him, to walk in obedience.\r\nDisobedience/rebellion brings God to your level, causes you to lose the fear of God.',	'2017-10-10 04:34:30',	'2017-10-10 04:34:30'),
(41265,	2044,	32,	'To obey God and do His will,  to do what is pleasing in His eyes rather than what we think is pleasing.',	'2017-10-10 04:34:30',	'2017-10-10 04:34:30'),
(41266,	2044,	33,	'It is important that we do not lose the fear of God lest we become full of ourselves, opening door to sin.',	'2017-10-10 04:34:30',	'2017-10-10 04:34:30'),
(41267,	4015,	1186,	'The woman that poured her box of alabaster on Jesus\' feet, gave a full years wage worth of perfume to show how she honored Jesus.\r\nGod disregards those who do not honor him.\r\nThe Roman officer recognized Jesus\' authority and knows that with one word his servant can be healed, just as when he gives a command, those under him obey.',	'2017-10-10 06:45:39',	'2017-10-10 06:45:39'),
(41268,	4015,	1187,	'To honor not only those in authority, but those under me as well.',	'2017-10-10 06:45:39',	'2017-10-10 06:45:39'),
(41269,	4015,	1188,	'The opposite of honor is to view casually.',	'2017-10-10 06:45:39',	'2017-10-10 06:45:39'),
(41270,	1194,	121,	'Our calling is to handle unfair treatment correctly.\r\nHandling unfair treatment correctly develops the character of Christ.\r\nChoose God\'s way and let Him defend you or you can keep justifying yourself.',	'2017-10-10 07:34:39',	'2017-10-10 07:34:39'),
(41271,	1194,	122,	'Whenever I am treated unfairly, I will choose to submit and leave my case in God\'s hands.',	'2017-10-10 07:34:39',	'2017-10-10 07:34:39'),
(41272,	1194,	123,	'Even though Saul treated David unfairly, David still chose to respect Him and not kill him even though he had the opportunity to. He knew he would have to live with the guilt if he did kill him. I want to learn from David. I want to learn to have a submissive attitude towards my authorities even though I may not agree with them but God will judge them accordingly.',	'2017-10-10 07:34:39',	'2017-10-10 07:34:39'),
(41273,	2044,	46,	'Partial obedience is rebellion\r\nIf our sense of right and wrong is derived from our own perspective rather than from God\'s, we might have a twisted understanding of His Word which opens the door for sin into our life.\r\nRepeated disobedience will lead to a seared conscience and a seared conscience will cause us to be deaf to God\'s voice.',	'2017-10-11 08:11:46',	'2017-10-11 08:11:46'),
(41274,	2044,	47,	'To always go back to God\'s Word for a proper understanding of His will for us.',	'2017-10-11 08:11:46',	'2017-10-11 08:11:46'),
(41275,	2044,	48,	'It is important to have someone in our life who is willing and bold enough to speak truth to us, to be God\'s messenger, lest when we get deceived into thinking we are obeying when in fact we are not.',	'2017-10-11 08:11:46',	'2017-10-11 08:11:46'),
(41276,	231,	7371,	'The human race is broken. Suffering is universal.\r\nPeople don’t heal outside of relationship - healing is about repairing an injury we cannot repair on our own.\r\nPeople with support systems do better than people without.',	'2017-10-10 12:53:11',	'2017-10-10 12:53:11'),
(41277,	231,	7372,	'When listening, ask open-ended questions as well as check back to make sure that I heard correctly or have the right understanding of what they said.',	'2017-10-10 12:53:11',	'2017-10-10 12:53:11'),
(41278,	231,	7373,	'This session has forced me to think about the possibility (or rather the inevitability) that I will be a part of someone\'s healing process. In other words, not to be selfish and to allow God to work through me so that someone can move closer towards where God wants them to be.',	'2017-10-10 12:53:11',	'2017-10-10 12:53:11'),
(41279,	231,	7386,	'The extent that we can let go is the extent that we can love well.\r\nWhen we allow reality to win, we cannot lose. You can lose if you fight reality.\r\nLetting go - the negative that is positive. Some relationships will have a season - Eccl 3.',	'2017-10-11 06:37:30',	'2017-10-11 06:37:30'),
(41280,	231,	7387,	'To remember that loving people want to give more than they are given - that is the nature of love. So essentially not to be calculative!',	'2017-10-11 06:37:30',	'2017-10-11 06:37:30'),
(41281,	231,	7388,	'I cannot help but think about Joyce while listening to this and how much she would benefit from hearing this lesson. She has gone through a part of the process described in this lesson but there are some parts about communicating with the person you are letting go (esp. in the case of adultery) that I think would really help her in her thinking and actions towards her husband.',	'2017-10-11 06:37:30',	'2017-10-11 06:37:30'),
(41282,	2310,	331,	'that offense is use by Satan as bait literally the trap of the devil to destroy the believers of God in the last days.\r\nthat a person refused to let go an offense feels that he always owe something to his offender and he want revenge.\r\nthat if we holding on to debt we are holding on to unfulfilled revenge and if the root of offense (bitterness, a seed) watered it will grow and it is destructive.',	'2017-10-11 02:16:31',	'2017-10-11 02:16:31'),
(41283,	2310,	332,	'we cannot avoid offenses, and i want to cut of early the root of bitterness when it is starting sprout in my heart.',	'2017-10-11 02:16:31',	'2017-10-11 02:16:31'),
(41284,	2310,	333,	'yes, I praise Jesus as i testify that forgiving to a horseman who betrayed me. at first, i feel mad at him, but when I forgive, my heart change and i feel sorry for him, then i pray because he need Jesus. he done this things because he did not know Jesus. when i see him, i can talk to him without bitterness, so i thank Jesus that i escape to the trap. again to God be the glory!',	'2017-10-11 02:16:31',	'2017-10-11 02:16:31'),
(41285,	2310,	346,	'that we need to create an atmosphere of reconciliation when we sense the trap of offence operate on us.\r\nthat we need to pray for those who abuse us and intercede for them like a close relative, like David.\r\nthat Jesus forgave us at the cross and when we reconcile back to God is when we are truly repented. and if we are not repented it will bring a barrier separate us from God but still His forgiveness won\'t stop on us. He\'s still waiting!',	'2017-10-11 16:51:15',	'2017-10-11 16:51:15'),
(41286,	2310,	347,	'given that we cannot avoid the offense, i want to be smart on the trap and i must do the first to thing to create an atmosphere of reconciliation. and still remembering that we are a sons of God a peacekeeper.',	'2017-10-11 16:51:15',	'2017-10-11 16:51:15'),
(41287,	2310,	348,	'i thank God to the revelation on this lesson i take, when i talk to God this evening, He said to me that i have to take the first step of reconciliation knowing that he is a baby Christian      and he feels betrayed. I cannot avoid offenses and i prayed to Jesus that our relationship will back again in more harmonious atmosphere. i need His help!',	'2017-10-11 16:51:15',	'2017-10-11 16:51:15'),
(41288,	263,	3406,	'Head is the important portion of a body.\r\nThe Pastor is supposed to the one equipping the sheeps.\r\nThe only thing that is limiting of our church size is our preparation.',	'2017-10-12 16:38:40',	'2017-10-12 16:38:40'),
(41289,	263,	3407,	'It is important to be a sheep who does ministry and willing to stay together with the body to be led by the head (Pastor) to achieve our purpose. Reminder to myself not to be a goat and not get involved in any ministry or being a spectator.',	'2017-10-12 16:38:40',	'2017-10-12 16:38:40'),
(41290,	263,	3408,	'Nil',	'2017-10-12 16:38:40',	'2017-10-12 16:38:40'),
(41291,	2002,	3211,	'To have a real relationship. Look for one another, bear one another, also patient to one another and this must be seen in the body of Christ. No\r\nThat food was connected with fellowship, like what the Apostles did. Their is a bonding effect and it is very essential in the body.\r\nThat there must be a connection of member to member.',	'2017-10-10 23:01:24',	'2017-10-10 23:01:24'),
(41292,	2002,	3212,	'Being faithful and obedient to what the Apostles taught as Jesus also taught them.',	'2017-10-10 23:01:24',	'2017-10-10 23:01:24'),
(41293,	2002,	3213,	'To spend time together as much as possible like eating a meal and be jointly together as one in fellowship. Also, we should love one another.',	'2017-10-10 23:01:24',	'2017-10-10 23:01:24'),
(41294,	2002,	3226,	'A fruitful church is one that has achieved perfection.\r\nThe goal of the ministry should help the church or every individual reached the place of maturity.\r\nThat going to maturity is a process. A process of time.',	'2017-10-10 23:16:22',	'2017-10-10 23:16:22'),
(41295,	2002,	3227,	'Getting involved in reaching out for the lost. As our Lord Jesus came for the lost.',	'2017-10-10 23:16:22',	'2017-10-10 23:16:22'),
(41296,	2002,	3228,	'That we should develop a consistent personal relationship! with the Lord Jesus Christ.',	'2017-10-10 23:16:22',	'2017-10-10 23:16:22'),
(41297,	3828,	5836,	'The Church must be prepared for the revival God is going to send. The harvest is there waiting on us, but are we prepared for what God wants to happen? It would seem as if we are waiting on God, but in fact, God is waiting on us. God is waiting on His Church to be unified in the Spirit and ready to receive the end times revival.\r\nWe are the Body of Christ. We have been given the spirit of wisdom and revelation in the knowledge of him so we can understand the exceeding greatness of his power to us who believe. That we are \"Far Above\" and all things are underneath our feet. Why? Because \"God rich in mercy, quickened us together with Christ, gave us grace, raised us up together to sit in heavenly places in Christ Jesus.\" (Eph.1:17-2:6)\r\nGod wants us to be the voice of His authority. There is a place beyond intercession where the Holy Spirit can pray through us with all authority, commanding the will of God be done. This type of prayer will tear the fabric of the spirit world, it will loose things in the spirit that need to be loosed, and bind things that need to be bound.',	'2017-10-11 13:18:37',	'2017-10-11 13:18:37'),
(41298,	3828,	5837,	'Keep praying the eyes of my understanding be enlightened, that I may know the hope of his calling.',	'2017-10-11 13:18:37',	'2017-10-11 13:18:37'),
(41299,	3828,	5838,	'So much untapped potential and power at our disposal. God waiting on us to become all He created us to be. Thankfully, God has all the time in the world!',	'2017-10-11 13:18:37',	'2017-10-11 13:18:37'),
(41300,	4015,	1201,	'All authority is appointed by God. They may not be Godly, but they are appointed by him.\r\nHonoring authority is honoring God and gives you your full reward.\r\nIt is important to understand authority so you can fully submit to authority.',	'2017-10-11 07:01:15',	'2017-10-11 07:01:15'),
(41301,	4015,	1202,	'To honor and submit full to the authorities above me.',	'2017-10-11 07:01:15',	'2017-10-11 07:01:15'),
(41302,	4015,	1203,	'It is very important to honor authority even when you aren\'t treated with respect.',	'2017-10-11 07:01:15',	'2017-10-11 07:01:15'),
(41303,	231,	3196,	'Shepherds don’t produce sheep, sheep produce sheep.\r\nEwes are the ones to provide milk to the lambs.\r\nFaith that is not demonstrated is not faith. That is our preparation to receive what we are going to receive.',	'2017-10-11 07:14:25',	'2017-10-11 07:14:25'),
(41304,	231,	3197,	'That I can\'t be a part of the body of Christ and expect only to be a receiver. I have to remember that I need to be a functioning member of the church for the body to be healthy.',	'2017-10-11 07:14:25',	'2017-10-11 07:14:25'),
(41305,	231,	3198,	'In relation to the idea that ewes are the ones to provide milk to the lambs -> The shepherd bottle feeds only when there are no healthy ewes.',	'2017-10-11 07:14:25',	'2017-10-11 07:14:25'),
(41306,	1194,	136,	'The Holy Spirit is over the gifitings in your life.\r\nPeople who have aspirations do not have the heart of God or are not ready for the call of God.\r\nEveryone must be tested before they are appointed.',	'2017-10-11 09:18:55',	'2017-10-11 09:18:55'),
(41307,	1194,	137,	'If my leader makes a mistake, I will not shame them or show disrespect to them because they are still appointed by God.',	'2017-10-11 09:18:55',	'2017-10-11 09:18:55'),
(41308,	1194,	138,	'God has call for many of us but not everyone is willing to pay the price to be able to be chosen by God. \r\nHonestly, I have so many things I would love to do in the kingdom of God but I am sometimes not willing to go through the process of it and would try to speed up the process but now I realise that He wants to test me to see if I\'ll be obedient to His calling in my life before I get appointed by Him. Sometimes I elevate my giftings over the Holy Spirit and I want to remember that all that I\'m doing is not to make myself known but is to glory God. Wherever I am now is where God wants me to be and one day, I believe if I stay submitted to my authorities and to Him, I will be appointed.',	'2017-10-11 09:18:55',	'2017-10-11 09:18:55'),
(41309,	231,	3211,	'Fellowship is a bonding time that is absolutely essential and cannot be experienced alone. The only time the member can be alive is when it is connected to the body.\r\nThe only way the blood can be in the individual members of the body, is for it to be connected to the body. There is something that takes place in the spirit that we cannot get on our own.\r\nLove feasts - time to get together and love one another and share a meal.',	'2017-10-11 10:09:01',	'2017-10-11 10:09:01'),
(41310,	231,	3212,	'Using Acts 2:42 as a blueprint and a check for myself - constantly evaluate myself against the Word of God.',	'2017-10-11 10:09:01',	'2017-10-11 10:09:01'),
(41311,	231,	3213,	'When he talked about how the 4 aspects of word, prayer, fellowship and breaking of bread where important, it really helped me to see how that balance is so important in my life (and also how unbalanced it has been all my life!).',	'2017-10-11 10:09:01',	'2017-10-11 10:09:01'),
(41312,	231,	3226,	'Immature person - the whole focus is what they get out of church. It’s all about them.\r\nWhen a wife truly loves her husband, she wants to give him offspring. When we reach the place of maturity, we want to be fruitful.\r\nIf I give it away, it increases my supply.',	'2017-10-11 10:50:26',	'2017-10-11 10:50:26'),
(41313,	231,	3227,	'Change my perspective that church is what I will get out of it.',	'2017-10-11 10:50:26',	'2017-10-11 10:50:26'),
(41314,	231,	3228,	'I can see that this is where Pastor is trying to take us - that church is not about status quo or what we receive.',	'2017-10-11 10:50:26',	'2017-10-11 10:50:26'),
(41315,	1997,	316,	'Category of Sin\r\n\r\nSin has no category. In God\'s eyes, sin is sin. There\'s no big or small sins, serious or slight sins, major or minor sins. \r\n\r\nAll sins can sever our relationship with God. He hates sin for He is holy.\r\nA person who cannot forgive is a person who has forgotten that he had been forgiven.\r\n\r\nJust like the servant in the parable of the unforgiving servant (Matthew 18:23-35), he asked for forgiveness for the unpayable debt that he owes his master and was forgiven. Yet, when this same servant saw his co-servant who owes him a payable debt, he did not forgive him. \r\n\r\nThis wicked servant had forgotten that he had been forgiven much by his master and must do the same with others.\r\nGod has given us the ability to forgive\r\n\r\nRomans 5:5 KJV says, \"And hope maketh not ashamed; because the love of God is shed abroad in our hearts by the Holy Ghost which is given unto us.\" \r\n\r\nAnd in NLT it says, \"And this hope will not lead to disappointment. For we know how dearly God loves us, because he has given us the Holy Spirit to fill our hearts with his love.\"\r\n\r\nForgiveness, just like love is a matter of choice. It is not an excuse for a us to say that it\'s hard to forgive an offender when God has fully equipped us when we received the Holy Ghost to forgive someone.',	'2017-10-12 06:51:02',	'2017-10-12 06:51:02'),
(41316,	1997,	317,	'To see sin as God sees it.',	'2017-10-12 06:51:02',	'2017-10-12 06:51:02'),
(41317,	1997,	318,	'Breaking free from religious traditions\r\n\r\ni understand now why it\'s hard to forgive someone. It\'s because I have had a stronghold. In my previous denomination, I was taught about mortal and venial sins. Mortal sins are grave sins that can lead you to hell. While venial sins are minor sins that are not so severe and cannot sever your relationship with God. So, you can still go to heaven when you die. \r\n\r\nIn my mind, these are not true. But in my heart, these things still exist. Hence, it\'s hard for me to forgive because my heart doesn\'t see sin as God sees it. \r\n\r\nI thank God for the revealed knowledge. It sets me free from the bricks that I\'ve erected for 41 years. Those bricks are all lies. \r\n\r\nNow, I can freely and finally say that i have forgiven my brother. \r\n\r\nI am grateful for God\'s love because this same love that He has shed abroad in my heart when I received the Spirit of Christ gives me the courage to forgive and love again.',	'2017-10-12 06:51:02',	'2017-10-12 06:51:02'),
(41318,	3892,	5761,	'Jesus takes notes of those who pray constantly for his name, kingdom and will to come.   He will cover and protect us.\r\nIt is important to ask Jesus to cover us and our families in his blood to protect us daily.\r\nwhen we are walking in the light we can continually ask God to forgive us and right away be forgiven and we can live in a spirit of victory. His blood is like a fountain continually flowing in our lives.',	'2017-10-11 18:55:55',	'2017-10-11 18:55:55'),
(41319,	3892,	5762,	'To walk in the light with Jesus and have that spirit of victory, To know that I am continually covered by him.',	'2017-10-11 18:55:55',	'2017-10-11 18:55:55'),
(41320,	3892,	5763,	'To ask to for my family and myself to be covered daily in the blood of Jesus, and know that by doing this we can go throughout our day with confidence in prayer and having a spirit of  victory.',	'2017-10-11 18:55:55',	'2017-10-11 18:55:55'),
(41321,	3892,	5776,	'Every night we must ask for forgiveness so we can have a clean conscience to live with boldness before the Lord,\r\nMany people aren\'t able to have faith rise because they have offense in their conscience. It is so important that we forgive others and not hold on to offense so as bitterness will not grow in our conscience.\r\nDon\'t dare to face temptation, but ask the Lord to lead you away from it.',	'2017-10-11 19:39:30',	'2017-10-11 19:39:30'),
(41322,	3892,	5777,	'To live with a clear conscience and to be able to immediately and honestly forgive those who offend me.',	'2017-10-11 19:39:30',	'2017-10-11 19:39:30'),
(41323,	3892,	5778,	'To remember how important it is to forgive others who offend us, so we too can be forgiven. Not only just forgive, but also pray blessings for them.',	'2017-10-11 19:39:30',	'2017-10-11 19:39:30'),
(41324,	3892,	5791,	'We need to have a good relationship with God and with our brothers and sisters.\r\nWe are anointed and given power by Jesus and we must release or let the power flow through us.\r\nThe spirit of God can flow all over now because there are many locations in the body of Christ. The same spirit working in multiple places.',	'2017-10-11 20:13:36',	'2017-10-11 20:13:36'),
(41325,	3892,	5792,	'To know the power Jesus has placed in me and to like  open the tap and let his spirit  flow. I don\'t want to limit what God wants to do. I want to believe him for it and know that he has given me power to do greater works.',	'2017-10-11 20:13:36',	'2017-10-11 20:13:36'),
(41326,	3892,	5793,	'To be obedient and willing to listen to the call and will of Jesus in my life.',	'2017-10-11 20:13:36',	'2017-10-11 20:13:36'),
(41327,	1997,	331,	'Bitterness\r\n\r\nBitterness is when there is a debt that has not been satisfied. It is an unfulfilled revenge.  We are instructed in the Bible to examine our hearts for any bitterness because it can defile us.\r\nJesus forgave us\r\n\r\nJesus did not wait to hear us say that we are sorry. He already forgave us even before we say we are sorry.\r\nHoly\r\n\r\n I Peter 1:16 says, Because it is written, Be ye holy; for I am holy. Holy means cut above. God is commanding His children to come up to His level of thinking and living. As pilgrims of this world, we are commanded to not to be conformed to this world. Instead, we must allow God to transform us by the way we think, speak and act.',	'2017-10-12 13:38:33',	'2017-10-12 13:38:33'),
(41328,	1997,	332,	'To ask God to check if there\'s any bitterness in my heart against someone.',	'2017-10-12 13:38:33',	'2017-10-12 13:38:33'),
(41329,	1997,	333,	'True forgiveness\r\n\r\nForgiveness is not lip service. True forgiveness is when you do not demand for an apology, that you are giving that person a clean slate again knowing the fact that you\'ll get hurt again someday.',	'2017-10-12 13:38:33',	'2017-10-12 13:38:33'),
(41330,	4015,	1216,	'The only time you don\'t obey the law is when the law tells you to sin.\r\nThe fear of the Lord recognizes authority and gives respect to them.\r\nAs believers, we are to go above the law and exceed the expectations',	'2017-10-12 07:25:24',	'2017-10-12 07:25:24'),
(41331,	4015,	1217,	'To pray and give thanks to my civil authorities',	'2017-10-12 07:25:24',	'2017-10-12 07:25:24'),
(41332,	4015,	1218,	'The will of God will take place in the midst of a harsh leader when you honor them.',	'2017-10-12 07:25:24',	'2017-10-12 07:25:24'),
(41333,	231,	3241,	'God is not reluctant to give us growth. Jesus died to give us growth! Is the reason why we are not growing because we are not preparing to grow\r\nYou can’t have growth if you don’t want change. If you don’t want growth, you don’t know Jesus.\r\nIf you don’t get the older children involved with the newborns, then they leave because they feel neglected.',	'2017-10-12 11:28:23',	'2017-10-12 11:28:23'),
(41334,	231,	3242,	'There has to be preparation. A pregnant woman prepares - the whole family prepares! So I need to be prepared, even if it is just mentally knowing that I at least have to be a sibling that is involved with the birth and growth of a new born.',	'2017-10-12 11:28:23',	'2017-10-12 11:28:23'),
(41335,	231,	3243,	'-',	'2017-10-12 11:28:23',	'2017-10-12 11:28:23'),
(41336,	231,	3256,	'God has a work plan for His people\r\nBurn out is a sign that you are working without God\r\nHating covetousness - serving without personal gain',	'2017-10-12 11:59:46',	'2017-10-12 11:59:46'),
(41337,	231,	3257,	'To recognise that burnout is a sign that God is out of the equation',	'2017-10-12 11:59:46',	'2017-10-12 11:59:46'),
(41338,	231,	3258,	'This video helped me see Exodus 18 in a new light. I had not thought of Moses\' leadership style as detrimental to the people as well, I had only thought that he was the only one \"suffering\".',	'2017-10-12 11:59:46',	'2017-10-12 11:59:46'),
(41339,	231,	3271,	'The church of the book of acts is a home-based ministry\r\nThe 5 fold gifting is not given to conduct services\r\nWhen we draw people to a facility, we are not drawing them to Christ',	'2017-10-12 12:22:24',	'2017-10-12 12:22:24'),
(41340,	231,	3272,	'When teaching UTB, to give a more accurate picture of what the apostolic church is supposed to look like compared to traditional church.',	'2017-10-12 12:22:24',	'2017-10-12 12:22:24'),
(41341,	231,	3273,	'It feels like every time a new work is started or a new disciple is made, we need to also help them to unlearn the concept and idea of a church because it is unbiblical and will get in the way of growth.',	'2017-10-12 12:22:24',	'2017-10-12 12:22:24'),
(41342,	231,	3286,	'Gestation period (9 months) - faith working in a new believer before they are born again.\r\nThe NT church should parallel the human body in every respect. Where is life taking place in your congregation?\r\nThe structure of the traditional church has been that of a single-parent family.',	'2017-10-12 13:01:30',	'2017-10-12 13:01:30'),
(41343,	231,	3287,	'New believers need to be acquainted with both the father and mother dimension of the church. Teaching new believers goes beyond UTB. It really is about teaching them about and how to interact in the systems and structure of the body of Christ.',	'2017-10-12 13:01:30',	'2017-10-12 13:01:30'),
(41344,	231,	3288,	'I feel like I am getting such a clear idea of where pastor is going with what we are doing in Hyphen! The detailed breakdown of the cell and the systems in a body really help.',	'2017-10-12 13:01:30',	'2017-10-12 13:01:30'),
(41345,	2008,	256,	'Revealed knowledge (revelation) is more powerful and enduring than sense knowledge-which will cause you to be stable.\r\nTwo different people can receive the same message but only one who is hungry can receive Revelation.\r\nTwo different people can receive the same message but only one who is hungry can receive Revelation.',	'2017-10-14 11:32:31',	'2017-10-14 11:32:31'),
(41346,	2008,	257,	'I will be more hungry and passionate for God, I will try to pray  more to hear more from Him and receive more revelations from Him.',	'2017-10-14 11:32:31',	'2017-10-14 11:32:31'),
(41347,	2008,	258,	'We have to obey what has been revealed to us. Willingness to obey attracts greater revelation, because obedience shows our passion for God.  More we are passionate for Him, the more our hearts are open and ready for more of Him...',	'2017-10-14 11:32:31',	'2017-10-14 11:32:31'),
(41348,	1997,	346,	'Strong in the Spirit\r\n\r\nWhen we are strong physically, we don\'t get sick or injured easily. Consequently, when we are spiritually strong, we don\'t get offended easily.\r\nPsalms 35:11-14\r\n\r\n11 Malicious witnesses testify against me.\r\n    They accuse me of crimes I know nothing about.\r\n12 They repay me evil for good.\r\n    I am sick with despair.\r\n13 Yet when they were ill, I grieved for them.\r\n    I denied myself by fasting for them,\r\n    but my prayers returned unanswered.\r\n14 I was sad, as though they were my friends or family,\r\n    as if I were grieving for my own mother.\r\n\r\nWe must pray for those who have offended us as though they are our families. Our prayer ought to be with passion, conviction and consistency. Until such time that  we are free from our hurt.\r\nReconciliation\r\n\r\nReconciliation involves repentance and acknowledgement that one is sorry for causing an offence. There\'s no reconciliation when there is no repentance. Repentance means a change of heart and mind. A willingness to change.',	'2017-10-12 15:17:54',	'2017-10-12 15:17:54'),
(41349,	1997,	347,	'To keep in mind Psalms 35: 11-15 and that is to pray for those who offend you as if they are your relatives.',	'2017-10-12 15:17:54',	'2017-10-12 15:17:54'),
(41350,	1997,	348,	'What you do with an offence will determine your future.\r\n\r\nI\'ve chosen to be free from offence. I am not willing to be separated from God\'s love because of holding on to an offence. I chose not to be bitter. Instead, I\'ve chosen to be a better disciple of Jesus.\r\n\r\nI thank God for this course. It causes me to repent and be liberated from the bait of satan.',	'2017-10-12 15:17:54',	'2017-10-12 15:17:54'),
(41351,	973,	1246,	'We should never allow somebody else’s wrong behaviour to affect us.\r\nMoses could not go into the promise land because of what people did not because of what he did. when people did wrong it caused Moses to do wrong as well.\r\nYou can be a 100% right in your assessment of the situation, but be a 100% wrong in your response.',	'2017-10-12 18:04:30',	'2017-10-12 18:04:30'),
(41352,	973,	1247,	'I think I am listening to parents most of time but I need to learn showing the heart of honour and respect more expressively so that they can see Jesus through me.',	'2017-10-12 18:04:30',	'2017-10-12 18:04:30'),
(41353,	973,	1248,	'Whatever happens to us, we shouldn\'t let it affect us to be strayed. We will react in our old ways but we should keep reminding that God in us has transformed us so when we don\'t lose our focus, we can overcome our flesh and God will help us to honour the authority.',	'2017-10-12 18:04:30',	'2017-10-12 18:04:30'),
(41354,	2310,	1,	'that under cover is the one who abide under the shadow of Almighty, the one who is in a place of refuge, a shelter, a place of protection.\r\nthat if we have truly come to know the Lord we have come to know his authority. that\'s why God and his authority is inseparable.\r\nthat if we resists authority, we are resisting God. because the all authority that exist are appointed by God.',	'2017-10-12 17:56:10',	'2017-10-12 17:56:10'),
(41355,	2310,	2,	'that i want to be subject to the authority at all times. i want freedom and be submissive to authority.',	'2017-10-12 17:56:10',	'2017-10-12 17:56:10'),
(41356,	2310,	3,	'i am ashamed to God because i am the one who will violating authority. and i thank Him now for this lesson. and i am now committing idolatry, i am very sorry to the Lord. and i need him to clear all my shortcomings. I pray to our Lord Jesus that i get my drivers license and registration of motor this year. and all of the requirements needed for business. as of now i am going to walk or commute.',	'2017-10-12 17:56:10',	'2017-10-12 17:56:10'),
(41357,	90,	3301,	'Shepherds do not produce sheep. Only sheep begat sheep. \r\nShepherds take care of the sheep. But they do not feed the lambs. The sheep fed the lambs! \r\n\r\nThe Body teaches the new converts.\r\nTraining and multiplying is of essence... to mentor and equip other saints... that\'s how we reach the harvest!!!\r\nIf the father dimension of leadership doesn\'t train and release the mother dimension of leadership to ministry, the bottom line is that the father dimension doesn\'t trust the mother dimension - and it leads to offence. \r\n\r\nBut looking at Bible examples - Priscilla and Aquilla are examples of saints who were probably not in father dimension of leadership, but mother dimension, and they had powerful ministry.\r\n\r\nOften, the mother\'s nurturing is more needed in the growth of a child from 0-12, but once the child hits puberty, the roles reverse and the father\'s leadership is more needed.',	'2017-10-14 04:49:21',	'2017-10-14 04:49:21'),
(41358,	90,	3302,	'\"love is not what you get but what you give\"',	'2017-10-14 04:49:21',	'2017-10-14 04:49:21'),
(41359,	90,	3303,	'This lesson just triggered a reminder in me, to ponder if I have the \"fivefold ministry\" in my life as in, people who influence me and speak into my life in those roles. Something I should throw out to ask my hyphen group too.',	'2017-10-14 04:49:21',	'2017-10-14 04:49:21'),
(41360,	2310,	16,	'that lawlessness is the condition of being without law, because of ignoring it or because of violating it. and it\'s fearful to be disobedient and shame to the Lord.\r\nthat sin, is simply means not to submit to the law or authority of God, to violate God\'s authority is to disobey God, but the authority of God is based on his righteousness and goodness, so i love truth and i want to obey.\r\nthat because of deception of lawlessness people will not love the truth. they are love themselves rather than God, and the deception enter into the heart of men because they are not doer\'s of God\'s word but hearers only.',	'2017-10-12 20:15:14',	'2017-10-12 20:15:14'),
(41361,	2310,	17,	'be doer of the word, and not hearer only. i don\'t want to deceive myself.',	'2017-10-12 20:15:14',	'2017-10-12 20:15:14'),
(41362,	2310,	18,	'Satan is clever. but his power is deception. my God is victorious and He revealed His word to me. I thank Him so much! this lessons are full of revelation.  and now i know the key to escape to the trap of deception is to obeying or doing God\'s word.',	'2017-10-12 20:15:14',	'2017-10-12 20:15:14'),
(41363,	3892,	5806,	'It is important for the church to exercise the authority that God has given them.\r\nGod has placed a burden of prayer on his people and they way to lessen the burden is to pray. We need to pray as soon as we start to feel the burden of prayer.\r\nThe church holds the keys to binding satan\'s works and loosing his prisoners.',	'2017-10-12 20:38:26',	'2017-10-12 20:38:26'),
(41364,	3892,	5807,	'To be sensitive to the burden of prayer and pray when I first feel it. Not to let it build up.',	'2017-10-12 20:38:26',	'2017-10-12 20:38:26'),
(41365,	3892,	5808,	'To truly understand the importance of using the authority God has given us, and to use it the way he intended his church to use it.',	'2017-10-12 20:38:26',	'2017-10-12 20:38:26'),
(41366,	3848,	256,	'The revealed knowledge of Christ kept Peter from leaving Christ.\r\nGod will build his church on the revealed word of God.\r\nGod is drawn to hunger (people hungry fir God and his word).',	'2017-10-13 03:45:23',	'2017-10-13 03:45:23'),
(41367,	3848,	257,	'Stay hungry for God. Pray without ceasing.',	'2017-10-13 03:45:23',	'2017-10-13 03:45:23'),
(41368,	3848,	258,	'No',	'2017-10-13 03:45:23',	'2017-10-13 03:45:23'),
(41369,	3848,	271,	'The devil will get your eye off of what you can do to what you cant do. He will make God look like the taker not the giver.\r\nThe spirit is always willing but our flesh is weak.\r\nBe rooted in the left ve of God so we are not easily offended.',	'2017-10-13 04:25:38',	'2017-10-13 04:25:38'),
(41370,	3848,	272,	'Overcome being weak in the flesh to being strong in spirit.',	'2017-10-13 04:25:38',	'2017-10-13 04:25:38'),
(41371,	3848,	273,	'No',	'2017-10-13 04:25:38',	'2017-10-13 04:25:38'),
(41372,	3848,	286,	'Gods word will always come to pass as long as we dont get offended.\r\nBelieve means to obey.  Unbelief is not to obey.\r\nGrace is not a coverup for disobedience.',	'2017-10-13 05:06:26',	'2017-10-13 05:06:26'),
(41373,	3848,	287,	'Obey the word of God.',	'2017-10-13 05:06:26',	'2017-10-13 05:06:26'),
(41374,	3848,	288,	'Obedience is better than sacrifice.',	'2017-10-13 05:06:26',	'2017-10-13 05:06:26'),
(41375,	4015,	1231,	'The fear of the Lord produces true honor\r\nA servant does the maximum potential.\r\nHonoring your social authorities can not only minister to them, but also to others that observe.',	'2017-10-13 06:56:27',	'2017-10-13 06:56:27'),
(41376,	4015,	1232,	'To go beyond what is required and asked of me.',	'2017-10-13 06:56:27',	'2017-10-13 06:56:27'),
(41377,	4015,	1233,	'God will back  you up when you honor even though you\'ve been dishonored.',	'2017-10-13 06:56:27',	'2017-10-13 06:56:27'),
(41378,	233,	3436,	'Care ministry spread out workload and responsibilities among the saints. This is God\'s concept so that the pastor will not burn out.\r\nTrue fellowship yields unity that gives stability to the church. The church is then able to survive despite a big crisis.\r\nThe benefit of oversight is the saints are trusted and given the opportunity to serve.',	'2017-10-13 08:42:20',	'2017-10-13 08:42:20'),
(41379,	233,	3437,	'I endeavor to be a good parent so that with training and oversight, I can serve the kingdom.',	'2017-10-13 08:42:20',	'2017-10-13 08:42:20'),
(41380,	233,	3438,	'Na',	'2017-10-13 08:42:20',	'2017-10-13 08:42:20'),
(41381,	231,	3301,	'Single parent families are not as healthy - dysfunctional.\r\nThe term shepherd appears more often than pastor.\r\nEach infant needs personal attention! It’s about the personal touch, love and being held. In addition to the “food”.',	'2017-10-13 09:52:28',	'2017-10-13 09:52:28'),
(41382,	231,	3302,	'To remember that as the bride of Christ, I am expected to be constantly ready to be a spiritual mom',	'2017-10-13 09:52:28',	'2017-10-13 09:52:28'),
(41383,	231,	3303,	'I know I said this the last time, but I get why pastor is sometimes frustrated with us now! He is trying to get us to be more and more like spiritual \"ewes\".',	'2017-10-13 09:52:28',	'2017-10-13 09:52:28'),
(41384,	231,	3316,	'Churches full of cliques have no unity.\r\nIf your relationship with God is all about yourself, you also end up being judgmental of others.\r\nYou can’t have growth in harvest without unity. You can’t have unity with koinonia. You can’t have koinonia without your structure providing for it.',	'2017-10-13 12:39:03',	'2017-10-13 12:39:03'),
(41385,	231,	3317,	'Not to have a clique-mentality.',	'2017-10-13 12:39:03',	'2017-10-13 12:39:03'),
(41386,	231,	3318,	'I think as a church, we do well to love people who have different interests or of a different ethnicity. However what Bishop Wright said about people form different social classes (low income, middle class etc.) really stood out to me. Am I able to be in unity and have koinonia with people who have different lifestyles than I because of their financial situation? I want to say yes, but the truth is that I really do not know because that has not really happened yet.',	'2017-10-13 12:39:03',	'2017-10-13 12:39:03'),
(41387,	2044,	76,	'You don\'t fear God unless you submit to authority\r\nGod will send you something you need in a package you do not want\r\nnil',	'2017-10-13 12:33:08',	'2017-10-13 12:33:08'),
(41388,	2044,	77,	'To honour all authority that God has placed in my life',	'2017-10-13 12:33:08',	'2017-10-13 12:33:08'),
(41389,	2044,	78,	'It is difficult to honour someone who said something which is not pleasing even if it\'s edifying, that is the real test comes, will you give honour or complain',	'2017-10-13 12:33:08',	'2017-10-13 12:33:08'),
(41390,	2116,	3241,	'The larger intended building, the solid the foundation must be\r\nCare ministry is more than a program, much more than a method of church growth. It is God\'s plan for revival for the end time church\r\nWe are not growing because we are not preparing to grow',	'2017-10-13 21:38:35',	'2017-10-13 21:38:35'),
(41391,	2116,	3242,	'Care ministry is more than a program, much more than a method of church growth. It is God\'s plan for revival for the end time church',	'2017-10-13 21:38:35',	'2017-10-13 21:38:35'),
(41392,	2116,	3243,	'This lesson gives a clear understanding of what  Care Ministry is all about. It involves the body of Christ, us saints in ministering to one another specially in a home setting. Reminding each of us (every individual/saints) to grow, be ready/prepared and relatively the church will grow also.',	'2017-10-13 21:38:35',	'2017-10-13 21:38:35'),
(41393,	3848,	301,	'When you sin against a weak brother and wound their weak conscience you sin against God.\r\nWhen we speak the truth we will offend peopl just like Jesus did.\r\nOur priority should be not to offened even if something may be our right.',	'2017-10-14 03:27:36',	'2017-10-14 03:27:36'),
(41394,	3848,	302,	'Serve one another through love.',	'2017-10-14 03:27:36',	'2017-10-14 03:27:36'),
(41395,	3848,	303,	'No',	'2017-10-14 03:27:36',	'2017-10-14 03:27:36'),
(41396,	3848,	316,	'We all deserve hell but God chose to forgive us.\r\nA person in the church who refuses to forgive, it will cost them their salvation.\r\nMark 11:25 forgive that your Father will forgive you.',	'2017-10-14 04:04:51',	'2017-10-14 04:04:51'),
(41397,	3848,	317,	'Be forgiving when someone offends or trespasses against me.',	'2017-10-14 04:04:51',	'2017-10-14 04:04:51'),
(41398,	3848,	318,	'No',	'2017-10-14 04:04:51',	'2017-10-14 04:04:51'),
(41399,	3848,	331,	'Dont seek revenge. God said vengeance is mine I will repay.\r\nJesus forgave us before we ever said sorry. Dont wait for an apology to forgive someone.\r\nUnfulfilled revenge can destroy your life and lead to bitterness.',	'2017-10-14 04:47:03',	'2017-10-14 04:47:03'),
(41400,	3848,	332,	'Dont give place to bitterness. Be forgiving.',	'2017-10-14 04:47:03',	'2017-10-14 04:47:03'),
(41401,	3848,	333,	'No',	'2017-10-14 04:47:03',	'2017-10-14 04:47:03'),
(41402,	90,	3316,	'Correlation between true fellowship and unity - that leads to revival. \r\n\r\nKoinonia - translates to fellowship (referring to our horizontal relationships) or communion (referring to our vertical relationship with God)\r\n\r\nOur horizontal and vertical relationships are mutually dependent on each other. (1 John 4)\r\nIf we stick to our cliques and never venture out to interact with people who have differences, we don\'t learn to love one another - because its easy to like people like you, but it is only when we are difference are we given a choice to choose to love. If we only stick with people who are similar to us we don\'t achieve true fellowship and thus no true unity. If we never work on loving horizontal relationships, it is possible to become judgemental because we never learn to practice compassion and forgiveness on others.\r\nTrue unity is a miracle of God, but only happens if we make room for it through true fellowship.',	'2017-10-14 05:49:40',	'2017-10-14 05:49:40'),
(41403,	90,	3317,	'Step out of my clique to love and accept others who are different from me - people who have different interests, different ways of speaking, different backgrounds, different style, different hobbies... God, lead me to show compassion on the people you want me to reach out to, whether it is within or without the Church.',	'2017-10-14 05:49:40',	'2017-10-14 05:49:40'),
(41404,	90,	3318,	'Discover Destiny session last night was on this very topic!!!!!',	'2017-10-14 05:49:40',	'2017-10-14 05:49:40'),
(41405,	3848,	346,	'We are reconciled when we repent\r\n1 Peter 4:8 love will cover a multitude of sins\r\nPray for those who may offend us and forgive them.',	'2017-10-14 05:32:01',	'2017-10-14 05:32:01'),
(41406,	3848,	347,	'Use spiritual exercise and pray for those who abuse us.',	'2017-10-14 05:32:01',	'2017-10-14 05:32:01'),
(41407,	3848,	348,	'This series was awesome and really opened my eyes to a greater understanding of offense and how satan uses it to destroy us and seperate us from God.',	'2017-10-14 05:32:01',	'2017-10-14 05:32:01'),
(41408,	90,	3331,	'God\'s goal for us is to be mature - in order to be which, we have to be fruitful. \r\n\r\nWhat is the atmosphere in my life, church and ministry where koinonia can come about?  How can we have koinonia such that we can achieve unity which promotes love and accomplishes edification and growth in the body, so that it can bring about revival?\r\nWhen a person\'s joint is injured, it is hard to function. \r\nWhen a church has pain in its joints (relationship), the Body is not going to be able to function properly.\r\nBeing one with God and being one with each other is not a \"either/or\" but it is essential to have BOTH.',	'2017-10-14 07:16:45',	'2017-10-14 07:16:45'),
(41409,	90,	3332,	'Don\'t compare - when I\'m in competition with anyone for position/recognition, I can\'t be in unity with him/her/the Body and I can\'t please God because I am carnal and not spiritual.. \r\nI have a specific place in the Body. I can\'t do what he/she does and vice versa.',	'2017-10-14 07:16:45',	'2017-10-14 07:16:45'),
(41410,	90,	3333,	'Check my motives. Let my motives be purified, Lord.\r\n\r\nTo be careful with how I act and speak with my members - to not make comparing a habit/culture. But focus on our different roles and functions/places in the Body and how we can work together to fitly form the full picture like pieces to a jigsaw puzzle.',	'2017-10-14 07:16:45',	'2017-10-14 07:16:45'),
(41411,	90,	3346,	'The reason why people are not teaching / still babes / not maturing: \r\n\r\nNew Testament examples of ministry:\r\n1. The forerunner ministry: like John the Baptist. The one who prepares the way of the Lord in our lives. He preached; proclaimed the good news - brings us to a place of repentance. Proclamation!\r\n2. The Relational ministry: like Jesus. Proclaiming/preaching will not bring someone to maturity, teaching does. Jesus had a teaching ministry. He was more a teacher than he ever was a preacher (only mentioned once in Scriptures that He said he is sent to preach the gospel to the poor) He was an explainer.\r\nImmature saints have to be entertained and don\'t want to be committed to anything and not willing to give of themselves to the Church or to the lost.\r\nJesus set the example of ministry for all who would follow Him. \r\n\r\nTraining is what Jesus did when He sent them (his disciples) out - He coaches them, He taught them (how)\r\n\r\nA disciple also means a follower, one who has a relationship with the one he/she follows.',	'2017-10-14 07:55:35',	'2017-10-14 07:55:35'),
(41412,	90,	3347,	'Don\'t shame into getting people to commit and do the work of the ministry, but TRAIN them into doing it - nobody wants to fail at something and make a fool out of themselves if they don\'t know how to. So, we gotta teach them and train them if we want them to participate! We gotta guide them as they do it so they know HOW to do it.',	'2017-10-14 07:55:35',	'2017-10-14 07:55:35'),
(41413,	90,	3348,	'So, teaching is imparting the WHAT, and training is practising the HOW?',	'2017-10-14 07:55:35',	'2017-10-14 07:55:35'),
(41414,	90,	3361,	'John was a preacher to crowds and Jesus was a teacher to individuals. Jesus was a patient, determined and compassionate teacher.\r\n\r\nHe went to where the individuals were... He didn\'t wait around for people to come to him. He went to them.\r\nIt may take more work and effort and preparation to teach, but that is exactly the kind of ministry Jesus exemplified for us to reach out to the lost.\r\nThe contrast between John and Jesus\' ministry. The revelation that a lot of how churches operate are more like John\'s than Jesus - and that is new to me. \r\n\r\nBut I see how TJ is moving towards operating more Jesus-like and I\'m comforted to know the direction is scripture-based and worth being committed to and a part of it :)',	'2017-10-14 10:57:50',	'2017-10-14 10:57:50'),
(41415,	90,	3362,	'To go... go to the people.',	'2017-10-14 10:57:50',	'2017-10-14 10:57:50'),
(41416,	90,	3363,	'I think God has been opening doors for me and allowing me to touch base with more people to reach out to :) I just gotta to continue to be faithful and intentional. AND to look out for more - because not everyone seems ready.',	'2017-10-14 10:57:50',	'2017-10-14 10:57:50'),
(41417,	90,	3376,	'We are God\'s ambassadors to reconcile people to God. We have received the ministry of reconciliation and word of reconciliation. We are the expression of the saviour (not the saviour)\r\nThis reminds me of a word that Bro DB told me long ago - ministry is not something so big, so don\'t be scared. To minster to someone is basically helping them get one step closer to God from where they started (aka a step toward reconciliation)\r\nPower without restriction can be dangerous. Like a river that brings benefits, but when the water overflows its banks...it can be dangerous. Ministry must have a conduit to flow through. There must be an apostolic strcuture set in place. \r\n\r\nPeople cannot just be released to go do whatever without accountability or training or oversight.\r\nWe have to make plans for the people not only to freely receive, but also to freely give. If we don\'t do so, and without plans to let them give out...they will be dissatisfied and eventually leave.',	'2017-10-14 11:49:57',	'2017-10-14 11:49:57'),
(41418,	90,	3377,	'The third point above.... to make more plans for my hyphen members to serve and give out.',	'2017-10-14 11:49:57',	'2017-10-14 11:49:57'),
(41419,	90,	3378,	'I think the second point stood out to me, about how saints who are not given opportunity or training to give out, will eventually be dissatisfied and find their place outside of the Church and leave...',	'2017-10-14 11:49:57',	'2017-10-14 11:49:57'),
(41420,	90,	3391,	'It\'s not about a large following. It\'s about making disciples.\r\nThe information about Wesley\'s movement and how his strategies and structures were apostolic was revelatory !!! I\'ve not really researched about that strand of Church history. \r\n\r\nBoth biblically and historically, home groups (strategy) is in our roots.\r\nPersecution forced Russians and Chinese to set up home churches/groups and their apostolic movement flourished.\r\n\r\nThe testimony of how Korean pastor Cho\'s use of apostolic structure (home group ministry) flourished with great use of organisation.',	'2017-10-14 12:40:20',	'2017-10-14 12:40:20'),
(41421,	90,	3392,	'Minister to other saints and to unbelievers knowing that I can help to fulfill the mother dimension of leadership in the church. \r\n\r\nHave a \"let\'s do this\" attitude!',	'2017-10-14 12:40:20',	'2017-10-14 12:40:20'),
(41422,	90,	3393,	'We can be limited by our own facility.',	'2017-10-14 12:40:20',	'2017-10-14 12:40:20'),
(41423,	2004,	3226,	'average of apostolics preaching and teaching is just repeating the foundation over and over again. not focus on maturity or advancement of the ministry\r\n. A key sign of a mature Christian is one who give\r\nThe goal of the ministry should be to help people and the Church reach maturity, completeness and fruitfulness',	'2017-10-14 13:37:55',	'2017-10-14 13:37:55'),
(41424,	2004,	3227,	'to share what God entrust to me, so He will give more to me',	'2017-10-14 13:37:55',	'2017-10-14 13:37:55'),
(41425,	2004,	3228,	'Truly, our experiences whether its up or down made us to be achieved our maturity in ministry. some points also need to pressured us to reveal our inner mind or thougths.',	'2017-10-14 13:37:55',	'2017-10-14 13:37:55'),
(41426,	2008,	271,	'What you bring to the light is under the man of the light. What you keep hidden in the dark is under the man of darkness.\r\nStrongholds are thoughts. Each thought is like a brick to let the devil build a place that he can inhabit.\r\nPride attracts the enemy.',	'2017-10-14 13:15:35',	'2017-10-14 13:15:35'),
(41427,	2008,	272,	'I will break every stronghold (thoughts) that feed my pride. I will guard my thoughts as much as I can so as not to build walls of strongholds and so I may avoid the devil from inhabiting in me.',	'2017-10-14 13:15:35',	'2017-10-14 13:15:35'),
(41428,	2008,	273,	'We have to put on the whole armour of God to break every stronghold that is overtaking our lives. As we continue to hunger to know God and to have passion for God, the more our faith is built and the more those strongholds are broken down.',	'2017-10-14 13:15:35',	'2017-10-14 13:15:35'),
(41429,	90,	3406,	'\"Pastor\" is synonymous with \"shepherd\" so we must remember that sheep follows the shepherd, and it is important we follow the pastor that God has given over us. \r\n\r\nShepherds lead sheep, and herd goats.\r\nShepherds do not begat sheep, they lead sheep. They equip sheep in the five-fold ministry. The pastor is a preparer to the sheep.\r\nWhat good is a great outpouring if we are not equipped for the harvest? We are not prepared! \r\n\r\nWhat limits us is our lack of preparation.',	'2017-10-14 13:16:55',	'2017-10-14 13:16:55'),
(41430,	90,	3407,	'Give to others like unto giving to God. It matters how I treat and care for the needy, even if not in a church setting or \"Bible study\" setting or with intentions to minister using the Word. It matters if I visit the sick, if I give unto the poor, because by doing so I minister unto the Lord. :)',	'2017-10-14 13:16:55',	'2017-10-14 13:16:55'),
(41431,	90,	3408,	'Make preparation a daily thing.',	'2017-10-14 13:16:55',	'2017-10-14 13:16:55'),
(41432,	90,	3421,	'Any training that teaches concepts but has no organised application is failing in its purpose. information alone don\'t cut it. Classroom teaching is important, but unless it\'s practised and allows for the teacher to correct and train the student, the student will not be able to apply any of that knowledge and the information received won\'t make sense.\r\n\"Train up a child in the way he should go\" now makes sense. It\'s TRAIN not merely teaching. There must be experience that goes along with the teaching for it to be TRAINING. \r\nExample of learning to drive - theory and practical.\r\nIf the teacher only has head knowledge of what he is teaching, it\'s not enough... \r\n\r\nWe need to find ourselves Timothy-s. Like how Timothy was to Paul. \r\n\r\nJoshua didn\'t have a Joshua as how he was to Moses... Joshua did not do what Moses did... But Paul did. \r\n\r\nLeaders must allow those under them to put things they learn into practice (experimenting).',	'2017-10-14 13:53:22',	'2017-10-14 13:53:22'),
(41433,	90,	3422,	'That my students will be able to grow upon the foundational knowledge I teach them by experience. So that they can do more, minister beyond what I have done. \r\n\r\nI need to be covered by apostolic authority. Everyone needs to be.',	'2017-10-14 13:53:22',	'2017-10-14 13:53:22'),
(41434,	90,	3423,	'Recently God revealed to me that some things can only be learned by experience for my ministry to be real and successful in imparting certain spiritual things to others. I should not despise trials but focus on going through it with the right attitude to learn all that God has prepared for me. \r\n\r\nThe leader must grow so everyone under can move up. \r\n\r\nThe greatest ministers, if uncovered, are not going to be able to stay saved...',	'2017-10-14 13:53:22',	'2017-10-14 13:53:22'),
(41435,	2004,	3241,	'training is very important to the ministry\r\nreason not growing because were not preparing to grow or were not doing anything\r\nChurch preparation for how we take care of the coming babies or  harvest',	'2017-10-14 15:17:36',	'2017-10-14 15:17:36'),
(41436,	2004,	3242,	'to  prepare for what Gods wants me to do, need to seek God for the revelation to apply this principle care ministry.',	'2017-10-14 15:17:36',	'2017-10-14 15:17:36'),
(41437,	2004,	3243,	'Care ministry is biblical, effective and tested but on how we apply to us need to seek Gods revelation and guidance',	'2017-10-14 15:17:36',	'2017-10-14 15:17:36'),
(41438,	90,	3436,	'Pastors\' workload is impossible, so the CARE ministry helps to offload pastors so they can be more effective in what they have to do. Example of Jethro and Moses. \r\nWe\'d want to prevent burnout in the case of when the responsibility is not shared but only on one or few shoulders. Pastors need their time of rest and refreshing too!\r\nUnity that is based on true fellowship has great depth and strength, so the Church is stable. So that the Church remains strong during crisis, even when the pastor is gone.\r\nServing is spiritual. \r\nSaints need opportunity to learn to minister and to lead. \r\n\r\nCARE ministry provides the training and supervision for saints to have an opportunity to effectively serve.',	'2017-10-14 14:48:15',	'2017-10-14 14:48:15'),
(41439,	90,	3437,	'Embrace the teaching, correction and training from God through my leaders. And grow.',	'2017-10-14 14:48:15',	'2017-10-14 14:48:15'),
(41440,	90,	3438,	'I\'m privileged to be learning to serve... \r\n\r\nIf you are reading this, I APPRECIATE YOU (SIS HUI E) AND PASTOR!!! Thank you for shouldering the load and burden of ministry. It\'s a privilege to serve alongside with you.',	'2017-10-14 14:48:15',	'2017-10-14 14:48:15'),
(41441,	90,	3451,	'Multiplying oneself is essential because no matter how spiritual you are, you will one day grow older and more tired and have less strength to do things that you did in your younger days.\r\nSome people will never services until they get save. They might be more comfortable starting off experiencing \"church\" in the comfort of a home instead. \r\n\r\nBe all things to all men that by all means I win some. We don\'t change the message to fit people, but we can change our methods.\r\nFour things involved in reaching people - God, message, me, my methods. Only two are eternal & unchangeable and the latter two are changeable.\r\n\r\nThe field of the harvest is the world, not the barn floor. We go to the fields!',	'2017-10-14 15:42:23',	'2017-10-14 15:42:23'),
(41442,	90,	3452,	'Continue to involve my members in outreach.',	'2017-10-14 15:42:23',	'2017-10-14 15:42:23'),
(41443,	90,	3453,	'There is strength in numbers - when we go out there to reach people. \r\n\r\nPhoebe is now one of the contacts to my student Sapphire and we are reaching out to Sapphire together! :)',	'2017-10-14 15:42:23',	'2017-10-14 15:42:23'),
(41444,	2004,	3256,	'Regarding Apostolic structure already started during old testament given thru Moses leading the church and people\r\nGod specifically told to Moses to do, to pray for people, bring the people to God, teach the word of God, to teach how walk to God and tell what work that they need to do.\r\nYou cannot make a disciple by preaching but rather, make a disciple by teaching\r\n.\r\n.',	'2017-10-16 05:34:49',	'2017-10-16 05:34:49'),
(41445,	2004,	3257,	'As an elder, just like what God wants do, to pray for my leader and brethren and share His word',	'2017-10-16 05:34:49',	'2017-10-16 05:34:49'),
(41446,	2004,	3258,	'I really thank God on this revelation, this is not just word in bible but a reality,  proven and tested . . .',	'2017-10-16 05:34:49',	'2017-10-16 05:34:49'),
(41447,	90,	3466,	'Are we more interested in following a program or in the souls of people?\r\n\r\nReligious traditions will restrict us, and limit our revival.\r\nWhile we may be preaching the right message in a traditional methodology still saves some, but what would happen if we used Biblical methods to preach this message? Imagine the revival!\r\nWorship God and give Him glory, not the method or whatever God used! (example of Israel burning incense to a brazen snake that God used just once)',	'2017-10-14 16:11:50',	'2017-10-14 16:11:50'),
(41448,	90,	3467,	'Just because God did it one time, does not mean repeating the method will achieve the same results. \r\n\r\nEven in context of ministry to the kids... I tend to think about how things worked in the past and try to mirror it to achieve the same results. But it doesn\'t happen again.',	'2017-10-14 16:11:50',	'2017-10-14 16:11:50'),
(41449,	90,	3468,	'I have to learn to let God do His will, His way. To believe that He will speak to us and direct us in methods He will introduce by revealing to us however. God is creative and let Him do His ways and will!',	'2017-10-14 16:11:50',	'2017-10-14 16:11:50'),
(41450,	90,	3481,	'Religious tradition is not okay - the end result of it is worshipping God in vain. That is horrible...! It makes the commandments of God of none effect, according to Jesus. Those are strong words, and we must take caution in what Jesus says and warns us about.\r\nWe must first determine the apostolic principles and patterns and concepts that are apostolic and in the Book of Acts, and how does God want those applied in our local situation? (we gotta answer those questions)\r\nHow would it be for someone to walk into our services after having experienced miraculous results of our prayers and home ministry? :) \r\n\r\nBible study can become a care group, which can become a preaching point, which can become a daughter work, which can became a full fledged Church... all through that process, if we\'d just give it an opportunity.',	'2017-10-14 16:48:01',	'2017-10-14 16:48:01'),
(41451,	90,	3482,	'Expanding our ministry to homes provides a platform to building a relationship with a new child of God. This is the direction... \r\nE.g. the story of how people met during regular praying meetings in homes. collecting prayer requests and praying consistently in care groups and going back to the person who gave the request to ask \"how is it going?\" - God takes care of the results! And it may result in the person being comfortable to accept the invite into that home and there\'s an opportunity to study the Word and experience the love of God in the group! Wow.',	'2017-10-14 16:48:01',	'2017-10-14 16:48:01'),
(41452,	90,	3483,	'Don\'t let traditional methods/habits/fear of change limit God!!!! I want the presence of God to fall, for His will to be done - His way! God should be in control. He has the right to tell us how to do, when to do it etc...',	'2017-10-14 16:48:01',	'2017-10-14 16:48:01'),
(41453,	2004,	3271,	'The importance of the 5 fold-gifting to the church for the equipping of the saints\r\nFocus of the ministry is not the barn but the field and go in the preach His word\r\nDiffer discussion of church , from meeting home based to church structure ( Constantine pagan temple and worship)',	'2017-10-16 07:54:47',	'2017-10-16 07:54:47'),
(41454,	2004,	3272,	'To empower the church meeting thru His people not only on church building but in fellowship together',	'2017-10-16 07:54:47',	'2017-10-16 07:54:47'),
(41455,	2004,	3273,	'This lesson gave me another revelation, not to be dismay if we don\'t  have a church building or structure but rather have time to equip ourselves and brethren even were still in a house church or give also time to brethren strengthen in house to house fellowship',	'2017-10-16 07:54:47',	'2017-10-16 07:54:47'),
(41456,	3857,	211,	'The road that looks like an abortion of God\'s plan actually ends up being the road to His fulfillment. This gets me thinking about the scriptures that remind us that ALL is meant for His glory. Even that which is evil can be used for His purposes.\r\nIt is not always our place to judge our leaders. When we do we are telling God that we don\'t trust what He\'s doing.\r\nYou will never remain the same after encountering an offense, and Father help me to choose Your way.',	'2017-10-29 22:19:14',	'2017-10-29 22:19:14'),
(41457,	3857,	212,	'I plan to keep the prayer of choice on my heart. \"God, help me to choose your will Lord\". I won\'t always know the best way to react or deal with a situation but I can pray before, during, and after the encounter.',	'2017-10-29 22:19:14',	'2017-10-29 22:19:14'),
(41458,	3857,	213,	'Praise pray for me as I take this step towards forgiving my father for my youth. I can see that God has already used my father\'s actions to instill in me a set of convictions. Almost as if I was being tested to see if I would repeat the sins of the father. I\'ve failed in many, but have learned even more by failing and keep getting closer to God in the process.',	'2017-10-29 22:19:14',	'2017-10-29 22:19:14'),
(41459,	3828,	5851,	'Through the death, resurrection, and ascension of Christ there is now an opening, a clear pathway for us to ascend in spiritual authority through the air into heaven. That when the situation demands, being submitted unto God, the Holy spirit will come upon us or rise up within us, so that we can speak with a voice of authority in the Holy Ghost and make things begin to change.\r\nThe Lord prepared the way for us to get out of this world, break through the prince of the air, ascend above the clouds. As we begin to pray and break through we will face resistance, much like an airplane that takes off on a dismal rainy day, we must rise up hitting against the turbulence and forces in the air until we break through and reach the brilliant sunlight above the clouds.\r\nSpirits can influence some people more than others, thus the reason some leaders appear more evil than others. So we no longer fight against leaders or political rulers. We war against the spirit that can influence them. When the church prays God will lessen the influence of the spirits on a person. When we are submitted, we can pray in the Spirit with all authority.',	'2017-10-14 20:59:32',	'2017-10-14 20:59:32'),
(41460,	3828,	5852,	'Stay submitted to God and walk in obedience, so that when the situation demands I can be used of the Holy Ghost to pray and speak with a voice of authority.',	'2017-10-14 20:59:32',	'2017-10-14 20:59:32'),
(41461,	3828,	5853,	'There is amazing revelation coming to me through these lessons and sharing with my brothers who are also on the path.',	'2017-10-14 20:59:32',	'2017-10-14 20:59:32'),
(41462,	3853,	256,	'God is drawn to people who are hungry for him\r\nRevealed knowledge kept Peter from leaving Christ\r\nPetra is massive rock.  Petros is little rock.',	'2017-10-14 21:11:23',	'2017-10-14 21:11:23'),
(41463,	3853,	257,	'I desire to be more hungry for Christ.',	'2017-10-14 21:11:23',	'2017-10-14 21:11:23'),
(41464,	3853,	258,	'.',	'2017-10-14 21:11:23',	'2017-10-14 21:11:23'),
