(41479,	3853,	333,	'.',	'2017-10-15 00:36:35',	'2017-10-15 00:36:35'),
(41480,	3853,	346,	'Pray for those who have wronged you.\r\nWhen we hold an offense, we sin against God.\r\nThe sin of offense will separate us from God.',	'2017-10-15 00:47:32',	'2017-10-15 00:47:32'),
(41481,	3853,	347,	'Above all things, have fervent love one for another!',	'2017-10-15 00:47:32',	'2017-10-15 00:47:32'),
(41482,	3853,	348,	'Forgive, pray for them, let it go, and love them.',	'2017-10-15 00:47:32',	'2017-10-15 00:47:32'),
(41483,	2008,	301,	'A slave fights for his right. A servant lays down his right.\r\nThere is freedom in serving, but bondage in slavery.\r\nWhen you wound a weak brother\'s conscience, you sin against Christ.',	'2017-10-15 14:49:13',	'2017-10-15 14:49:13'),
(41484,	2008,	302,	'*Be more concerned about serving your brothers than receiving your right. \r\nI understand that I am blessed to have rights because I am a child of God, however, I have to make sure that no one will get offended whenever I choose to exercise my rights. In this manner, I would rather choose to not enjoy the privilege if it will be just a stumbling block to my weak brothers and sisters.',	'2017-10-15 14:49:13',	'2017-10-15 14:49:13'),
(41485,	2008,	303,	'Sometimes I feel that I have to have this right, or that I am entitled to do this and I don\'t need to explain to anyone else. However, I realized that I am accountable for my brethren and so I should be careful with my words or actions as these can be offending and cause my weak brothers and sisters to stumble.',	'2017-10-15 14:49:13',	'2017-10-15 14:49:13'),
(41486,	2008,	316,	'We were forgiven of unpayable debt when Jesus died on the cross.\r\nYou have the ability to forgive as He forgave you.\r\nAll sin is sin regardless of its perceived magnitude.',	'2017-10-16 13:21:00',	'2017-10-16 13:21:00'),
(41487,	2008,	317,	'I will be more cautious not to hold grudge in my heart for people who hurt me. I am not going to let the hatred sit in my heart. If I feel hurt, I will have to pray about it over and over again, and declare forgiveness, speak forgiveness to that person who hurt me.',	'2017-10-16 13:21:00',	'2017-10-16 13:21:00'),
(41488,	2008,	318,	'Unforgiveness is a self-inflicted wound, it hurts the one who cannot forgive than the one not given the forgiveness. You cannot experience the fullness of joy that God is ready to give to you if you don\'t know how to completely forgive.  Learn to forgive as our Father in heaven had forgiven us. Let go and let God.',	'2017-10-16 13:21:00',	'2017-10-16 13:21:00'),
(41489,	263,	3421,	'Lives are changes through teaching and training.\r\nJoshua did not find someone to impart, teach Nor train which may have led to the death of his generation. God’s concept is for people to keep passing on.\r\nA well trained and fully equipped ministry of saints produced a stable mature and flourishing church.',	'2017-10-15 16:38:32',	'2017-10-15 16:38:32'),
(41490,	263,	3422,	'To stay under the covering of spiritual authorities. Commit to my leadership and willing to be trained and Ensure that I am spiritually adequate to able to lead others.',	'2017-10-15 16:38:32',	'2017-10-15 16:38:32'),
(41491,	263,	3423,	'Nil',	'2017-10-15 16:38:32',	'2017-10-15 16:38:32'),
(41492,	263,	3436,	'Pyramid is one of the most stable in architectural which is applicable in the structure of the church with the head at the apex of the pyramid.\r\nServing is spiritual. Although ministry can start from a need or chore, but an outlet is needed for saints to express their godly desires to serve.\r\nThere are many benefits of CARE being established. Brings better unity and stability to the church and allow the leadership to have rest when needed.',	'2017-10-15 17:04:21',	'2017-10-15 17:04:21'),
(41493,	263,	3437,	'To help carry the burden of my leaders and extend help to the new converts just like how I parent my baby.',	'2017-10-15 17:04:21',	'2017-10-15 17:04:21'),
(41494,	263,	3438,	'Nil',	'2017-10-15 17:04:21',	'2017-10-15 17:04:21'),
(41495,	973,	1261,	'God believes the person is innocent until it is proven guilty. Cynical people believe the person guilty until it is proven innocent.\r\nGod asks us to give leaders wholehearted devotions.\r\nHebrews 13:17 Obey those who rule over you, and be submissive, for they watch out for your souls, as those who must give account. Let them do so with joy and not with grief, for that would be unprofitable for you.',	'2017-10-15 19:46:32',	'2017-10-15 19:46:32'),
(41496,	973,	1262,	'Not to judge or presume someone\'s motives. try to think there must be other reasons.',	'2017-10-15 19:46:32',	'2017-10-15 19:46:32'),
(41497,	973,	1263,	'I should not forget that there would be as many ways people think as the number of people.',	'2017-10-15 19:46:32',	'2017-10-15 19:46:32'),
(41498,	2044,	61,	'God has His plans for us and can use anyone (good and evil leaders) to work in our lives.\r\nGod\'s first priority is not comfort, our redemption is His top priority.\r\nThere are times where God expects us to take His hand and walk through the trial, not revealing to us His plans at that moment.',	'2017-10-16 04:53:32',	'2017-10-16 04:53:32'),
(41499,	2044,	62,	'To trust and honour God\'s plan and appointed leaders.',	'2017-10-16 04:53:32',	'2017-10-16 04:53:32'),
(41500,	2044,	63,	'It is not our part to judge our leaders, it is our part to honour them,  and let God do the judging',	'2017-10-16 04:53:32',	'2017-10-16 04:53:32'),
(41501,	233,	3451,	'The gospel can be delivered multiple ways.we can change the methods but cannot change the gospel message.\r\nCare ministry gets everyone involved in Evan. There is strength and encouragement in not belong alone.\r\nThere is 4 elements involved in reaching people - God, message, me, methods. Only God and the message is eternal. My methods and myself must change to see church growth.',	'2017-10-16 04:53:55',	'2017-10-16 04:53:55'),
(41502,	233,	3452,	'I endeavor to be sensitive to God\'s prompting and change my methods in reaching the world.',	'2017-10-16 04:53:55',	'2017-10-16 04:53:55'),
(41503,	233,	3453,	'Na',	'2017-10-16 04:53:55',	'2017-10-16 04:53:55'),
(41504,	2044,	91,	'You can obey but be unsubmitted with a bad attitude.\r\nWe are not to blindly obey authorities, but even if we were to disobey, we have to speak to the authorities with respect.\r\nnil',	'2017-10-16 06:59:39',	'2017-10-16 06:59:39'),
(41505,	2044,	92,	'To be intentional to be willingly submitted to authorities by obeying with a right attitude.',	'2017-10-16 06:59:39',	'2017-10-16 06:59:39'),
(41506,	2044,	93,	'nil',	'2017-10-16 06:59:39',	'2017-10-16 06:59:39'),
(41507,	233,	3466,	'If truth is preached using a traditional vehicle instead of the biblical approach, God\'s will cannot be completely fulfilled.\r\nWe should not be focusing on the method (brazen serpent) that God has used once but to focus on the Glory of God.\r\nOur church service should not have a predetermind schedule or programme. It inhibits the move of God to happen in the service.',	'2017-10-19 04:55:32',	'2017-10-19 04:55:32'),
(41508,	233,	3467,	'I endeavor to reflect on my life to see if we have allowed religious traditions to be the barrier in how we serve God.',	'2017-10-19 04:55:32',	'2017-10-19 04:55:32'),
(41509,	233,	3468,	'Na',	'2017-10-19 04:55:32',	'2017-10-19 04:55:32'),
(41510,	2004,	3286,	'Comparison of the body of Christ in the natural and spiritual birth process to demonstrate earthly and heavenly things\r\nall systems in the body exist for the purpose and function of sustaining and promoting life in the cell same with the church\r\nBirth process in natural and explained to spiritual birth process or the process of salvation',	'2017-10-22 17:21:16',	'2017-10-22 17:21:16'),
(41511,	2004,	3287,	'Body of Christ, understand and apply spiritually process of birth as a process of born again in  the  book of John 3 and connect it to natural birth that we can use during sharing or in bible study',	'2017-10-22 17:21:16',	'2017-10-22 17:21:16'),
(41512,	2004,	3288,	'It is good to understand the structures, where we really belong, how it was explained between the natural and spiritual things, mother and father dimension of the church or the of Christ. it more effective to us to conduct sharing or talking about Gods principles.',	'2017-10-22 17:21:16',	'2017-10-22 17:21:16'),
(41513,	2004,	3301,	'Principle of nurturing children by mother and father dimension in the church\r\nHome bible study or care group as part of feeding to new babes\r\ndeep understanding on the father dimension of ministry goes on the church service and the mother dimension of ministry is in the outside of the church',	'2017-10-22 18:26:21',	'2017-10-22 18:26:21'),
(41514,	2004,	3302,	'to encourage everyone to strengthen the mother dimension or the care group ministry',	'2017-10-22 18:26:21',	'2017-10-22 18:26:21'),
(41515,	2004,	3303,	'Truly, the single parent is not easily to raise children same my experienced it is not balance and it gave confusion to the children',	'2017-10-22 18:26:21',	'2017-10-22 18:26:21'),
(41516,	2004,	3316,	'Meaning of unity and fellowship in the body of Christ,\r\nKoinonia two dimension, Horizontal relationship with my brothers and sisters become the foundation of my vertical relationship with God.\r\ngiving love to others or brethren brings unity and the Lord will continue to reveal to us.',	'2017-10-22 18:49:57',	'2017-10-22 18:49:57'),
(41517,	2004,	3317,	'to pray that the Lord lead my heart to give love to others without no returns',	'2017-10-22 18:49:57',	'2017-10-22 18:49:57'),
(41518,	2004,	3318,	'Our love to brethren build a good relationship to one another and to our God.',	'2017-10-22 18:49:57',	'2017-10-22 18:49:57'),
(41519,	2004,	3331,	'Every single part of the body has place on the body of Christ\r\nThe fully equipped saint who is skilled at ministry and is in unity with the body of Christ is the key to grow  from God.\r\njoint problem in our body has a relationships with body the Christ that it cant not move when it has a problem or malfunction',	'2017-10-24 15:06:29',	'2017-10-24 15:06:29'),
(41520,	2004,	3332,	'As a member of the body of Christ (church), i need to become equipped for ministry properly as what the moved of God instructed.',	'2017-10-24 15:06:29',	'2017-10-24 15:06:29'),
(41521,	2004,	3333,	'The presence of the Lord will flow once we are united just like in the upper room when the disciples found out that they are in one accord.',	'2017-10-24 15:06:29',	'2017-10-24 15:06:29'),
(41522,	2004,	3346,	'Saints must need to be ministers in the church\r\nTeaching (Jesus) and preaching (John the baptist) are different in application\r\nif want people or brethren to participate in the ministry we need them to teach, train them, what to do, help them how to do it,',	'2017-10-24 15:59:02',	'2017-10-24 15:59:02'),
(41523,	2004,	3347,	'To make a disciple we need to strengthen our teaching ministry',	'2017-10-24 15:59:02',	'2017-10-24 15:59:02'),
(41524,	2004,	3348,	'Preaching, proclaiming or preparing the way of God in the life of other need to experience of every brethren',	'2017-10-24 15:59:02',	'2017-10-24 15:59:02'),
(41525,	2004,	3361,	'Character of John the baptist and Jesus during new Testament church  ministry\r\nDifference of preaching and teaching in the ministry\r\nJesus is a disciple maker to his teaching, training his disciples, committed and not committed brethren',	'2017-10-28 04:06:10',	'2017-10-28 04:06:10'),
(41526,	2004,	3362,	'to involve myself in the teaching ministry to impart whatever knowledge God given to me.',	'2017-10-28 04:06:10',	'2017-10-28 04:06:10'),
(41527,	2004,	3363,	'I really like this lesson, truly if we want a true revival or more converts we need to be prepare everything.',	'2017-10-28 04:06:10',	'2017-10-28 04:06:10'),
(41528,	2008,	331,	'Offense is the Bait of Satan that pulls you into captivity.\r\nWhen you are offended, you feel that the other party owes you something.  \r\nWhen you hold on to that debt, you hold on to unfulfilled revenge!\r\nJesus Christ died on the cross for your unfulfilled revenge.',	'2017-10-16 15:05:36',	'2017-10-16 15:05:36'),
(41529,	2008,	332,	'\"Do not let the sun go down on your anger.\" I will try not to feed/germinate my anger and deal with it as soon as possible. The longer I hold on to it, the harder to let go of it. So i better try to let go of the anger as soon as I can and have faith that all things will work together for good.',	'2017-10-16 15:05:36',	'2017-10-16 15:05:36'),
(41530,	2008,	333,	'Truly, the love of God teaches us that we always have to risk being hurt again. Forgiving them doesn\'t assure us that they will not hurt us again. But that is what God\'s love is. God forgave us of our trespasses and we still continue to hurt him, yet He loves us still. Oh, how great is the measure of His love.',	'2017-10-16 15:05:36',	'2017-10-16 15:05:36'),
(41531,	2008,	346,	'There are some people that don’t exercise – not praying, not reading the word, and not studying the Word.\r\nPeople who are strong in the Spirit don’t get injured easily by offences.\r\nThe love of God covers a multitude of sins!  ',	'2017-10-17 09:23:21',	'2017-10-17 09:23:21'),
(41532,	2008,	347,	'I would pray passionately for those who hurt me. It may be difficult at first, but it will be the pathway for complete healing.',	'2017-10-17 09:23:21',	'2017-10-17 09:23:21'),
(41533,	2008,	348,	'Hardships and offences are part of the process of becoming spiritually mature. We have to strengthen our spiritual life and learn to love those who hurt us. This is how we become compassionate and stronger as a Christian. We will have to continuously strive to focus on loving even the unlovable and seek reconciliation with them.',	'2017-10-17 09:23:21',	'2017-10-17 09:23:21'),
(41534,	2310,	31,	'that submission to God\'s authority have a revelation from God, while when we acknowledge lordship but not obeying, it is rebellion for Him.\r\nthat the word of God is little painful, little hard, little strong because He is trying to protect us for great pain in the future.\r\nthat today, most of us depends on our own reasoning and there is a curse of reasoning on humanity. we choose according which good in our own understanding, we are not God\'s conscious but self conscious.',	'2017-10-19 07:37:05',	'2017-10-19 07:37:05'),
(41535,	2310,	32,	'that i want to shut the legal access to sin and demonic power in my life. and to obey because i want to give my highest for of worship to our Lord Jesus.',	'2017-10-19 07:37:05',	'2017-10-19 07:37:05'),
(41536,	2310,	33,	'I have received the gift of the Holy Ghost and was baptized in Jesus name when i was a visitor in the church in Muntinlupa City, far away from my province. when i went back to my hometown, I wont attend a church service here because there was no other apostolic church here and i thought that my church is only in Muntinlupa. But my sister told me that my spirit grown cold if i don\'t heard any word of God since i baptized. she told me to attend in any church to feed me, no matter what doctrine, Baptist nor Trinitarian born again. the important is i am fed by the word of God. and i was attending in Baptist church which i discover that there are many differences in church rules! they are not believing in speaking in tongue, lifting hands when worship, receiving of Holy Ghost, etc. and because it was my choice church, i have to obey and be submissive. i am part of the church choir and one Sunday i tried to lift my hands when we worship and my pastor did not rebuke me. That was the first time      i think that i was disobeyed my pastor for church rule. and every Sunday service i loved to lift my hands to our Lord. the second time i remember that i was disobey him is when he told me to lead an opening prayer. i began praying in my known tongue when suddenly i\'ll speak in other tongue. my pastor laid his hand on my head  and he tried to rebuke me. because i knew their doctrine, as respect to my pastor, i continuing my prayer in whisper. now i discover that God sees our heart no matter what doctrine of the church if you only search Him. my testimony is when i am in church service, and i am attending to present myself to my pastor to please him, that i am always present every service, now i know that i am in self conscious condition. i don\'t feel the presence of the Lord because i was not cover by His glory. but when i used to focus on my worshiped, and my purpose is to present my body as a living sacrifice, holy, and acceptable which is my reasonable service to the Lord, then, that the time that i feel refreshed, because i am cover by his glory. i thank Jesus and this lesson for revelation!',	'2017-10-19 07:37:05',	'2017-10-19 07:37:05'),
(41537,	2310,	46,	'that partial obedience is not obedience at all, it is a rebellion.\r\nthat deception enters into our life when the person made fall away in the resemblance of godliness or more frequently they continue in the form of godliness but live religiously under the curse of the knowledge of good and evil.\r\nthat witchcraft is a kind of perverting or twisting the word of God in the advantage of oneself. by trying to justify their worldly lifestyle using God\'s word.',	'2017-10-19 08:39:38',	'2017-10-19 08:39:38'),
(41538,	2310,	47,	'i want to keep obeying God at all time, be sensitive to my conscience and always welcome my messenger of God when i am doing wrong unknowingly to correct me.',	'2017-10-19 08:39:38',	'2017-10-19 08:39:38'),
(41539,	2310,	48,	'my pastor in Baptist tried to baptize me using Matthew 28: 19 even though i told him that i was baptize already. he refused to my reasoning, because he said that i need to re-baptize for the reason that i am a new member of Baptist church. because i am a baby Christian that time, i am persuading him and submitted. and i was re-baptize. (before, there were no any other apostolic church here) Two years have past, my pastor noticed, that my brother and my sister convinced me to leave the Baptist church. (it was my sister who convince me to go to church). for the reason that we have to start a weekly service, bible study and prayer meeting in our house. that time it was a family gathering only. we inviting our friends and relatives. but i never leave Baptist church abruptly because my wife used to attend for the reason that she gather her family in the church (Baptist). my brother told me about spiritual adultery and i\'ll understand. when my pastor noticed what\'s happening, he tried to sign me for a waiver of loyalty to church and i was read about believing in Trinity. I refused and i gave it back to him, nothing signing it. because i believe in One God. This is the time i disobeyed my pastor vocally, i thank him for once he is the one who feeding me a spiritual word. when i do that, i feel the joy and peace in my heart. but my pastor have not move on, my wife was trying him to stay, and she said to him that  she\'s not happy. she told to our pastor that she\'s submitting to me as a wife. we give all the glory to our Lord Jesus!',	'2017-10-19 08:39:38',	'2017-10-19 08:39:38'),
(41540,	2310,	151,	'that in family structure, we must have to submit in family authority as Christ is the head of the church, the husband is the head of the wife.\r\nthat there is only exception in the children when the parents or husbands tells to do something that is contrary to the written word of God.\r\nthat God give a specific warning to the children under family authority that cursed for them who treats their father or their mother with contempt.',	'2017-10-21 17:15:49',	'2017-10-21 17:15:49'),
(41541,	2310,	152,	'as a head of the family, i want my wife that he feels secured and protected and to my children even though that they are my stepson, i want that they have trust me and feel them as their biological father.',	'2017-10-21 17:15:49',	'2017-10-21 17:15:49'),
(41542,	2310,	153,	'my grandson had a dengue and need to confined in a hospital. his father was a student in Bible School and no work, so it was a problem in their part. and i thanked God that i used my character loan in our cooperative. and one Sunday service, my stepson in teary eyes testified the goodness of our Lord Jesus, and he thanked me for what i have done to his child. i was shocked that moment, because as a head of the family, it\'s not only duty or obligation, and i thanked God and to my stepson too, that he had to feel me how to be a father. and i said to my stepson, that is the glory of God not ours.',	'2017-10-21 17:15:49',	'2017-10-21 17:15:49'),
(41543,	3784,	5806,	'Pray for God to loose you to move forward and minister the word of God. We need to bind spirits  and Loose people. We have the power.\r\nMatthew 18:18 whatever we bind on earth shall be bound in heaven. Whatever we loose on earth shall be loosed in heaven.\r\nBind people that hinder the work of God.',	'2017-11-12 04:52:34',	'2017-11-12 04:52:34'),
(41544,	3784,	5807,	'Excercise my authority.',	'2017-11-12 04:52:34',	'2017-11-12 04:52:34'),
(41545,	3784,	5808,	'No.',	'2017-11-12 04:52:34',	'2017-11-12 04:52:34'),
(41546,	4015,	1246,	'We should never allow somebody else\'s wrong behavior to affect us.\r\nIf you honor your parents, you will live long and it will go well with you.\r\nHonoring your parents is also shown in outward appearance with how you react to things.',	'2017-10-17 06:57:57',	'2017-10-17 06:57:57'),
(41547,	4015,	1247,	'To honor and respect my parents even when I don\'t agree.',	'2017-10-17 06:57:57',	'2017-10-17 06:57:57'),
(41548,	4015,	1248,	'You will receive a full reward when you honor your leaders.',	'2017-10-17 06:57:57',	'2017-10-17 06:57:57'),
(41549,	2044,	106,	'Complaining is a form of rebelling. Never saw it this way.\r\nIt is not up to us to judge our authorities, it will be between God and them.\r\nGod will test us through His delegated authorities to see if we can recognise His voice through them.',	'2017-10-17 17:11:20',	'2017-10-17 17:11:20'),
(41550,	2044,	107,	'To be respectful and obedient to His delegated authorities in my life, not complaining when things are not in my way.',	'2017-10-17 17:11:20',	'2017-10-17 17:11:20'),
(41551,	2044,	108,	'Our faith can also bless our authorities, just like how when Saul saw the faith of David, God turns Saul\'s heart',	'2017-10-17 17:11:20',	'2017-10-17 17:11:20'),
(41552,	2310,	61,	'that everyone is subject to authority even though that there are cruel leaders He appoint, we are going to be subject to them with the full intent of obeying them.\r\nknowing that the chosen nation of God is Israel, God still stand for His first priority, redemption. the great grandmother of our Lord Jesus, (Rahab and her family, a Gentile saved)\r\nthat if i resist, i resisting God Himself.',	'2017-10-19 09:03:21',	'2017-10-19 09:03:21'),
(41553,	2310,	62,	'i want to have an attitude like Jacob, have the fear of the Lord and be subjected to all four areas of authority: civil, church, family and social.',	'2017-10-19 09:03:21',	'2017-10-19 09:03:21'),
(41554,	2310,	63,	'when i am riding in a motorcycle, the traffic police stopped me for inspection. he found out that i have no driver\'s license and my motorcycle was impound. i paid my fine. the important lesson in my life, when i heard this lesson, i give my Lord in a shameful situation. and i prayed to Him that i overcome the situation. i am planning that when i go to lucena, i\'ll apply for my driver\'s license, thanks to this lesson. and the revelation i received. to God be the glory!',	'2017-10-19 09:03:21',	'2017-10-19 09:03:21'),
(41555,	2110,	211,	'God uses good and gentle leaders to nurture us. God uses harsh leaders to refine us.\r\nAfter encountering an offense, we can choose to become grown or better.\r\nThe hardest times of our lives are greatest stepping stones for us to grow',	'2017-10-20 04:39:18',	'2017-10-20 04:39:18'),
(41556,	2110,	212,	'God uses good and gentle leaders to nurture us. God uses harsh leaders to refine us.\r\n\r\nWe must understand that God uses people in our lives, to offend us so that we may learn how to handle offenses and still be able to demonstrate meekness and forgiveness. He often uses people that are close to us, mostly our leaders, whom we have high expectations. We should not look after their weaknesses or offenses that they can cause to us but rather focus on the brighter side and rewards of overcoming the offenses.',	'2017-10-20 04:39:18',	'2017-10-20 04:39:18'),
(41557,	2110,	213,	'Applying this in our country\'s current situation wherein our President was labeled as a harsh leader, I can say that He was God\'s appointed leader for us. He may have a big and foul mouth and different approach in executing laws, but I believe that God uses Him for us, Filipinos, to be refined, be disciplined and changed for a better society. Filipinos must learn to obey, respect and honor our president and understand his weaknesses.',	'2017-10-20 04:39:18',	'2017-10-20 04:39:18'),
(41558,	3892,	5821,	'Our flesh must be dealt with so God can use us and flow through us.\r\nIt is so important for the church to pray and pray in the spirit, let God lead us in what should be praying  for. Come to prayer meeting expecting God to move.\r\nWhere there is unity in spirit then Jesus is there also.',	'2017-10-17 17:43:49',	'2017-10-17 17:43:49'),
(41559,	3892,	5822,	'To pray in the spirit and let the Holy Ghost lead my prayer.',	'2017-10-17 17:43:49',	'2017-10-17 17:43:49'),
(41560,	3892,	5823,	'To die daily to my flesh and submit my will to Jesus.',	'2017-10-17 17:43:49',	'2017-10-17 17:43:49'),
(41561,	2044,	121,	'When treated unfairly, in order to remain a man or woman after God’s own heart, we must leave our case in the hands of God’s own heart\r\nWhen we are broken, then will we be fully submitted.\r\nAs long as we keep defending and justifying ourselves, God will not defend us. Just as Jesus did not retaliate in any way, we should not either.',	'2017-10-17 18:29:10',	'2017-10-17 18:29:10'),
(41562,	2044,	122,	'To trust God to defend me rather than defending myself.',	'2017-10-17 18:29:10',	'2017-10-17 18:29:10'),
(41563,	2044,	123,	'nil',	'2017-10-17 18:29:10',	'2017-10-17 18:29:10'),
(41564,	2044,	136,	'How we respond to the sins of others, reflects the condition of our heart and our spiritual maturity.\r\nTrue humility does not mean you live like a wimp, but it means that you are completely submitted to God.\r\nWhen God brings judgement, in judgement He looks for mercy, waiting for us to repent',	'2017-10-17 19:36:07',	'2017-10-17 19:36:07'),
(41565,	2044,	137,	'To submit to the God\'s authority (direct and delegated)',	'2017-10-17 19:36:07',	'2017-10-17 19:36:07'),
(41566,	2044,	138,	'\"Run it through the cross\" method is interesting, it is useful in helping us to relate the Old Testament truth to the New Testament. It is also cool to see how Jesus had replaced some of these truths by coming to this world to die for us',	'2017-10-17 19:36:07',	'2017-10-17 19:36:07'),
(41567,	2044,	151,	'Even if your parents are not born again, God can still use them to speak through them, to protect us.\r\nColossians 3:22-23 (NKJV)\r\n22 Bondservants, obey in all things your masters according to the flesh, not with eyeservice, as men-pleasers, but in sincerity of heart, fearing God. 23 And whatever you do, do it heartily, as to the Lord and not to men, 24 knowing that from the Lord you will receive the reward of the inheritance; for you serve the Lord Christ.\r\nInsubordination is rebellion.',	'2017-10-18 04:18:50',	'2017-10-18 04:18:50'),
(41568,	2044,	152,	'To see the authority of God in the delegated authorities, serving them as I would serve the Lord.',	'2017-10-18 04:18:50',	'2017-10-18 04:18:50'),
(41569,	2044,	153,	'nil',	'2017-10-18 04:18:50',	'2017-10-18 04:18:50'),
(41570,	2044,	166,	'Unfinished job is as good as a job not started\r\nFaith comes when we hear the Word and we obey it, faith without obedience is dead.\r\nThose who are planted in the house of God will flourish. Our faith is like roots of the plant, it will dwindle when we do not stay planted.',	'2017-10-18 14:29:01',	'2017-10-18 14:29:01'),
(41571,	2044,	167,	'To be intentional to finish the job started, obeying to completion.',	'2017-10-18 14:29:01',	'2017-10-18 14:29:01'),
(41572,	2044,	168,	'nil',	'2017-10-18 14:29:01',	'2017-10-18 14:29:01'),
(41573,	2006,	3271,	'1.	Jesus said the field is the world\r\n2.	The word church in the bible never refers to a building or facilities\r\n3.	A home is more personal and private place to meet than a church building',	'2017-10-18 09:13:36',	'2017-10-18 09:13:36'),
(41574,	2006,	3272,	'House to house Ministry , it is a various private home. Many Scripture in the bible that can prove that it is much easier to get fellowship and have a Spiritually intimacy at home. ( Acts 2:46 ,Acts 5:42 , Acts 12: 12, Acts 20:8 )',	'2017-10-18 09:13:36',	'2017-10-18 09:13:36'),
(41575,	2006,	3273,	'In old Testament, the house of God called a Temple or Tabernacle. Now our body is the Temple of God. We are not reaching the world by building.',	'2017-10-18 09:13:36',	'2017-10-18 09:13:36'),
(41576,	2006,	3286,	'1 God be in the creator of all things, natural and all natural principles, all things are created to demonstrate spiritual principles.\r\n2.	In the traditonal church concept the entire entity operates as a single cell\r\n3.	Natural birth given to us by God to help us understand Spiritual things.',	'2017-10-18 09:26:12',	'2017-10-18 09:26:12'),
(41577,	2006,	3287,	'For a doctrine of salvation be correct, it has to have all the elements involve in natural birth\r\n-	Conception – begotten the word \r\n-	Faith – work in our life\r\n-	Repentance – change of direction\r\n-	Birth of water- Separation from our past \r\n-	Breath – the Breath of life',	'2017-10-18 09:26:12',	'2017-10-18 09:26:12'),
(41578,	2006,	3288,	'Father and Mother are not the same, they are not created the same. Their role are not the same.\r\n There’s no woman who makes a good substitute father, \r\n There’s no man who makes a good substitute mother ,',	'2017-10-18 09:26:12',	'2017-10-18 09:26:12'),
(41579,	2006,	3301,	'1.	A person got baptized and has the Holy Ghost, they need to have  consistently 101 Bible Study.\r\n2.	It is proven sociologically that single parent family are not as healthy as double parent family, because it is consider disfunctional\r\n3.	Statistic prove that the single parent with he mother dimension is more stable than the father dimension. Why, because for children nurturing is more important than discipline.',	'2017-10-18 09:38:15',	'2017-10-18 09:38:15'),
(41580,	2006,	3302,	'Care group at home is very important, new born babies need to experience fellowship, care for their brothers and sisters, new born babes need to feel the love and they belong to the body of Christ. \r\nIn the Care group Ministry the new born babies can express their thoughts and testimonies, and not only the new born but also to other brethren',	'2017-10-18 09:38:15',	'2017-10-18 09:38:15'),
(41581,	2006,	3303,	'Christ is the ONLY ONE church builders, Christ never build His church by man’s concept and ways.  He only build the church by His Concept and Ways. \r\n-	Now we have to decide whether we participate with Him or we are going to do in our own way.',	'2017-10-18 09:38:15',	'2017-10-18 09:38:15'),
(41582,	2006,	3316,	'1 it is impossible to develop a horizontal relationship with the church services\r\n2 Agape love- is love in action, not an emotion\r\n3 You can’t get growth and harvest without unity,  you can’t have UNITY without KOINONIA',	'2017-10-18 09:50:35',	'2017-10-18 09:50:35'),
(41583,	2006,	3317,	'Thru the true unity and loving one another , Miracle can happen.  Agape love is a choice it is not an emotion. \r\nAgape love of God is the energizing force that bonds God’s people together.',	'2017-10-18 09:50:35',	'2017-10-18 09:50:35'),
(41584,	2006,	3318,	'Spiritual people who never truly develop loving relationship with other saints frequently become unstable and eventually become judgemental to ohers, because they never learn to have compassion with others .\r\nTheir relationship with God is all about themselves.',	'2017-10-18 09:50:35',	'2017-10-18 09:50:35'),
(41585,	2006,	3331,	'1. Christ train His disciples after He left. John 14: 12 verily verily I say unto you. He that believeth on me, the works that I do shall he do also, and greater works than these shall he do, because I go to my father.\r\n2. The members are the parts of the body. If the relationship of the body is strong , the body will be strong.\r\n3. When the church has pain in his joints, and his relationship between his members, our body is not going to function.',	'2017-10-18 10:01:36',	'2017-10-18 10:01:36'),
(41586,	2006,	3332,	'Revival is not possible without unity of the body. We need to learn and apply with all our hearts and mind  to have a TRUE LOVE and RELATIONSHIP with the LORD JESUS CHRIST. Love one another, \r\nJesus reaveal to the world through the unity in the church.',	'2017-10-18 10:01:36',	'2017-10-18 10:01:36'),
(41587,	2006,	3333,	'According to the scriptures,  in Acts 1: 4 – These all continued with one accord in prayer and supplication \r\n Acts 2: 1 -  And when the day of Pentecost was fully come ,they were a with one accord in one place. \r\n Acts 4: 24 – They lifted up their voice to God with one accord. \r\nUnited in one prayer, one accord, unity, love for one another. They have the strong foundation, love with the Lord,.\r\nBeing Unity in one accord allowed them to have another dimension of the Holy Ghost .',	'2017-10-18 10:01:36',	'2017-10-18 10:01:36'),
(41588,	2006,	3346,	'1.	Jesus is a church builder. If He is a a church builder we will understand His concept and participate with Him.\r\n2.	The Bible is our source of understanding  and information about how to minister in the new testament church.\r\n3.	John the Baptist bring us through Christ, prepare the way of Christ into our llives',	'2017-10-18 10:10:38',	'2017-10-18 10:10:38'),
(41589,	2006,	3347,	'As a member of the church or the body of Christ,  I need to be passionately seek God, know His words, be sensitive to His Spirit, and to His still small voice.  Study every word of God.\r\nI need to have a deeper relationship with Him, thru talking to Him in prayer. \r\nApply every teaching that God thought in the Bible.',	'2017-10-18 10:10:38',	'2017-10-18 10:10:38'),
(41590,	2006,	3348,	'This is what I have learned in this lesson. The purpose Ministry of Jesus Christ and  John the baptist. \r\nJohn, was a preacher, bold proclamator.\r\nPreaching does not produce relationship between the people and the preacher, unless the preacher is trying to please people instead of pleasing God.\r\nJesus was a teacher, He’s ministry was a relational, He is an explainer. We are not just a disciples of Jesus Christ, we have to have a relation to Him ( as he is our teacher )',	'2017-10-18 10:10:38',	'2017-10-18 10:10:38'),
(41591,	2006,	3361,	'1.	John  was a preacher of a crowd more than individual .\r\nJohn is a Single preacher\r\nJohn  did not make disciples\r\n2.	Jesus is a disciple maker, disciples taught or train one,  it is impossible to make a disciple by preaching\r\n3.	Jesus ministry to individual more than the crowd.\r\nJesus was  a compassionate, patient  teacher focus and determine disciple maker.\r\nJesus is a trainor of a man and a leader of multiple ministry.',	'2017-10-18 10:19:17',	'2017-10-18 10:19:17'),
(41592,	2006,	3362,	'As  I have learned in this teaching, being a parent is synonymous to a teacher.\r\nJesus is a teacher, Jesus Ministry is more on teaching than preaching. \r\nJesus characteristics as a teacher is compassionate, patient, disciple maker, trainor of a man and a leader of multiple ministry. \r\nAs a parent to my children, I need also a teacher to them.  As a parent I cannot raise children  thru proclamation, declaration, warnings, I have to raise my children by teaching them. \r\nJesus said I am in the Father and the Father is in  me, because the Ministry that flow to Him was the Ministry of father to children.',	'2017-10-18 10:19:17',	'2017-10-18 10:19:17'),
(41593,	2006,	3363,	'Jesus is not only our saviour, our redeemer, our comforter, our healer, our provider, our all in all. But He is also a disciple maker and our Father who is our great teacher, who explains, equip and  Impart.\r\nJesus said I am in the Father and the Father is in  me, because the Ministry that flow to Him was the Ministry of father to children. \r\nMaking disciples is the same thing  raising a child the way you should go, so when they  old they will  not depart from it.',	'2017-10-18 10:19:17',	'2017-10-18 10:19:17'),
(41594,	2006,	3376,	'1.	Given to the church the ministry of reconciling man to Him.\r\n2.	Traditional  Pentecostal church  structure cannot  take care of number of people ( Almost a thousand members ), until the revelation come, its  call a CARE MINISTRY.\r\n3.	Not our faith, not our believes, not our prayer, not our personal ministry that limit our growth, instead our Church Structure that limit our growth.',	'2017-10-18 10:30:20',	'2017-10-18 10:30:20'),
(41595,	2006,	3377,	'Ministry must have a conduit to flow thru it has to be a Apostolic structure.\r\nIf we believe that there will be a revival, we must prepare ourselves, we must be involve and prepare, and take care of the result of it. Making a specific Preparation for the coming revival and  harvest, and ready to take care for  those people.',	'2017-10-18 10:30:20',	'2017-10-18 10:30:20'),
(41596,	2006,	3378,	'Many of the churches are praying for the harvest, problem is are we ready for the coming people? \r\nWe need to train to teach more for the home bible studies, we need plans how can start in small group, so that this people can have a place in ministry.\r\nIts not enough for the person to come to learn  to  receive, the principles of the Gospel, Freely it receive freely gives.',	'2017-10-18 10:30:20',	'2017-10-18 10:30:20'),
(41597,	2006,	3391,	'1.	George  Whitefied – not a disciple maker, while John Wesley – he is a disciple maker\r\n2.	John Wesley and his ministry- is the root of our movements\r\n-	the Sturctur he was using was essentially identical to the structure Apostolic Church use in the first century\r\n3.	Biblically and historically  home group/ small group ministry is in our heritage,',	'2017-10-18 10:39:29',	'2017-10-18 10:39:29'),
(41598,	2006,	3392,	'Moses Ministry – is for the people of God, take the petition to God. Teach them how they supposed to believe, how they walk or live and work what they are supposed to do. Put the people work, doing all that. \r\nThat was an Apostolic Structure.',	'2017-10-18 10:39:29',	'2017-10-18 10:39:29'),
(41599,	2006,	3393,	'I learned a lot in this teaching. One  teaching that I learned is that mothers are equip to take care of babies ,not the father. \r\nEvery pastor need to know that  only mother dimesion leaderhip can fulfill for his church.\r\nEvery part of the body of Chirst is very important. In the previous lesson,  every part of the body must functioning, so that the body of Chist can move freely. Every members of the body must be mature enough to handle every circumstances and situation,',	'2017-10-18 10:39:29',	'2017-10-18 10:39:29'),
(41600,	2006,	3406,	'1.	It is important to pastors not to lose of sight,  your true purpose in the church\r\n2.	Shepherd is responsible for training, teaching, leading, structuring the church\r\n3.	The purpose and goal of a pastor is to fully equip the saints',	'2017-10-18 10:49:26',	'2017-10-18 10:49:26'),
(41601,	2006,	3407,	'Jesus trained and trusted those He chose for the ministry, blessed are those people that is chosen by GOD.  GOD gave His trust to those people He choose. If we truly love God will all our heart, mind and soul, we ought to obey every words and instruction that He  said. \r\nGod provided everything for the Ministry. God is expecting us to do His will, and God wants us to continue what He started during His ministry while He was on earth.',	'2017-10-18 10:49:26',	'2017-10-18 10:49:26'),
(41602,	2006,	3408,	'In the previous lesson, we learned that we need to have a plan, preparation for the coming revival and harvest of the soul, but the question is, are the members of the body of Christ are ready to listen, ready to be train, ready to read and study the word of God, ready to give time and effort for the ministry, and ready for the responsibility that God gave to us. \r\nIs the Shepherd ready to take care and train  of his flocks. If God send the ministry 50 souls are the ministry ready to equip them, train them and be responsible to them to disciple them. \r\nThose are questions that need the body of CHRIST to answer before God send us hundreds of souls.',	'2017-10-18 10:49:26',	'2017-10-18 10:49:26'),
(41603,	2006,	3421,	'. it takes a long time for someone to  acquired  experience\r\nPaul expecting Timothy to put all what he have learn from him to others, and duplicate to others also. That is a God concept.\r\nJoshua did  not duplicate himself to another  Joshua, why, because Joshua did not  do  what Moses did.',	'2017-10-18 10:57:09',	'2017-10-18 10:57:09'),
(41604,	2006,	3422,	'COVERING is essential for protection,  Do not go in any ministry without covering , they need to be covered.\r\nBeing covered  by authority is protecting them, for their own benefit.',	'2017-10-18 10:57:09',	'2017-10-18 10:57:09'),
(41605,	2006,	3423,	'Pastor was  given the Authority by God, he need to delegate  that Authority to train people, so they can do also their ministry.',	'2017-10-18 10:57:09',	'2017-10-18 10:57:09'),
(41606,	2006,	3436,	'1.	Pyramid is the most stable structure in architecture.  In church  structure, God should be first and above and the people are in the base, everybody is involve in the ministry.\r\n2.	if the entire body of Christ is in involve in the ministry, no one has to be destroyed, it is not one person job to do it all .\r\n3.	One of the benefit of the Care Ministry is the stability of the church.',	'2017-10-18 11:05:13',	'2017-10-18 11:05:13'),
(41607,	2006,	3437,	'Care Ministry is the fundamental structure of the church, one of the effective and benefit of the Care Ministry is the TRUE FELLOWSHIP ,  it produces the unity and community which allows the church to remain stronger.',	'2017-10-18 11:05:13',	'2017-10-18 11:05:13'),
(41608,	2006,	3438,	'Parenting and pastoring has similar concept , pastors capable of ministering the people. Parenting practicing ministry everyday, and teaching things with traditional training and oversight, it is useful to help the body of Christ and new born in the Kingdom of God.',	'2017-10-18 11:05:13',	'2017-10-18 11:05:13'),
(41609,	2006,	3451,	'1.	One Gospel, living a separate life, believing the oneness of God.\r\n2.   4  things involve in reaching people , God, message, me, and method.\r\n3.    Every individual as part of the body, responsible for overseers.',	'2017-10-18 11:13:38',	'2017-10-18 11:13:38'),
(41610,	2006,	3452,	'One effective way of evangelism as I have learned  in this lesson was approaching your neighbors and ask for a prayer request and have some little talk about their recent need that need to pray. After a week visit them again, ask them how was going on. \r\nI experience in the care ministry  held in the house,, inviting  my neighbors, most of them are young people and others are applying for abroad particular in the middle east as a domestic helper. Some visited in the church.',	'2017-10-18 11:13:38',	'2017-10-18 11:13:38'),
(41611,	2006,	3453,	'Jesus told us to go in all the world, He never told, “ all the world to come to the church” \r\nJesus did not send by  12, by 70, by themselves, Jesus send by two’s . Jesus knows there were strength  , encouragement, help. Two is better than one. \r\nWhen the care group, is working together, to teach Bible Study, disciple new converts, working together with love and true unity in their hearts, great and wonderful things happen. It is more effective.',	'2017-10-18 11:13:38',	'2017-10-18 11:13:38'),
(41612,	2006,	3466,	'1.	The common barrier is the religious tradition\r\n2.  Israel had made an idol a false god out of bronze serpent\r\n3.  God and the message is unchangeable.',	'2017-10-18 11:22:14',	'2017-10-18 11:22:14'),
(41613,	2006,	3467,	'Most of the main problems of the church today, instead of using the  biblical approach which is the Lord concept, they  were doing the traditional religion.  I can see that churches who is continuing doing that religious tradition, they are not sensitive in the voice of God. And mostly they don’t have a relationship with the Lord .',	'2017-10-18 11:22:14',	'2017-10-18 11:22:14'),
(41614,	2006,	3468,	'I believe, that when the church or the whole body of Christ has a strong and intimate relationship with the Lord, the body of Christ will be sensitive to the voice of God.  And that voice will be the guide and the instructions, the corrections and the plans of God in His body will be fulfilled.',	'2017-10-18 11:22:14',	'2017-10-18 11:22:14'),
(41615,	2006,	3481,	'1.	God brought us step by step out of the dark ages, out of false doctrine.\r\n2.    We change method, put the new wine skin, not immediately but it will happen.\r\n3.    God’s primary method is reaching and holding the result the end time Apostolic worldwide harvest revival.',	'2017-10-26 08:46:12',	'2017-10-26 08:46:12'),
(41616,	2006,	3482,	'Back to the original foundation and structure of the church, none traditional but biblical Apostolic principle and concept of ministry. We don’t worship God only with our lips, but true worship is within our hearts, mind. I choose God to worship Him in Spirit and in truth. Seeking and have an intimate relationship with Him. With that we will be sensitive to the still small voice of God.',	'2017-10-26 08:46:12',	'2017-10-26 08:46:12'),
(41617,	2006,	3483,	'God gave me this verse during our Sunday service in the church. \r\nMathew 7: 21- 23 Not everyone who says to me, Lord, Lord, will enter the Kingdom of heaven, but he who does the will of  My Father who is in heaven. 22 Many will say to me on that day, Lord ,Lord have we not prophesied in your name, and driven out demons in your name and done many mighty works in your name? 23 And then I will say to them openly, I never knew you, depart from me,you who act wickedly { disregarding my commands }\r\nGod is looking for the true worshipper who worship Him in Spirit and in truth. God wants to have an intimate relationship with Him, so we can hear HIS voice and be Obedient to His words, and His instructions and even corrrections to us..',	'2017-10-26 08:46:12',	'2017-10-26 08:46:12'),
(41618,	3890,	61,	'All authority is appointed by God\r\nLet every soul be subject to the governing authority\r\nto resist appointed authority is to resist God',	'2017-10-18 13:31:52',	'2017-10-18 13:31:52'),
(41619,	3890,	62,	'We can affect our leaders with our prayers and humility.  I will choose to pray for harsh authority rather than complain about it',	'2017-10-18 13:31:52',	'2017-10-18 13:31:52'),
(41620,	3890,	63,	'Sometimes God reveals his wisdom in a situation.  other times he expects us to have faith and allow him to lead us.',	'2017-10-18 13:31:52',	'2017-10-18 13:31:52'),
(41621,	2310,	76,	'that we have to submit to every ordinance of man for the Lord\'s sake, by honoring all people, loving the brotherhood, the fear God, honoring the king. and the contrary that if we have not submitted, we have not fear God.\r\nthat God is especially hard on those who follow their own evil, lustful desire and who despise authority. they are lack of fear of God and speak about people of authority as nothing, and this people have not the heart of God.\r\nthat if you give double honor to the authorities (church leaders), even they are tough (like Eli), God will see your heart and your plea be answer (like Hannah). to received the person that God sent me, (church leader) I receive in His authority (Christ) which in charge Father in heaven\'s authority.',	'2017-10-19 14:37:35',	'2017-10-19 14:37:35'),
(41622,	2310,	77,	'i love to honoring all people, loving the brotherhood, have fear of God, and honor the king. in that, i will respect the four areas of divine authority. and especially i will give double honor to every man of God that send to me.',	'2017-10-19 14:37:35',	'2017-10-19 14:37:35'),
(41623,	2310,	78,	'like my previous testimony in dealing with my past pastor, when we leave the church, i feel what he feels, because he was once taking care on us, feeding the word of God. me and my wife used to visit them and when we have a harvest from the farm, we give them some fruits, or rice, not for peace offering but for the sake of harmonious relationship we build and they are the man of God too! unknowingly this kind of attitude built on us, is not our own but it was the glory of God! I felt so bless, because i heard it in this lesson! it is the type of honoring our church leader! we pray for them that one day when we\'ve meet again. we talk not the past but the goodness of our God! that once they nurtured a couple, and when this couple heard the voice of God to go and preach the gospel of our Lord Jesus Christ, they have a heart to obey. in that way, i plead to God that they have a great joy in their heart because nothing spare in their works and labor of love. this is the glory of God!',	'2017-10-19 14:37:35',	'2017-10-19 14:37:35'),
(41624,	2310,	91,	'that submission is probably calls the greatest demand of confusion among the believers and about anything else on earth, and there are two musts in our life 1. obey those who rule over us and 2. be submissive to those who rule over us.\r\nthat we can obey but not necessary submitted, obedience deals with action and submission deals with attitude. and the bible teaches unconditional submission and not unconditional obedience. submission just not mean i submitted, that i am always not i agree. sometimes i disagree my leader on certain issues  especially if it is compromising in the word of God.\r\nthat we (Christians) are walking the life that God\'s calls us to walk, when the outside or unbeliever cannot find faults in our lives, like Daniel, he was faithful, nor was there any error or fault find him.',	'2017-10-21 02:07:00',	'2017-10-21 02:07:00'),
(41625,	2310,	92,	'that i have an attitude of willingness and submission whole heartily, and an action of obedience physically. faith with works.',	'2017-10-21 02:07:00',	'2017-10-21 02:07:00'),
(41626,	2310,	93,	'thanks for this lesson from Aaron and Miriam, connection to this, my brother who is the one of the elder in the congregation is in trial. he feel that he was betrayed by his brethren, and i am trying and convinced him that he need to face and discuss the matter to set him free from his imagination. he need to talk to this brethren with the elders of the church to settle this issue. in my case,  i have submitted to my pastor, even though he tells me his sentiment and i have to stand in the word of God no matter if he is my brother in flesh or not. there is saying that blood is thicker than water, Yes! but if it is compromising in the word of God I disagree for his sentiment. but still, the fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom. the family still in praying for him.',	'2017-10-21 02:07:00',	'2017-10-21 02:07:00'),
(41627,	263,	3451,	'Outreach can be done best through someone’s living room with limited group. It is essential and helpful to have the person know you and Even like you before he/she goes to a church service. They will know that the way we worship by shouting and dancing maybe not be ‘weird’ but something more than this.\r\nThe field represents and the world. The field does not go to the brain but it’s for the people from the barn to go out to the field.\r\nCare ministry makes evanglism a group effort. Care group can disciple a new convert together and all to grow together',	'2017-10-18 15:55:51',	'2017-10-18 15:55:51'),
(41628,	263,	3452,	'We join in the group as one to evangelism be it ‘inreach’ or ‘outreach’. In fact there is already a pool of people who can be ‘inreach’ to which the care group can start from.',	'2017-10-18 15:55:51',	'2017-10-18 15:55:51'),
(41629,	263,	3453,	'Nil',	'2017-10-18 15:55:51',	'2017-10-18 15:55:51'),
(41630,	3892,	5836,	'Prayer prepares the church to receive what God wants to happen.  God desires to reveal to us his real power.\r\nBy Jesus being placed far above all things, then everything in this world is placed beneath our feet  also since we are his children.\r\nOne of the most highest and least used prayers is authoritative prayer, and through this prayer we can become the voice of God.',	'2017-10-18 20:43:41',	'2017-10-18 20:43:41'),
(41631,	3892,	5837,	'To truly seek God to understand the power that is in me and how through authoritative prayer things can change as long as they are in the parameters of God\'s will.',	'2017-10-18 20:43:41',	'2017-10-18 20:43:41'),
(41632,	3892,	5838,	'It amazes me the power and authority Jesus gives us, and just how much he desires us to understand and use it.',	'2017-10-18 20:43:41',	'2017-10-18 20:43:41'),
(41633,	4015,	1261,	'Our attitude towards God is reflected by our behavior towards church leaders.\r\nWe are called to judge fruit, not motives.\r\nCynical people believe people are guilty until proven innocent.',	'2017-10-19 06:25:39',	'2017-10-19 06:25:39'),
(41634,	4015,	1262,	'Not to judge peoples motives, but to judge the fruit they are producing.',	'2017-10-19 06:25:39',	'2017-10-19 06:25:39'),
(41635,	4015,	1263,	'Don\'t take thought to any rumor about a church leaders unless its repeated by two or three witnesses.',	'2017-10-19 06:25:39',	'2017-10-19 06:25:39'),
(41636,	2002,	3241,	'Training is very important in a church.\r\nGrowth is change. Do not reject change.\r\nCare ministry primarily involves saints\' ministering to each other in home meetings. It is more than a program. It is also the key to building a larger Apostolic church.',	'2017-10-19 09:12:28',	'2017-10-19 09:12:28'),
(41637,	2002,	3242,	'To be equip and to continue to be rooted in the teachings of the foundation of the  Apostolic church.',	'2017-10-19 09:12:28',	'2017-10-19 09:12:28'),
(41638,	2002,	3243,	'The Lord expects us to take what taught of us, the solid foundation which is the Lord Jesus. Also, every Christian   individually, collectively must grow.',	'2017-10-19 09:12:28',	'2017-10-19 09:12:28'),
(41639,	2002,	3256,	'You cannot make a disciple by preaching and that you make a disciple by teaching.\r\nThat God wanted His chosen people to be included in the work of the Lord, not just being spectators in the church service.\r\nThat if you want people to grow and to get mature, they need to be taught.',	'2017-10-19 09:35:28',	'2017-10-19 09:35:28'),
(41640,	2002,	3257,	'To rely on God\'s strength and leading. Consultation with the Lord is very important.',	'2017-10-19 09:35:28',	'2017-10-19 09:35:28'),
(41641,	2002,	3258,	'In a church ministry, there must be a structure for leaders to delegate responsibilities to committed members.',	'2017-10-19 09:35:28',	'2017-10-19 09:35:28'),
(41642,	2002,	3271,	'Fully equipping the saints in the ministry for building up Christ body in the church.\r\nBiblically, it cannot be proven that you can build a church from the pulpit. The focus of the ministry is the field.\r\nThe church building is not the church but rather the people of the church. We are the temple.',	'2017-10-19 10:02:41',	'2017-10-19 10:02:41'),
(41643,	2002,	3272,	'Jesus commanded the church to go and so we should obey the instruction to reach out for the lost. For me, home care ministry is effective in reaching them.',	'2017-10-19 10:02:41',	'2017-10-19 10:02:41'),
(41644,	2002,	3273,	'If you want to see harvest, people get saved then application of Apostolic principle must be applied in the church.',	'2017-10-19 10:02:41',	'2017-10-19 10:02:41'),
(41645,	2116,	3271,	'The purpose of the five-fold ministry is to fully equipped the saints\r\nChurch never refers to building according to the Bible\r\nIt is more personal and private place to meet at homes rather than a church building',	'2017-10-19 10:20:13',	'2017-10-19 10:20:13'),
(41646,	2116,	3272,	'To do what God commanded us to do. To \"Go\", preach, share the Gospel that was revealed to us.',	'2017-10-19 10:20:13',	'2017-10-19 10:20:13'),
(41647,	2116,	3273,	'This lesson gives me the understanding that we are to focus in people and not so much about the building whenever we meet or making an assembly. The scriptures says that, \"For where two or three are gathered together in my name, there am I in the midst of them.\" (Matthew 18:20)',	'2017-10-19 10:20:13',	'2017-10-19 10:20:13'),
(41648,	2116,	3286,	'Natural birth is relative to spiritual birth\r\nWe adjust and change until what we think matches perfectly with the Lord\'s principles\r\nOur level of relationship with our fellow saints is not just being together but a level that sustains and supports each other',	'2017-10-19 10:34:44',	'2017-10-19 10:34:44'),
(41649,	2116,	3287,	'We are our brothers keeper. We need each other to survive specially in our journey with our Christian living, because of one cannot make it without the other. A clear reference about the cells in the human body.',	'2017-10-19 10:34:44',	'2017-10-19 10:34:44'),
(41650,	2116,	3288,	'A wonderful revelation I got about the dimensions of leadership in the Church. Father and Mother Dimensions. In addition, a wisdom from God that it\'s not about the gender of the ministers but the spiritual functions and the flow of the anointing.',	'2017-10-19 10:34:44',	'2017-10-19 10:34:44'),
(41651,	2116,	3256,	'We need to follow what God\'s plan for it is going to be effective\r\nOur attitude needs to be right\r\nDoing what God has ordered; He empowers and strengthened us',	'2017-10-19 11:14:18',	'2017-10-19 11:14:18'),
(41652,	2116,	3257,	'We are to be in the work in God\'s kingdom, not just hearers in the church service.',	'2017-10-19 11:14:18',	'2017-10-19 11:14:18'),
(41653,	2116,	3258,	'God created a structured leadership for us to follow. A very good example how the five-fold ministry works in the church.',	'2017-10-19 11:14:18',	'2017-10-19 11:14:18'),
(41654,	233,	3481,	'God does not change His patterns, principles or concept does not change due to time, place and culture.\r\nthe result of a end time revival seeing thousands saved will be wasted if the church is unable to retain them.\r\nOur evangelism approach should focus on the needs of the people instead of inviting them to church. People will naturally come when they experience the effectiveness of praying to God for a miracle.',	'2017-10-19 11:47:00',	'2017-10-19 11:47:00'),
(41655,	233,	3482,	'I endeavor to take prayer request of my loved ones seriously and be diligent in praying till something happens.',	'2017-10-19 11:47:00',	'2017-10-19 11:47:00'),
(41656,	233,	3483,	'Na',	'2017-10-19 11:47:00',	'2017-10-19 11:47:00'),
(41657,	2005,	241,	'he feeds the wicked just like how he feeds the just!\r\n2 kinds of persecutions: Self-inflicted persecution and persecution for righteousness sake\r\nwhen you defend yourself, we create an atmosphere in our heart that makes us a prime candidate for offence.',	'2017-10-19 12:07:20',	'2017-10-19 12:07:20'),
