(41666,	2310,	106,	'that complaining to leader is the most foolish things on earth because God will place them to their subordinates for their protection. it is a form of rebellion, and if you were not aware, God will orchestrate his judgment.\r\nour complaints is not against our leaders but against God.\r\nthat we can do something help if our leader is a bad choice. like the story of Queen Esther, Mordecai and Haman and the story of David to Saul, like he talk to his king, a gesture of a son to his father.',	'2017-10-21 02:32:57',	'2017-10-21 02:32:57'),
(41667,	2310,	107,	'that if i have a dissatisfaction with my leader,I want to see him as my lord to keep me from the call of God. I want to wave a wisdom of David and Queen Esther when dealing with negatively influenced leader.',	'2017-10-21 02:32:57',	'2017-10-21 02:32:57'),
