(41673,	973,	1277,	'Being attentive to preaching.',	'2017-10-19 19:07:06',	'2017-10-19 19:07:06'),
(41674,	973,	1278,	'God gives us uncontainable and uncountable love while we are struggling to give countable money. We never outgives God but we only can return a little bit.',	'2017-10-19 19:07:06',	'2017-10-19 19:07:06'),
(41675,	3892,	5851,	'God wants us to use the authority he has already given us.\r\nWe were born into sin and automatically had sin because we came after Adam.  The death of Christ solved our old life in Adam, the resurrection of Christ led us into a new life, and the ascension of Christ put us in a position of authority over Satan.\r\nThe way to break spiritual forces is through prayer.',	'2017-10-19 20:53:29',	'2017-10-19 20:53:29'),
(41676,	3892,	5852,	'To pray more with the authority that God has already given me.',	'2017-10-19 20:53:29',	'2017-10-19 20:53:29'),
(41677,	3892,	5853,	'To let God lead me through the Holy Ghost to pray for the different nations.',	'2017-10-19 20:53:29',	'2017-10-19 20:53:29'),
(41678,	2000,	181,	'Offense is a snare, a trap.\r\nMost people who are offended don’t even know they are offended.\r\nThe person that can hurt you the most is the person that is closest to you.',	'2017-10-20 03:21:47',	'2017-10-20 03:21:47'),
(41679,	2000,	182,	'Forgive, that is best way for me to avoid getting trapped in the bait.',	'2017-10-20 03:21:47',	'2017-10-20 03:21:47'),
(41680,	2000,	183,	'This is an awesome and detailed teaching about offense in the church - which most of the time we do not notice that we already fell into it.',	'2017-10-20 03:21:47',	'2017-10-20 03:21:47'),
(41681,	4015,	1276,	'When you honor your leadership, you have a reward fro you in heaven.\r\nTithes and offerings allow the ministers\' to do the work God has called them to do.\r\nWe should look for ways to serve rather than waiting to be asked.',	'2017-10-20 06:52:13',	'2017-10-20 06:52:13'),
(41682,	4015,	1277,	'To always give at least 10% of my income towards tithes.',	'2017-10-20 06:52:13',	'2017-10-20 06:52:13'),
(41683,	4015,	1278,	'Giving tithes and offerings gives us the opportunity to take part in ministering to hundreds of other people.',	'2017-10-20 06:52:13',	'2017-10-20 06:52:13'),
(41684,	2310,	121,	'that God do not delight in burnt offering, but he not despise to the broken and contrite heart, because brokenness or broken spirit are the sacrifice of God. this is the goal of God, to break us.\r\nthat in 1 Peter 2: 18, the servants that pointing here is referring to all kinds of groups such as; students, church members, civilians, employees etc. and the masters is referring to a leaders such as; bosses, teachers, coaches, etc. and that all servants be submissive to their masters with all fear without choosing weather they are good or bad.\r\nthat our calling is to handle unfair treatment correctly and Jesus leads us a personal example.',	'2017-10-21 14:13:41',	'2017-10-21 14:13:41'),
(41685,	2310,	122,	'to be submissive to my masters no matter what kind of attitude they have, to have a broken and contrite heart unconsciously and to handle unfair treatment correctly.',	'2017-10-21 14:13:41',	'2017-10-21 14:13:41'),
(41686,	2310,	123,	'it was happened in my high school days, when i tried to be unfair to my one of my classmate. i grabbed his things with my loud voice, but he refused and grabbing backed his things to me and told that he tell to his brothers what i have done. and he said that their brothers are punching me. i thank God that its not happened and the little lad become my friend. i have a lesson for this that we don\'t judged the book by its cover and sinking to my head that every man i meet is my superior in that i learn of them. and i experienced what is the feeling of being maltreated, in my case, i do my very best and it was bad at all. i can\'t justified myself, my mouth did not open. in my thought, that i want to revenge but i know that it would not be happened because she is my aunt. so, i just keep my self calmed ( i was not a Christian that time). now i have a revelation and thanks to this lesson about the little lad i am trying to bullied. he told me that he want a revenge and calls his brothers to punch me. as i am a Christian now, when unfair treatment happen again to me, i still keep my mouth shut and live my case to the hands of God. because He said, vengeance is mine. my lesson is this, It is better to be defend in the hands of God, rather than the hands of man.',	'2017-10-21 14:13:41',	'2017-10-21 14:13:41'),
(41687,	2008,	3196,	'CARE ministry allows people to establish relationship with God and other people in the church even before stepping into the church building.\r\nCARE ministry opens up opportunities for people to have real responsibilities and real authority  in taking care and nurturing people.\r\nCARE ministry opens up opportunities for people to have real responsibilities and real authority in taking care and nurturing people.',	'2017-10-20 17:56:01',	'2017-10-20 17:56:01'),
(41688,	2008,	3197,	'I will be more involved with taking care of guests and newly-baptized people in our church. I understand that these people need to be guided well and that I need to reach out more to be able to establish a good relationship with them.',	'2017-10-20 17:56:01',	'2017-10-20 17:56:01'),
(41689,	2008,	3198,	'Being part of the care/cell group ministry in FJF was a life-changing experience for me. It helped me establish my fellowship with brethren, become more responsible for new converts and explore ways on how to evangelize.',	'2017-10-20 17:56:01',	'2017-10-20 17:56:01'),
(41690,	2008,	3211,	'If you want true intimacy with God, you cannot have that except when the body of Christ comes together.\r\nThere is a different degree of influence biblically when we pray as a group, together, than there is when we pray by ourselves.\r\nThere is a bonding effect when meal was being shared throughout the Scriptures.',	'2017-10-21 14:15:19',	'2017-10-21 14:15:19'),
(41691,	2008,	3212,	'i will be more encouraged to come and attend home fellowship and would be more motivated knowing that this is a way to build intimacy with God.',	'2017-10-21 14:15:19',	'2017-10-21 14:15:19'),
(41692,	2008,	3213,	'The effectual fervent prayer of the righteous man availeth much. And so it is much more effective, much more powerful and moving when saints come together and pray in unity. There is power in united prayer.',	'2017-10-21 14:15:19',	'2017-10-21 14:15:19'),
(41693,	2310,	136,	'that our spiritual maturity measures for what is our response to the sin of others, especially those our leaders who is the one of the greatest indicators because God often uses the faults or the mistakes and even sins of authority in our lives to expose the true conditions of our heart.\r\naccording to the testimony of pastor John, that every person that left in the church ministry, have one reason, complaining about their pastor, leadership etc. Judgment comes their lives. that it manifest in the areas of their financial problems, sickness, etc.\r\nthat it is mistaken for us when our gifting from God allowed us to elevates ourselves and be arrogant, and it\'s not true humility, they are above authority, sometimes title or position makes people proud. but still, looking unto Jesus.',	'2017-10-21 14:53:49',	'2017-10-21 14:53:49'),
(41694,	2310,	137,	'I want to reach my full spiritual maturity and i want to have a true humility in my life.',	'2017-10-21 14:53:49',	'2017-10-21 14:53:49'),
(41695,	2310,	138,	'self inflicted judgment normally build on ourselves, and i am guilty for this. usually i am out spoken, especially when my bet candidates are losing in election. my emotions rise up and i judged the authority by mouth. I was a new convert, and i believed that my doctrine is the truth. and usually i am opinionated to the other Christian denominations. and sinking in my head that their leaders are false teachers. then one day, the Holy Spirit wake me up for my judgmental attitude! I am reading Philippians 1: 17-18, \"but the latter out of love, knowing that i appointed for the defense of the gospel, what then? only that in every way, whether in pretense or in truth, Christ is preached; and in this I rejoice, yes, and will rejoice. thanks for this revelation! I will never ever judged other especially our leaders.',	'2017-10-21 14:53:49',	'2017-10-21 14:53:49'),
(41696,	2002,	3286,	'The Church is called the body of Christ. He created the body specifically to grow and multiply.\r\nBirth of water according to Jesus is a separation of our paat from one world to another or from old kingdom to a new kingdom.\r\nThat repentance is a change of direction.',	'2017-10-21 07:41:55',	'2017-10-21 07:41:55'),
(41697,	2002,	3287,	'That we are our brothers keeper. We should care, look and mutually dependent to one another.',	'2017-10-21 07:41:55',	'2017-10-21 07:41:55'),
(41698,	2002,	3288,	'The church needs a father and mother dimensions of leadership. Their roles to be performed in the family are not the same.',	'2017-10-21 07:41:55',	'2017-10-21 07:41:55'),
(41699,	2002,	3301,	'Home group ministry is more likely effective to take care  of the people or the converts to have fellowship to one another. Taking care of the flocks is also one of God\'s plan.\r\nShepherds don\'t grow flocks but rather takes care of them. Shepherds do not produce sheep, only sheep begets and conceived sheep.\r\nThat the purpose of oversight in the church is to be there for support, for encouragement, for instruction and for further equipping when necessary.',	'2017-10-21 08:09:38',	'2017-10-21 08:09:38'),
(41700,	2002,	3302,	'To be part of the ministry in taking care of the babies or new converts, for they need attention and need to be loved.',	'2017-10-21 08:09:38',	'2017-10-21 08:09:38'),
(41701,	2002,	3303,	'That love is a very powerful force that binds people to church together.',	'2017-10-21 08:09:38',	'2017-10-21 08:09:38'),
(41702,	2002,	3316,	'That fellowship means sharing, mutual communication, communion, close association and joint participation.\r\nThat true unity is a miracle of God. Through the unity of the church, Jesus is revealed to the world when their is love for one another.\r\nWe\'re not getting judgemental if there is love and forgiveness in the body or in the church.',	'2017-10-21 09:07:56',	'2017-10-21 09:07:56'),
(41703,	2002,	3317,	'To love one another as Christ loves His church. The Lord Jesus wants to see His church have the love for one another and be united as one.',	'2017-10-21 09:07:56',	'2017-10-21 09:07:56'),
(41704,	2002,	3318,	'I thank God for the love He has given us and for teaching and letting us to love one another, not just in words but in action.',	'2017-10-21 09:07:56',	'2017-10-21 09:07:56'),
(41705,	2002,	3331,	'God\'s goal for us is to be perfect or mature and from there we will be fruitful. No longer like children toss to and fro by various doctrine.\r\nThe church must increase in the atmosphere of love.\r\nEverybody has a place in the body of Christ. There must be no competition in the body.',	'2017-10-21 09:46:39',	'2017-10-21 09:46:39'),
(41706,	2002,	3332,	'To get mature and have a positive opinion or motive not negative.',	'2017-10-21 09:46:39',	'2017-10-21 09:46:39'),
(41707,	2002,	3333,	'To be a true Apostolic follower.',	'2017-10-21 09:46:39',	'2017-10-21 09:46:39'),
(41708,	2110,	226,	'Avenging yourselves is unrighteous thing. When God avenges it is a righteous thing.\r\nPsalm 92:13 (NKJV) \"Those who are planted in the house of the Lord Shall flourish in the courts of our God.\"\r\nWhen people are offended, they become a spiritual vagabond because of a persecution complex.',	'2017-10-22 05:54:42',	'2017-10-22 05:54:42'),
(41709,	2110,	227,	'When people are offended, they become a spiritual vagabond because of a persecution complex.\r\n\r\nLike Cain, He was not able to handle the offense...many of us became spiritual vagabonds. We let offenses as an open door for sin and self persecution. We did not allow the will of God, His promises, as we never allow offenses to pass and refine us. We never satisfy ourselves from what we gain or expect from the church, from a relationship or from our leaders.',	'2017-10-22 05:54:42',	'2017-10-22 05:54:42'),
(41710,	2110,	228,	'In order not to become spiritual vagabonds, we ought to be rooted and planted in our church. God appointed us to our home church or spiritual group. Let us trust His plans and allow any offenses to pass without avenging ourselves or to others. May we find the peace in all His words for it shall come to pass and soon will be together with our Lord in Heaven.',	'2017-10-22 05:54:42',	'2017-10-22 05:54:42'),
(41711,	231,	3331,	'An injury to the structure/joint is more injurious than an injury to a member\r\nif i’m not in unity, there is something wrong with my motives. i can’t be in unity with you and compete with you. if i am in competition with somebody, i am not pleasing God.\r\n\r\nWe all have our place in the body - there is nothing to compete over. how can i be in competition with you over the will of God for me today?\r\n\r\nIt is not our performance that determines our place, it is the plan of God.\r\nBecause of structure, koinonia will come. Because of koinonia, unity will come. Because of unity, the love of God will flow - growth, revival and harvest will take place.',	'2017-10-21 12:30:21',	'2017-10-21 12:30:21'),
(41712,	231,	3332,	'If I want to see revival happen in my day, I must be as equally committed to and invested in unity and koinonia, as I am in UTB.',	'2017-10-21 12:30:21',	'2017-10-21 12:30:21'),
(41713,	231,	3333,	'I feel like I really get this lesson because of my injury! Only 10% of my rehab has been about my ankle. 90% of my rehab has been on the other parts of my leg and body and in fact, that is more important than my actual ankle that was dislocated or the bone that were broken/1',	'2017-10-21 12:30:21',	'2017-10-21 12:30:21'),
(41714,	2008,	3226,	'What God does to me as He flows through me to others, is more powerful and more effective in affecting my  life than what I used to receive when the focus was on what He was doing for me and to me and nothing else\r\nGoing from immaturity to maturity is a process, it is not an event.\r\nThe purpose of leaving the principles of the doctrine of Christ is so that we can go on unto perfection.',	'2017-10-21 15:39:43',	'2017-10-21 15:39:43'),
(41715,	2008,	3227,	'I always have to bear in mind that I have to allow God to flow through me to others, because this is a more powerful testimony of the greatness of God.',	'2017-10-21 15:39:43',	'2017-10-21 15:39:43'),
(41716,	2008,	3228,	'What I give away for God never diminished, instead, it makes room for more supply. Nothing is hidden from the eyes of the Lord. All our labours for the Lord will never go wasted for they are opportunities to be blessed by God. True blessing is more than just what God has given and done for you. True blessing is also being able to be God\'s channel of blessing towards other people.',	'2017-10-21 15:39:43',	'2017-10-21 15:39:43'),
(41717,	2008,	3241,	'A child that never grows up is considered afflicted (handicapped).\r\nThe larger the intended building, the more solid the foundation must be.\r\nOnly a revelation can defeat the spirit of religious traditions.',	'2017-10-22 16:23:22',	'2017-10-22 16:23:22'),
(41718,	2008,	3242,	'I have to learn more to take ownership of the doctrine and make it more the foundation of my life. This way, I will be more willing to let God flow through me and be a blessing to other people around me, specially for the new converts in the church.',	'2017-10-22 16:23:22',	'2017-10-22 16:23:22'),
(41719,	2008,	3243,	'It is not necessary for us to pray for the harvest, because we all know that it is already the will of God. What is better is to pray for ourselves to be more willing to be used by God for the harvest.',	'2017-10-22 16:23:22',	'2017-10-22 16:23:22'),
(41720,	2000,	196,	'True discernment is rooted in the love of God.\r\nNo one can get you out of the will of God.\r\nGod hates complaining and you should treat complaining as poison.',	'2017-10-25 11:02:52',	'2017-10-25 11:02:52'),
(41721,	2000,	197,	'Stop complaining.',	'2017-10-25 11:02:52',	'2017-10-25 11:02:52'),
(41722,	2000,	198,	'Sometimes life\'s hardship will get you to a point where you would really want to start complaining - but we should always rememeber that God hates complaining and we should rather feed on His faithfulness, and recall how He has been so good to you.',	'2017-10-25 11:02:52',	'2017-10-25 11:02:52'),
(41723,	2003,	3196,	'In this lesson,CARE ministry really opens up opportunities for people to know  and how to establish a relationship w/ God.\r\nIt also allows the ministry to minister in taking care of the new converts.\r\nIts worth to know that shepherd don\'t produce sheeps-sheep produce sheep.',	'2017-10-22 04:44:34',	'2017-10-22 04:44:34'),
(41724,	2003,	3197,	'To be able to participate & be a part of the ministry in teaching people the apostolic way.',	'2017-10-22 04:44:34',	'2017-10-22 04:44:34'),
(41725,	2003,	3198,	'To share with other people this teachings esp to those who are lost,and be a vessel or conduit  for them of what we know about God.',	'2017-10-22 04:44:34',	'2017-10-22 04:44:34'),
(41726,	2110,	241,	'Matthew 5:44‐45\r\nBut I say to you, love your enemies, bless those who curse you, do good to those who hate you, and pray for those who spitefully use you and persecute you, that you may be sons of your Father in heaven; for He makes His sun rise on the evil and on the good, and sends rain on the just and on the unjust.\r\nWhen you defend yourself, you create an atmosphere in your heart that makes you a prime candidate for offence.\r\nGod is trying to get you up another level but if you react you have to relearn… you are not matured enough to handle the next level.',	'2017-10-24 09:16:13',	'2017-10-24 09:16:13'),
(41727,	2110,	242,	'God is trying to get you up another level but if you react you have to relearn… you are not matured enough to handle the next level.\r\n\r\nJust like joseph and other biblical characters that were offended and suffered yet endured and trusted in the Lord... We, the church must also know how to deal with offenses because God is trying to bring us to the next level. He is refining and making us matured Sons of God. We must apply the scriptures that God gave us in dealing and overcoming offense.',	'2017-10-24 09:16:13',	'2017-10-24 09:16:13'),
(41728,	2110,	243,	'You cannot escape from being offended. But God will help you overcome it. We can easily get offended, from small to big things. But always remember that offense is a door to sin. There are times that we cannot understand the situation, it seems like we are treated unjustly but Jesus set an example for us. He prayed for His enemies. He loved the people that mistreated Him. He showed patience, compassion and meekness. As Sons of God, we need to follow what Jesus did. We need to apply it in our daily lives.',	'2017-10-24 09:16:13',	'2017-10-24 09:16:13'),
(41729,	263,	3466,	'It is essential to overcome the fear of going against tradition as Long as it is enhancing the will of the Lord.\r\nTo be careful of the upholding heritage as it can turn into religion/tradition.\r\nAlthough elders may warn of going against tradition, it is important to hear from God and work out the best method to bring the message across efficiently and effectively.',	'2017-10-23 15:38:25',	'2017-10-23 15:38:25'),
(41730,	263,	3467,	'To be flexible and versatile in the methodology as Long as the message can be brought across better. Different folks different strokes, thus we cannot be stuck in our box or a set of format for outreach and church services',	'2017-10-23 15:38:25',	'2017-10-23 15:38:25'),
(41731,	263,	3468,	'Nil',	'2017-10-23 15:38:25',	'2017-10-23 15:38:25'),
(41732,	263,	3481,	'Our evangelism should focus on the needs of the people and not about bringing them to church. We gotta let them know that we first care about them.\r\nA bible study can become a care group and a care group can become a preaching points and a preaching point can become an altar work and an altar Work can become a church.\r\nThe result of tradition is worshipping God in vain. Repetition without connecting is likewise done in vain.',	'2017-10-23 15:49:35',	'2017-10-23 15:49:35'),
(41733,	263,	3482,	'To do outreach in a different manner, create a more intimate setting such as home gatherings or 1 to 1 meeting to create true connections and learn about he person’s needs and minister from the needs. Rely on prayers when situations get tough or unmovable.',	'2017-10-23 15:49:35',	'2017-10-23 15:49:35'),
(41734,	263,	3483,	'Great series. Thanks.',	'2017-10-23 15:49:35',	'2017-10-23 15:49:35'),
(41735,	3828,	5866,	'Prayer is for our benefit so that we can ready ourselves to what God is doing or about to send our way. Prayer is to help us receive the will of God. God is ready and able to deal with Satan at all times, however it\'s His desire to do it through us. Prayer is our lifeline to God and His authority.\r\nOur posture when praying is a sign of where we are spiritually. There is a time to kneel and cry when needing forgiveness, however if we are always in need of forgiveness it could be a sign we are in a continued life of sin. God want us to live in victory and pray in authority. We need not be afraid and we have dominion over the sin in our life.\r\nOur Lord has given us the spirit of authority and power to war against principalities. We are able to \"stand\" in the whole armor of God. We do not compromise or have discussions with Satan. We give orders! We speak with a voice of authority and as we bind up Satan warring with us for control over a particular person or principality, the blood of Jesus is flowing in all directions breaking the chains of bondage and liberating people all over the earth.',	'2017-10-22 16:27:52',	'2017-10-22 16:27:52'),
(41736,	3828,	5867,	'Stand therefore, in the whole armor of God. Living in the truth. covered in righteousness, wearing the shoes of peace and a helmet of salvation, carrying the shield of faith and holding high the sword of the Spirit.',	'2017-10-22 16:27:52',	'2017-10-22 16:27:52'),
(41737,	3828,	5868,	'Remember it is not recommended to pray against spirit of anti-Christ individually, but join together with the saints and have no fear because there is an army of warring angels on our side.',	'2017-10-22 16:27:52',	'2017-10-22 16:27:52'),
(41738,	973,	1291,	'We must learn and maintain and protect our ability to speak from the heart\r\nLack of fear leads to the lifestyle of rote\r\nGod will never tell us to do something He Himself has not done',	'2017-10-22 18:54:11',	'2017-10-22 18:54:11'),
(41739,	973,	1292,	'to ensure that the fear of Lord is with me and watch things I say to others.',	'2017-10-22 18:54:11',	'2017-10-22 18:54:11'),
(41740,	973,	1293,	'I think when it becomes routine that we don\'t say things from the heart to other people, I also may take words from others as just a saying, don\'t take that words as truly from heart. it\'s to become hypocrisy.',	'2017-10-22 18:54:11',	'2017-10-22 18:54:11'),
(41741,	2310,	166,	'that without faith, it is impossible to please God but faith is not faith at all unless you have corresponding obedient actions.\r\nto keep our faith strong is to maintain the attitude of humility.\r\nby obedient action, understanding and submission to the authority and maintaining the attitude of true humility, God commends this for great faith, like Abraham and the Roman centurion.',	'2017-10-23 02:46:49',	'2017-10-23 02:46:49'),
(41742,	2310,	167,	'to have the faith with obedient action. maintain the attitude of true humility and have an understanding and living in authority that built in my personality.',	'2017-10-23 02:46:49',	'2017-10-23 02:46:49'),
(41743,	2310,	168,	'i am overlooking the word \"faith\", when i took this lesson, now i know that i have a little faith only, like the apostle\'s cried to the Lord. increase their faith! that\'s my request too. and the keys for these are the three important points which Jesus taught. there is a direct connection between faith and obedience to authority, faith increases only when we complete what we are commanded to do and an attitude of true humility is of utmost important.',	'2017-10-23 02:46:49',	'2017-10-23 02:46:49'),
(41744,	2005,	301,	'A servant lays down his rights.\r\nBe more concerned about serving your brothers than receiving your right\r\nWe don\'t use our privilege to serve ourselves but throug love...',	'2017-10-23 12:43:18',	'2017-10-23 12:43:18'),
(41745,	2005,	302,	'Not to stumble our brothers',	'2017-10-23 12:43:18',	'2017-10-23 12:43:18'),
(41746,	2005,	303,	'What you do with offense, will determine your future',	'2017-10-23 12:43:18',	'2017-10-23 12:43:18'),
(41747,	2005,	316,	'We were forgiven of unpayable debt when Jesus died on the cross.\r\nWe just don\'t know what we did to Jesus when we take an offense\r\nA person that refuses to forgive, will cost them their salvation.',	'2017-10-23 12:59:20',	'2017-10-23 12:59:20'),
(41748,	2005,	317,	'Forgiveness - you don\'t give, you don\'t get',	'2017-10-23 12:59:20',	'2017-10-23 12:59:20'),
(41749,	2005,	318,	'God\'s word/promise will always come to pass as long as you don\'t get offended.',	'2017-10-23 12:59:20',	'2017-10-23 12:59:20'),
(41750,	2005,	331,	'Offense is a serious thing, it is the bait of Satan to pull you into his trap.\r\nWhen you hold onto that offense, you hold on to unfulfilled revenge.\r\nBitterness - is a root, if not dealt with quickly, roots are hard to pull up, it will continue to grow.',	'2017-10-23 13:22:48',	'2017-10-23 13:22:48'),
(41751,	2005,	332,	'Letting go of that offense...',	'2017-10-23 13:22:48',	'2017-10-23 13:22:48'),
(41752,	2005,	333,	'God\'s word/promise will always come to pass, as long as you don\'t get offended.',	'2017-10-23 13:22:48',	'2017-10-23 13:22:48'),
(41753,	2005,	346,	'There are offenses that wound and don\'t heal overnight.\r\nIf wounds (offence) not properly treated, wounds will never heal.\r\nJesus forgave us even before we say we are sorry.',	'2017-10-23 13:40:54',	'2017-10-23 13:40:54'),
(41754,	2005,	347,	'What we do with an offense, will determine our future.',	'2017-10-23 13:40:54',	'2017-10-23 13:40:54'),
(41755,	2005,	348,	'God\'s word/promises will always comes to pass, as long as you don\'t get offended.',	'2017-10-23 13:40:54',	'2017-10-23 13:40:54'),
(41756,	2005,	3196,	'Being Apostolic is not just living by Apostolic doctrine but also following the Apostles\' method.\r\nThat the church has 2 dimensions of ministry... Public & Private\r\nIt is very hard to establish relationship with church members even if we have 3-4 times weekly church service...',	'2017-10-31 06:16:43',	'2017-10-31 06:16:43'),
(41757,	2005,	3197,	'To establish good relationship with other people in the church even before stepping in the  church building.',	'2017-10-31 06:16:43',	'2017-10-31 06:16:43'),
(41758,	2005,	3198,	'Praise the Lord',	'2017-10-31 06:16:43',	'2017-10-31 06:16:43'),
(41759,	2008,	3256,	'Whenever God institutes or introduces a new principle or concept, He always introduces it in an application that is at its extreme.\r\nYou cannot make a disciple by preaching.You make a disciple by teaching.\r\n.\r\nGod wanted His people to be included in the work of the Lord, not just being spectators in the church service.',	'2017-10-23 15:05:25',	'2017-10-23 15:05:25'),
(41760,	2008,	3257,	'God has always wanted for every saint to be used for His kingdom. With this, we have to allow ourselves to be used/involved in ministries, in this way we are allowing God to flow through us and be used for His glory.',	'2017-10-23 15:05:25',	'2017-10-23 15:05:25'),
(41761,	2008,	3258,	'Being involved in ministry, together with prayer, reading the word of God and fasting, are essential to have more intimacy with God. Whatever ministry may it be, if it is done for the Lord,  is never, ever wasted.',	'2017-10-23 15:05:25',	'2017-10-23 15:05:25'),
(41762,	2008,	3271,	'The purpose of the 5 fold-gifting to the church is that they would fully equip the saints to the work of their ministry that the church may grow thereby.\r\nThe focal point of the ministry is the field  not the barn.\r\nYou can produce converts but not disciples  through the flesh.',	'2017-10-27 15:50:41',	'2017-10-27 15:50:41'),
(41763,	2008,	3272,	'I will focus more on the \'field\' by reaching out to the lost, through sharing His word to people around me.',	'2017-10-27 15:50:41',	'2017-10-27 15:50:41'),
(41764,	2008,	3273,	'I just realized that I have been idle for the past years in terms of evangelizing. I have to be more involved in this ministry because many souls still need to hear the teachings about the salvation that comes from Jesus,',	'2017-10-27 15:50:41',	'2017-10-27 15:50:41'),
(41765,	4015,	1291,	'It takes both holy fear and unconditional love to walk in true honor.\r\nHonor can\'t only be done in pretense.\r\nWhen the fear of God is in you, you will not speak deceit, you will speak from the heart.',	'2017-10-24 06:59:51',	'2017-10-24 06:59:51'),
(41766,	4015,	1292,	'To honor my peers even when they\'ve wronged me.',	'2017-10-24 06:59:51',	'2017-10-24 06:59:51'),
(41767,	4015,	1293,	'The fear of the Lord keeps us from deception.',	'2017-10-24 06:59:51',	'2017-10-24 06:59:51'),
(41768,	2110,	256,	'Revealed Knowledge (Revelation) is more powerful and enduring than sense knowledge – which will cause you to be stable.\r\nPsalm 28:1\r\nTo You I will cry, O LORD my Rock: Do not be silent to me, Lest, if You are silent to me, I become like those who go down to the pit.\r\nJohn 6:68\r\nThen Simon Peter answered him,\r\nLord, to whom shall we go? Thou hast the words of eternal life. And we believe and are sure that thou art that Christ, the Son of the living God.',	'2017-10-24 10:25:18',	'2017-10-24 10:25:18'),
(41769,	2110,	257,	'John 6:68\r\nThen Simon Peter answered him,\r\nLord, to whom shall we go? Thou hast the words of eternal life. And we believe and are sure that thou art that Christ, the Son of the living God.\r\n\r\nIt was the revealed knowledge of Christ that kept Peter from leaving Jesus. Therefore, we should have the hunger to receive that revealed knowledge of Christ for us to become stable and overcome offenses in our lives.',	'2017-10-24 10:25:18',	'2017-10-24 10:25:18'),
(41770,	2110,	258,	'Pray without ceasing – Communication with God without ceasing. I am strucked by Psalm 28:1, wherein communicating with God, hearing His voice, being senstitive to His voice and having a dialogue with Him is very vital. I\'d love to have that deep passion in knowing and hearing more from God and becoming stable and strong in His words.',	'2017-10-24 10:25:18',	'2017-10-24 10:25:18'),
(41771,	2110,	271,	'Luke 22:24\r\nNow there was also a dispute among them, as to which of them should be considered the greatest.\r\nWe are to be rooted in the Love of God.\r\nIf we got the revelation that He is love, we can trust Him.\r\nPeter was shaken down to the foundation and upon that foundation the Lord built upon his life.\r\nIf you have that foundation, you will not be offended.',	'2017-10-26 07:08:26',	'2017-10-26 07:08:26'),
(41772,	2110,	272,	'We are to be rooted in the Love of God.\r\nIf we got the revelation that He is love, we can trust Him.\r\n\r\nI want to follow how Peter was rooted in the love of God. I also want the Revelation of Christ in my life so that my foundation will not be shaken.',	'2017-10-26 07:08:26',	'2017-10-26 07:08:26'),
(41773,	2110,	273,	'Had a new revelation on John 21:15.\r\nAs part of the care ministry, I can put myself on Peter\'s position when Christ asked Him to feed His lambs.  \r\n\r\n\"Peter was being shaken down to the core and he is no longer boasting in his own abilities.\r\nPeter has nothing hidden from Him now.  \r\nHe knows he does not have the love to lay his life down. And this is what Jesus sees in Peter.\"\r\n\r\nIf we have the foundation just like Peter, we will not be offended.',	'2017-10-26 07:08:26',	'2017-10-26 07:08:26'),
(41774,	3828,	5881,	'In spiritual warfare, authoritative prayer is a powerful weapon because it is God coming down and moving through His Church. The momentum changes when we stop asking God to perform for us and allow His Spirit to work through us. We become the voice of God and declare what He wants in the earth.\r\nUnlike our ordinary prayers upwards to God, authoritative prayer begins in heaven and travel downwards. We become the vessels through which those heavenly prayers flow. Even the angels harken to the voice of God\'s word and go with us in the battle. Authoritative prayer tears the fabric of the spirit world as we command what God has commanded, souls are saved and the captives are set free.\r\nIn spiritual warfare we are covered by the blood of Jesus and there is nothing that Satan can do to stop us. Every time Satan comes against us just open the scripture and read to him. \" Thus shall it be\" concerning the enemy far beneath our feet, for we have been given the \"Power\" over all the power of the enemy and nothing shall by any means hurt us. Darkness is under our feet and God has said, \"command ye Me,\" concerning the works of My hand.',	'2017-10-28 16:27:56',	'2017-10-28 16:27:56'),
(41775,	3828,	5882,	'Operate and pray with the understanding it\'s God\'s will that every soul on earth be saved and until that time I have the right and authority to control the spirit world.',	'2017-10-28 16:27:56',	'2017-10-28 16:27:56'),
(41776,	3828,	5883,	'\"Let it rain, let it rain, open the floodgates of heaven,\" these lyrics we sing to God, but do we take to heart that we are the \"floodgates of heaven.\" Am I willing that God shall open me up and let a river of Living Water flow?',	'2017-10-28 16:27:56',	'2017-10-28 16:27:56'),
(41777,	4015,	1306,	'True leadership wants to see their people do better than they have.\r\nThe way we treat little ones is the way we treat Jesus.\r\nThe difference between the two types of leadership is found in the heart of the leader.',	'2017-10-25 07:59:12',	'2017-10-25 07:59:12'),
(41778,	4015,	1307,	'To speak positively from what the word of God says about people rather than to speak about what is seen about people.',	'2017-10-25 07:59:12',	'2017-10-25 07:59:12'),
(41779,	4015,	1308,	'we should always strive to be life enhancing leaders.',	'2017-10-25 07:59:12',	'2017-10-25 07:59:12'),
(41780,	2000,	211,	'God uses harsh leaders as purification vessels.\r\nGod ordains both good and harsh leaders.\r\nTurn an offense as a stepping stone in your life.',	'2017-10-25 11:56:29',	'2017-10-25 11:56:29'),
(41781,	2000,	212,	'There is no treatment that comes to you that is gone under God\'s radar.',	'2017-10-25 11:56:29',	'2017-10-25 11:56:29'),
(41782,	2000,	213,	'Looking back to all those unfair treatment I recieved before, from my family, I can only thank God that he let me go through those - that made me the better person that I  now. I\'ve come to know how to handle the offenses moving forward.',	'2017-10-25 11:56:29',	'2017-10-25 11:56:29'),
(41783,	2310,	1171,	'the key essential to receiving from God is honor that restored among us!\r\ncomplaining is a rebellion and it is a huge frame of dishonor and it is insult to God\'s character.\r\nthat the key why people did not see any mighty works done in their lives by Jesus is because they did not give Him honor He deserves.',	'2017-10-30 20:24:34',	'2017-10-30 20:24:34'),
(41784,	2310,	1172,	'familiarity causes to limit our mind and i don\'t want to have an attitude like this to my neighbor because i wanna see Jesus to them.',	'2017-10-30 20:24:34',	'2017-10-30 20:24:34'),
(41785,	2310,	1173,	'as a Christian, I have found out that I have to honor the four delegated authority and i have no excuses for. Sometime, i am dishonoring other but as i grow in spirit and this lesson i have take, i have learned much more how to honor them.',	'2017-10-30 20:24:34',	'2017-10-30 20:24:34'),
(41786,	2003,	3211,	'Its ttue,relationship w/ God provides opportunities to learn more\r\nSharing the word of God bonds brethren w/ the people.\r\nBonding ministry at home can be usefyul too,to unite family...',	'2017-10-25 16:14:56',	'2017-10-25 16:14:56'),
(41787,	2003,	3212,	'Too provide help for others to understands the word of God .',	'2017-10-25 16:14:56',	'2017-10-25 16:14:56'),
(41788,	2003,	3213,	'Through fellowships,every one i n the body..brings harmony & togetherness in the ministry.',	'2017-10-25 16:14:56',	'2017-10-25 16:14:56'),
(41789,	2310,	1186,	'that a roman centurion have an understanding and honoring to Jesus and the commendation of Jesus to him for his great faith no one found in Israel.\r\nif we scan the Bible we discover that there are full, partial and no reward at all. and it\'s incident have meekly reflects the stewardship of honor.\r\nthere are two major points Jesus taught, by showing the authority structure of the kingdom. 1. it is referring to the Father, Him, and the offices of the church. the five fold ministry and 2. by showing to us in dealing with every human being we have met in our lives.',	'2017-10-30 21:26:36',	'2017-10-30 21:26:36'),
(41790,	2310,	1187,	'i want a full understanding and honoring to authority at all times',	'2017-10-30 21:26:36',	'2017-10-30 21:26:36'),
(41791,	2310,	1188,	'when we are started working as building electrician with my friend. we develop a harmonious relationship with our co-workers not only in electrical but the whole department of that building. we became  friends. except our engineer, he thought that we are threat to him. one day, there was a trouble in one of the unit, and the problem is the masonry works and it will affects on our job. because of the bad attitude of our engineer, no one would cooperate him. so i made my own way, i called my mason friend and we fixed together the damaged. the lesson i thought is, by honoring people around you, they are the one who help you in time of trouble. then i get my full reward. were it was the problem of both side. it was glory of God.',	'2017-10-30 21:26:36',	'2017-10-30 21:26:36'),
(41792,	3892,	5866,	'We must stand in a position of victory.\r\nOur posture in prayer is an indicator where we are in the spirit.\r\nYou never compromise with the devil, you give him orders.',	'2017-10-25 18:34:09',	'2017-10-25 18:34:09'),
(41793,	3892,	5867,	'To live and pray in a position of Victory in Jesus.',	'2017-10-25 18:34:09',	'2017-10-25 18:34:09'),
(41794,	3892,	5868,	'To know that I have authority given by Jesus, and not to let fear come in. God wants his church to be powerful and to live in victory.',	'2017-10-25 18:34:09',	'2017-10-25 18:34:09'),
(41795,	3892,	5881,	'In spiritual warfare, praying authoritatively means praying downward.\r\nAuthoritative prayer is different from ordinary prayer, it begins in heaven and ends on earth. It is God\'s anointing coming upon us.\r\nEvery time you feel that the devil is coming at you, open the scriptures and read them to him.',	'2017-10-25 19:14:30',	'2017-10-25 19:14:30'),
(41796,	3892,	5882,	'To realize the position God has given me and make a switch in my mind and see myself and pray form that position. As having victory and authority in Jesus.',	'2017-10-25 19:14:30',	'2017-10-25 19:14:30'),
(41797,	3892,	5883,	'I thought it was very cool how he explained that Psalms 91 is referring to the believers. I had never realized or looked at it that way.',	'2017-10-25 19:14:30',	'2017-10-25 19:14:30'),
(41798,	4101,	181,	'Offense is essentially a progressive trap that leads to isolation and hatred. And forgiveness is a form of armor to fight against it.\r\nStrongholds are reasoning\'s that are contrary to the will of God.\r\nIt is important to forgive. When someone comes to repent or apologize, we need to forgive. If we don\'t offense still lives within us, meaning we\'re still in his trap. Forgiveness is our way out of the trap set for us by the, as he referred to them, fake prophets.',	'2017-10-25 20:10:34',	'2017-10-25 20:10:34'),
(41799,	4101,	182,	'I identify as a sheep dog. Shepherds have sheepdogs to help protect the sheep. Sheep dogs are protective and selfless. Putting themselves between the wolf and the sheep. I have to remember that, as he said, betrayal can disguise itself as protection but at the expense of someone else. That means in my efforts to protect, I could offend and I should remember that when taking any action.',	'2017-10-25 20:10:34',	'2017-10-25 20:10:34'),
(41800,	4101,	183,	'This is good stuff. and the comedic relief of the attire worn by the people in the audience adds humor to the already enjoyable seminar.',	'2017-10-25 20:10:34',	'2017-10-25 20:10:34'),
(41801,	4101,	196,	'No one can get you out of God\'s will but you... That\'s a powerful realization to me. To stay aware that even if we blame shift our distance from doing God\'s will on others, Its really still on us because its a result of how we respond to those offenses.\r\nHe says \"it was almost as if Joseph was a living dead man...He\'s got to live the rest of his life thinking \"what I could have had.\"\" That hits me hard because I wrestle with the same thoughts. I sometimes focus on what I could\'ve been if I did this or that, if this or that hadn\'t happened to me, etc. Living as a dead man how can I live a life for God? Things begin to look up because he continues to obey God. He obeys for 10 years even when he has seen no promise come to pass.. That hits home too.\r\nYou can loose everything, all freedoms, but you will always have one freedom, the ability to respond correctly. Not to get offended... \"What if\" - can make a zombie out of you. Living dead.',	'2017-10-25 20:59:53',	'2017-10-25 20:59:53'),
(41802,	4101,	197,	'When I am weak, I need to remember to feed on God\'s Faithfulness. Its a simple prayer and it will allow me to combat the traps of the world.',	'2017-10-25 20:59:53',	'2017-10-25 20:59:53'),
(41803,	4101,	198,	'PIT. Preachers in Training. I\'ve been in my own pit. And Bishop once pulled me aside at the beginning of all of my stuff and told me that some of the strongest preachers are the ones that have been tested. When I was in jail I questioned why God had put me here. I was working with handicap kids, was a fire fighter, was active in church and thought I was doing his will. 3 months in the gladiator tank (it is exactly how it sounds) I questioned why. One day a kid woke me up, told me he needed me to know something. He said he had stayed up one night praying for guidance. He said the next day, when he got back from court, that i was on the bunk next to his. For me, that was the moment I realized that God\'s plan is greater than mine. I thought I had all the answers figured out and God said no and put me on his path. I ended up leading prayer every night while in that tank. It\'s a long story that i cut short but I just wanted to share that. I do feel like the ability to relate to others, being able to testify about being tested, and being active and used in the church as I am, has given me the opportunity to speak of God\'s love, his will, and how to overcome the traps that seek to use us against God.',	'2017-10-25 20:59:53',	'2017-10-25 20:59:53'),
(41804,	4101,	211,	'If we could only see what\'s on the other side of unfair treatment... The hardest times of life are the greatest stepping stones of growth. To get the blessing of it, we have to see the working of the holy spirit in our life of those times.\r\nWe never remain the same after encountering an offense.\r\nBoth sets of leaders are essential and used by God. If we are to go to war, it makes sense that we need to nurture our armor and refine our weapons. For me, its important to understand that God is working with me throughout.',	'2017-10-25 21:52:26',	'2017-10-25 21:52:26'),
(41805,	4101,	212,	'Matthew 18',	'2017-10-25 21:52:26',	'2017-10-25 21:52:26'),
(41806,	4101,	213,	'He says age 16 to 30 are the prime years... I\'m past my prime. Now I feel old. Ha ha\r\nBut then he says that trial period of Davids prime years were used to train his to become a shepherd. I like that.  He had to endure test, crucible, wilderness, etc in order to have the character needed to be the leader he was called to be. It gives me hope. \r\n\r\nAlso, on question number 2 of the fill in the blank section there\'s a typo. Referencing the video at 1:24 - 1:26 he states \"either you become stronger or you become BITTER\" the question says better. And question 3 on MCQ NURTURE it missing the first r. it says NUTURE.',	'2017-10-25 21:52:26',	'2017-10-25 21:52:26'),
(41807,	2003,	3226,	'That a mature christian does not come to church as their focus to get..but to give.\r\nLearned in this lesson that maturity is a process..it won\'t work overnight.\r\nThe church has to be matured enough to be of help to the people.',	'2017-10-25 22:35:01',	'2017-10-25 22:35:01'),
(41808,	2003,	3227,	'To participate in helping and teaching other people how to be a complete christian and help them make a desire to know the Lord..',	'2017-10-25 22:35:01',	'2017-10-25 22:35:01'),
(41809,	2003,	3228,	'Reaching maturity level in the ministry is not enough though..there has to be an application & put it in practice what we\'ve learned.',	'2017-10-25 22:35:01',	'2017-10-25 22:35:01'),
(41810,	4101,	226,	'Adversity causes roots (trees) to go deeper. Offense can send us uprooting and running away but we are harming ourselves and the fruit we may bare. If we stay rooted, we stand strong against offenses.\r\nOffense is the doorway to sin.\r\nIsolation can be caused by a persecution complex. Don\'t pick up the bait, stay rooted.',	'2017-10-25 22:36:16',	'2017-10-25 22:36:16'),
(41811,	4101,	227,	'If I allow the Holy Spirit to work in my life the way He wants to when adversity comes then I\'ll become sweeter in my fruit.',	'2017-10-25 22:36:16',	'2017-10-25 22:36:16'),
(41812,	4101,	228,	'I liked this section.',	'2017-10-25 22:36:16',	'2017-10-25 22:36:16'),
(41813,	2000,	226,	'When God is not speaking - don\'t change anything.\r\nYou don\'t get to choose where you go to church.\r\nGod has set the members in the body as He pleases.',	'2017-10-26 04:27:36',	'2017-10-26 04:27:36'),
(41814,	2000,	227,	'Avenge not yourselves - we always tend to try and get revenge to anyone who wronged us but the lesson said that it is unrighteous.',	'2017-10-26 04:27:36',	'2017-10-26 04:27:36'),
(41815,	2000,	228,	'It\'s good to hear examples wherein there\'s a bad leader but they have chosen to still honor them - it gives me a guide on how to react if I meet past (harsh) leaderships that I\'ve had.',	'2017-10-26 04:27:36',	'2017-10-26 04:27:36'),
(41816,	2000,	241,	'When you defend yourself, you forfeited your spiritual right to protection.\r\nWhen you defend yourself, you create an atmosphere in your heart that makes you a prime candidate for offence.\r\nThe next time you are unfaily treated - be glad because God is setting you up to be blessed, if you handle it correctly.',	'2017-10-26 05:12:12',	'2017-10-26 05:12:12'),
(41817,	2000,	242,	'Stop defending myself and not take the bait - so I will not lose my right to spiritual protection.',	'2017-10-26 05:12:12',	'2017-10-26 05:12:12'),
(41818,	2000,	243,	'Glad to have know the difference betweek Teknon and Huios and how it is reflected into tje scriptures.',	'2017-10-26 05:12:12',	'2017-10-26 05:12:12'),
(41819,	2000,	256,	'Revealed Knowledge (Revelation) is more powerful and enduring than sense knowledge – which will cause you\nto be stable.\r\nWhen God reveals something to you, nobody can ever take that from your life.\r\nYou build your life upon that revealed knowledge – that brings stability in your life that keeps you from getting\noffended.',	'2017-10-26 06:00:19',	'2017-10-26 06:00:19'),
(41820,	2000,	257,	'God is attracted to hunger - our level of hunger determines how healthy we are. This is really a good basis of what is your current status spiritually.',	'2017-10-26 06:00:19',	'2017-10-26 06:00:19'),
(41821,	2000,	258,	'When we feel that our hunger for (word of) God we should really be alerted, that we are getting sick, we should do all necessary things to get us back healthy spiritually - and that is when God will draw near to us again.',	'2017-10-26 06:00:19',	'2017-10-26 06:00:19'),
(41822,	2000,	271,	'Pride attracts the enemy.\r\nHaving a firm foundation of who the Lord Jesus is will keep us through.\r\nIf we got the revelation that He is love, we can trust Him.',	'2017-10-26 06:50:17',	'2017-10-26 06:50:17'),
(41823,	2000,	272,	'Always be hungry for the Lord Jesus Christ.',	'2017-10-26 06:50:17',	'2017-10-26 06:50:17'),
(41824,	2000,	273,	'The Lord does shaking - to awaken, harvest and unify His people, it\'s really good to have a firm foundation about who He really is in times like these.',	'2017-10-26 06:50:17',	'2017-10-26 06:50:17'),
(41825,	4015,	1321,	'if a husband dishonors his wife, his prayers will not be heard.\r\nhusbands will be given rewards for honoring her.\r\nGrace is lacking in a church that shuns the women.',	'2017-10-26 06:43:58',	'2017-10-26 06:43:58'),
(41826,	4015,	1322,	'To realize that men and women are equal in the body of Christ.',	'2017-10-26 06:43:58',	'2017-10-26 06:43:58'),
(41827,	4015,	1323,	'Husbands honor their wives by protecting them.',	'2017-10-26 06:43:58',	'2017-10-26 06:43:58'),
(41828,	2000,	286,	'To believe is to obey.\r\nGod will use offense to uproot people who do not belong to the kingdom.\r\nA person who preaches truth is a person who preaches the character of God.',	'2017-10-27 04:33:41',	'2017-10-27 04:33:41'),
(41829,	2000,	287,	'To be conformed in His image.',	'2017-10-27 04:33:41',	'2017-10-27 04:33:41'),
(41830,	2000,	288,	'Sometimes we are so careful about relaying God\'s message to another bretheren for them not to be offended. But we have to remember that Jesus Himself is The Rock of Offense - He use offense to uproot people who do not belong to the kingdom.',	'2017-10-27 04:33:41',	'2017-10-27 04:33:41'),
(41831,	2007,	3196,	'Even if we are having church 3-4 times a week, it is still very hard  to establish relationship with the church members, to take care of them and we cannot hold on people.\r\nHaving people involved in the ministry is the key purpose of care ministry.\r\nThe Care Ministry allows people to establish relationship with God and other people in the church even before stepping into the church building.',	'2017-10-26 07:32:10',	'2017-10-26 07:32:10'),
(41832,	2007,	3197,	'Praying that what i learned through this session will be done in our local preaching point.',	'2017-10-26 07:32:10',	'2017-10-26 07:32:10'),
(41833,	2007,	3198,	'Care ministry is a team effort without the sacrifices of time for everybody i think it will not push through because people always have an alibi.',	'2017-10-26 07:32:10',	'2017-10-26 07:32:10'),
(41834,	2007,	3211,	'The purpose of advancing is for us to perfection, maturity, completeness, and fruitfulness.\r\nImmature person goes to church to receive but a mature christian has learned that it is blessed to give than to receive.\r\nThere is a bonding effect when meal was being shared together in fellowship.',	'2017-10-26 07:43:08',	'2017-10-26 07:43:08'),
(41835,	2007,	3212,	'I will always put into mind the purpose of care fellowship.',	'2017-10-26 07:43:08',	'2017-10-26 07:43:08'),
(41836,	2007,	3213,	'We had a care ministry before but  because not everybody is available it as reschedule several time, but know i have a broad knowledge of the purpose, i think we can help by teaching our brethren the purpose of the care group ministry.',	'2017-10-26 07:43:08',	'2017-10-26 07:43:08'),
(41837,	2007,	3226,	'An immature christian goes to church to receive while the mature one does give because he learned that it is more blessed to give than to received.\r\nMaturity is a process, a day to day process a function of time.\r\nIf we are not progressing we are dead.',	'2017-10-26 07:53:32',	'2017-10-26 07:53:32'),
(41838,	2007,	3227,	'I will able what i learned to teach someone the lesson that i learned .',	'2017-10-26 07:53:32',	'2017-10-26 07:53:32'),
(41839,	2007,	3228,	'What kept me through the years of serving our Almighty God is His grace and love toward me.in my way i could have done it, He gave me thirst to know Him and His purpose in my life',	'2017-10-26 07:53:32',	'2017-10-26 07:53:32'),
(41840,	2007,	3241,	'Growth is change.\r\nWhen a church is barren, it has shame, just like a woman that is barren  she has shame.\r\nPeople need to take ownership and make the doctrine their won.',	'2017-10-26 08:04:45',	'2017-10-26 08:04:45'),
(41841,	2007,	3242,	'I will help the young people and the new convert to find their place in the ministry, i will teach them lesson so that their knowledge of this faith will be deeper.',	'2017-10-26 08:04:45',	'2017-10-26 08:04:45'),
(41842,	2007,	3243,	'When I was knew to this faith, I was very very hungry and would love to ask so many question about Jesus.I might have a little knowledge about Him but it was not from the Bible so i treasured everything that I learned. It s really important to have somebody answer all your questions about this faith.',	'2017-10-26 08:04:45',	'2017-10-26 08:04:45'),
(41843,	2110,	286,	'According to Romans 9:33, Jesus is also known as the \"Rock of offense\".\r\nA person that preaches the truth, preaches the character of God.\r\nTruth is the sword that will pierce our soul.',	'2017-10-26 15:12:45',	'2017-10-26 15:12:45'),
(41844,	2110,	287,	'A person that preaches the truth, preaches the character of God. He is focused in conforming others in the image of God and that is the goal of Christianity, to be conformed in His image.',	'2017-10-26 15:12:45',	'2017-10-26 15:12:45'),
(41845,	2110,	288,	'We have to deal and confront the Rock of Offense in order for us to have a revelation of the truth and be rooted in His love and in His word. \r\nWe may offend our loved ones in sharing the truth, but it is the way that we can reach out to them. If we put God first, He will take care of our personal needs.',	'2017-10-26 15:12:45',	'2017-10-26 15:12:45'),
(41846,	2007,	3256,	'If God can tamed the most unruly member of our body which is the tongue, He  has power over our lives.\r\nWe should always inquire about the will of God in all things.\r\nTo man to be burned out he is doing what he thinks is right, but when we are doing the will of God, He will strengthen us,',	'2017-10-26 08:13:52',	'2017-10-26 08:13:52'),
(41847,	2007,	3257,	'To always seek for the will of God in my life.',	'2017-10-26 08:13:52',	'2017-10-26 08:13:52'),
(41848,	2007,	3258,	'When I listen to God\'s leading He  always bless and guide mebut when i do what i think is best it is not productive.',	'2017-10-26 08:13:52',	'2017-10-26 08:13:52'),
(41849,	2007,	3271,	'The purpose of the 5 fold ministry is for the perfecting of the saints and the full equipping that they should do the work of the ministry(building the work of Jesus). It is not given to conduct church services,\r\nIt is easier to have spiritual intimacy at home.\r\nWe must apply Apostolic principle to get harvest of souls.',	'2017-10-26 08:24:05',	'2017-10-26 08:24:05'),
(41850,	2007,	3272,	'Helping members specially the new converts to understand the primary purpose of care fellowship.',	'2017-10-26 08:24:05',	'2017-10-26 08:24:05'),
(41851,	2007,	3273,	'We share stories personally and problems during care group,, we are bonded as the days go by.issue were settled.',	'2017-10-26 08:24:05',	'2017-10-26 08:24:05'),
(41852,	2007,	3286,	'Division is the basis of multiplication.\r\nEvery family has 2 basic dimension of leadership: the father dimension ( leadership, authority, decision making, correction )  and the mother dimension (tenderness, emotional support, patient, training, and nurturer)\r\nThe body cannot live when the cell is dead, we are connected to every cell in the body.',	'2017-10-26 08:36:27',	'2017-10-26 08:36:27'),
(41853,	2007,	3287,	'i will be more patient to everybody.',	'2017-10-26 08:36:27',	'2017-10-26 08:36:27'),
(41854,	2007,	3288,	'When we understand and love people this love will return to us.',	'2017-10-26 08:36:27',	'2017-10-26 08:36:27'),
(41855,	2007,	3301,	'Love is not what you get but what you give, love demanded me to say to them what they need to hear inspite how they treat us.\r\nIt is proven that a single parent family is not healthy because it is considered dysfunctional  because there is only one parent\r\nThe reason of many divorces ( church split) main reason it that the father dimension of leadership does not trust mother to fulfill her resposibility to the lamb, this is offensive and is not healthy.',	'2017-10-26 08:50:44',	'2017-10-26 08:50:44'),
(41856,	2007,	3302,	'I will always show compassion no matter what i hear.',	'2017-10-26 08:50:44',	'2017-10-26 08:50:44'),
(41857,	2007,	3303,	'Even if we are angry, we can avoid arguments if is done with love in the way we say things.',	'2017-10-26 08:50:44',	'2017-10-26 08:50:44'),
(41858,	2006,	181,	'1.	God’s word is a reflection of His nature. God is love.\r\n2.	Most of the people that are offended they did not realize that they are offended. 50% - 80% of the people respond saying I’m offended and most say, they did not know until the church came out.\r\n3.	We are living in the last days. One of the signs, many ( much, great ) will be offended, will betray one another, and will hate one another.',	'2017-10-26 08:58:16',	'2017-10-26 08:58:16'),
(41859,	2006,	182,	'As I have read the 1 Cor 13: 4-8 . It’s about what is love, and the love  of God in us.\r\n-	Love - endures long and is patient, and kind,never envious nor boils over with jealousy or vainglorious, does not display itself haughtily ,it is not conceited (arrogant and inflated with pride ), it is not rude ( unmannerly )does not act unbecomingly, there are many more meaning of love as you continue to read. \r\nBottom line of this, its easy to read, easy to say and preach. We have the holy ghost, we  must apply. As the child of God, people must see in us the likeness of Jesus. The fruit of the Spirit of God.  Obey what its written in the word of God, it is for our own benefit. With that Jesus will see how we love Him, and how can we obey His words.',	'2017-10-26 08:58:16',	'2017-10-26 08:58:16'),
(41860,	2006,	183,	'Bible said that in the last days many will be offended, the love of many will grow cold.  I think one of the reasons why, brother John  Bevere said that we must meditate this verse day and night,  (1 Cor 13: 4-8)  it is because we need to understand and realize that if we have this love in us, no matter how you got offended to your brothers or sisters, it is easy for you to forgive, because you have this all kinds of love.',	'2017-10-26 08:58:16',	'2017-10-26 08:58:16'),
(41861,	2006,	196,	'An offended people, has no stability or the foundation built in his/ her faith. That is why he/she easily offended. I must say that a brethren  that easily offend is not mature in the Lord.\r\nBible is our guide, if we read the life of Joseph. He had to fight not to get offended. If we just compare what the brothers of Joseph did to him, and we are in his feet, I guess we already offended. Just remember the life of Joseph if along the way of our journey to God we encounter trials.\r\nGod command us that love one another as God love us.',	'2017-10-26 09:07:09',	'2017-10-26 09:07:09'),
(41862,	2006,	197,	'Instead of complaining and gossiping, take time to study the word of God, meditate the scripture t day and night. Passionately seek Him , have an intimate talk to God. It is written that people are perish for lack of knowledge. One of the reasons why brethren  got easily offend is because he/she don’t have enough love and relationship with God.',	'2017-10-26 09:07:09',	'2017-10-26 09:07:09'),
(41863,	2006,	198,	': Proverbs 6:16\r\n16 These six things the LORD hates, Yes, seven are an abomination to Him:\r\nAbomination – Those who sow discord, gossip\r\nWhy God hates gossip especially in the church in the body of Christ.  Gossip makes the body of Christ divide. It starts with offense, hatrated, betrayal.\r\nBrethren need to have true love with the Lord, a revelation from God. Revealed knowledge makes your faith stable. Romans 12: 17-18 Repay no evil for evil. Have regard for good things in the sight of all men. If it is possible,as much as depends on you, live peaceably wih all men.',	'2017-10-26 09:07:09',	'2017-10-26 09:07:09'),
(41864,	2007,	3316,	'Having enough love of God to reach the poor is one of the greatness miracle in the church.\r\nSpiritual people who do not truly develop loving relationship with other saints frequently became unstable and eventually becomes judgmental to other people because they never learned to have compassion to others. Their relationship to God is about themselves.\r\nWhen you are reaching people that you don\'t like, you demonstrate the love of God.',	'2017-10-26 09:03:53',	'2017-10-26 09:03:53'),
(41865,	2007,	3317,	'i will win everybody for the kingdom of God because it is pleasing to Him., even to those i think don,t like me.',	'2017-10-26 09:03:53',	'2017-10-26 09:03:53'),
(41866,	2007,	3318,	'I was judge by other people by the way i dress and the way i look, i believe we can not please everybody, But when, that person approach me, they are sorry because they judge me. But it is our attitude that counts. I have learned that even other cannot understand us, still we must be nice to them because we are the sons of God.',	'2017-10-26 09:03:53',	'2017-10-26 09:03:53'),
(41867,	2007,	3331,	'God\'s goal for us is o be matured or perfect to bear fruits.\r\nGod gave us the 5 fold ministry to bring us to Christ and to bring us the the peace unity with the body of Christ.\r\nJoints are relationship, our relationship with each other is what supply the opportunity for koinenia',	'2017-10-26 09:15:28',	'2017-10-26 09:15:28'),
(41868,	2007,	3332,	'We should always be in unity with the whole body  for us to be healthy',	'2017-10-26 09:15:28',	'2017-10-26 09:15:28'),
(41869,	2007,	3333,	'We can\'t have peace if we know that we hurt our brother or sister, let us always exercise love and being patient to teach specially to the new converts.',	'2017-10-26 09:15:28',	'2017-10-26 09:15:28'),
(41870,	2006,	211,	'Jesus said it is impossible for us not to encounter offense.  God search our hearts  and purify us. Bible says honor all men, regardless who they are, speak with respect, Reward is at the end  if you handle that offense correctly.\r\nAnything that you go thru, God will use it as a stepping stone in your life, if you response in obedience.\r\nIf you stay obedient God will fulfill the plan in your life.',	'2017-10-26 09:23:11',	'2017-10-26 09:23:11'),
(41871,	2006,	212,	'David story about his encounter to King Saul, many chances that David can kill King Saul, but he did not do, because, David knows the ways of God.  Why? because David was so attached to God, he hears the voice of God.  Even though there are many preaching, teachings and  stories in the bible , as our pattern and guide, if we choose  NOT  to obey, it turns into nothing. Still Obedience is better than Sacrifice. If we love God, Obey His Commandments.',	'2017-10-26 09:23:11',	'2017-10-26 09:23:11'),
(41872,	2006,	213,	'In the book of Samuel  24 , the story of David. David realized that the 14 years he was running for persecution, God trained him  to be a shepherd of Israel.  the same thing when we are called, God put us into a test, we never know that test is a trainning  by God.',	'2017-10-26 09:23:11',	'2017-10-26 09:23:11'),
(41873,	2007,	3346,	'Tough not everyone is called to preach, every believer should have a teaching ministry.\r\nA mature child of God or a disciple is defined as a taught or trained one.\r\nTeaching and preaching are different things. You can not make a disciple by preaching',	'2017-10-26 09:24:28',	'2017-10-26 09:24:28'),
(41874,	2007,	3347,	'We will give teaching focus so that the new convert will grow in the knowledge ogf God.',	'2017-10-26 09:24:28',	'2017-10-26 09:24:28'),
(41875,	2007,	3348,	'We have experience a lot of trials in the past bu because i was taught of things o come i was able to overcome it with God guidance and mercy and grace.',	'2017-10-26 09:24:28',	'2017-10-26 09:24:28'),
(41876,	2007,	3361,	'We are facilitator to help new member find their place in the ministry.\r\nTeaching only work only  if the people are hungry.\r\nBeing a parent is not just bearing a child, but guides, leads  her children , but we can not raise our children by proclamation but by teaching.',	'2017-10-26 09:35:15',	'2017-10-26 09:35:15'),
(41877,	2007,	3362,	'Always being patient to teach and guide. What we have learned, we must teach to the new member so that they may too might grow in the knowledge of God.',	'2017-10-26 09:35:15',	'2017-10-26 09:35:15'),
(41878,	2007,	3363,	'We we teach someone to know more about the faith we have, it make us also to review and study the lesson,We prepare ourselves to answer question that might be ask to give them answer,',	'2017-10-26 09:35:15',	'2017-10-26 09:35:15'),
(41879,	2006,	226,	'Love your enemies , pray for  the one abuse you or despise you, do good to those who mistreated  you. Pray for the person offend you, that person might save and delivered.\r\nAll authorities appointed by God, God is the one appoints the leaders.\r\nGod set the members in the body as He pleases.',	'2017-10-26 09:38:19',	'2017-10-26 09:38:19'),
(41880,	2006,	227,	'In the Story Hannah and Eli ( head priest in Israel ) God used that corrupt priest to answer the prayer of Hannah. She did not get offended when Eli called her drunk. Hannah had her baby boy name Samuel. When Samuel grew up, he also not offended to Eli, regardless of his wickedness  why,? in 1Samuel 3:1 Now the boy Samuel ministered to the Lord before Eli, and the word of the Lord rare in those days, there was no widespread revelation. \r\nSamuel knew he was  not in the place to judge  God’s  leader. We have no right to judge, what God put into as a leader.',	'2017-10-26 09:38:19',	'2017-10-26 09:38:19'),
(41881,	2006,	228,	'When Adam and Eve sin in the garden,the first thing they notice  is they were naked. what do they do? Clothe themselves , what did they use, fig leaves, fruit of the ground.  With that, Adam and Eve decide their own way, to choose the clothe what they want , and God said , that is not my way, God change their clothes into skin of animals. My point is they decide because that time they were ignorant of what is the proper clothes  will wear. In the case of Cain and Abel, they were both learn from their parents what was acceptable to God, When Cain brings the fruit of the ground it represents a disobedient  offering and he is serving God in his own way. Big offense to Cain, that offense turns  rage, betrayal, and murder. because of that ofense, Cain created himself a persecution complex,',	'2017-10-26 09:38:19',	'2017-10-26 09:38:19'),
(41882,	2006,	241,	'1.	When you feel offended and insulted, bless him / her back.  The reward is yours.\r\n2.	Overcome offense, Paul said do not repay evil from evil. Jesus also say do not repay evil from evil so that you may become a mature son of your Father.\r\n3.	If you are unfairly treated you can dance, have a party , because God is set you up to get bless',	'2017-10-26 09:49:48',	'2017-10-26 09:49:48'),
(41883,	2006,	242,	'1 Peter 3: 9  not returning evil for evil or reviling for reviling, but on the contrary blessing, knowing that you were called to this, that you may inherit a blessing.\r\n I must say that no matter how long you been a christian, how consistent you pray and fast , how deeper your relationship to God,  if God test you with the offense, and you did not endure that offense and test you are not still a mature child of God. \r\nGod loves us so much, He still want us to bless and come into a maturity, that\'s  why He kept on testing us, see if we can endure. \r\nWe are called to this. So others can see that we are different in this world,. To see that Jesus lives inside of us.',	'2017-10-26 09:49:48',	'2017-10-26 09:49:48'),
(41884,	2006,	243,	'1 Peter 4: 1 So, since Christ suffered in the flesh for us, for you arm yourselves with the same thought and purpose (patiently to suffer rather than fail to please God). For whoever has suffered in the flesh (having the mind of Christ )is done with (intentional) sin (has stopped  pleasing himself and the world, and pleases God } \r\nMost believer are not armed to suffer that’s why they are easily offended. They react instead of act. Jesus is sinless, but still He suffered offenses,mis treated,the reason is  to fulfill the plan.  He need to endure and suffer. Jesus suffered Physically, and emotionally, but still He is not offended.  This verse need to  know and understand.  \r\nWe are not suffering physically, but still some of the brethren easily  offended.',	'2017-10-26 09:49:48',	'2017-10-26 09:49:48'),
(41885,	2007,	3376,	'It\'s not our prayers that limiting us, it is our church structure.\r\nMinistry must have a conduit to flow through. It must have an apostolic  structure. People can\'t just be released to just do whatever with no accountability, no training, no oversight, it will be negative to them, negative to the people that they reached. It is not the will of God.\r\nIf we believe that there will be revival, we must prepare ourselves and be involved in it and care for the return',	'2017-10-26 09:46:22',	'2017-10-26 09:46:22'),
(41886,	2007,	3377,	'we must not forget that our goal is to reconcile the world to God.',	'2017-10-26 09:46:22',	'2017-10-26 09:46:22'),
(41887,	2007,	3378,	'sometime God\'s teaching is by giving us situation t so that our faith in Him will be strengthen',	'2017-10-26 09:46:22',	'2017-10-26 09:46:22'),
(41888,	2007,	3391,	'If you have facilities and it is the focus of your ministry, you are limited.\r\nYou cannot built a church in a pulpit\r\nWe may built a church or a crowd, but we cannot have harvest.',	'2017-10-26 09:53:39',	'2017-10-26 09:53:39'),
(41889,	2007,	3392,	'i will be involved in taking care of the babies in the church(new convert)',	'2017-10-26 09:53:39',	'2017-10-26 09:53:39'),
(41890,	2007,	3393,	'When I was converted it feel like II have found a family away from home.So we must help that our new member feel like he\\she is home',	'2017-10-26 09:53:39',	'2017-10-26 09:53:39'),
(41891,	2006,	256,	'1. A person who acts hastily is a person who is unstable, all his action are  not proper.\r\n2. Revealed Knowledge is more powerful  than sense knowledge\r\n3. God drawn to those people who are hunger in His words, those people who are passionately seeking Him.',	'2017-10-26 09:56:44',	'2017-10-26 09:56:44'),
(41892,	2006,	257,	'Hungry with the Lord. An example given by John Bevere is that when we  are  sick ( high fever ) we can’t eat, even if the food is good, lost of appetite. But  when we are hungry or  very hungry with the Lord., we tend to eat much more than food the we used to eat. \r\nSpiritually speaking, a person that is not hungry  with the Lord, most of the times they don’t read the bible or even pray, or forgot God . The usual routine of their lives will  just passed by within the day. \r\nBut if your hungry and want to know God, eager to know His words, or even ask the Lord what is the meaning of this sripture, pray without ceasing , communicating with God anywhere you are.  Revelation of His words will come into your life, ( revelealed knowledge ) your old ways will change, you will never be the same.  With that you cannnot easily  offended.',	'2017-10-26 09:56:44',	'2017-10-26 09:56:44'),
(41893,	2006,	258,	'Based in  my personal testimony. When I was newly convert in this belief,( Apostolic Pentecostal )  teacher in the church teach me the doctrine of One God, holiness. After that teaching , I did not understand  all that they taught to me.  Until such time that God  open my understanding and revealed to me the ONENESS of God,  and Holiness. Because of that revealed knowledge,  I start to wear skirt and start to not to cut my hair.',	'2017-10-26 09:56:44',	'2017-10-26 09:56:44'),
(41894,	2007,	3406,	'The pastor should fully equip the saints to being able to minister to people\'s needs with the epitome of skill.\r\nThe head is extremely important for the function of the body, yet the the former cannot replace the purpose and the function of the latter.\r\nIn general the head gives direction, the body is the doer.',	'2017-10-26 10:02:12',	'2017-10-26 10:02:12'),
(41895,	2007,	3407,	'We must be in unity with each other so that we can function well.',	'2017-10-26 10:02:12',	'2017-10-26 10:02:12'),
(41896,	2007,	3408,	'When we are not in good term with anybody , we are distress but when we learned to forgive and to love we can have peace',	'2017-10-26 10:02:12',	'2017-10-26 10:02:12'),
(41897,	2006,	271,	'1. We need to be rooted in the Love of God, so we can trust Him fully.\r\n2. Peter is hunger with the things that Jesus had. But Peter love to Jesus is not yet  full, not whole. \r\n After Peter was being shaken down to the core and he is no longer boasting in his own abilities.\r\n\r\n\r\nAgape the unconditional love that God  has. The  love of Peter is not Agape but Phileo, ( love of the world )  \r\n\r\nAPPLY.  God gave us the free will to choose, God did not create us like a “ robot “ . God wants us to love Him with all our might, heart, mind, and soul. He wants us to choose Him, to worship Him in Spirit and in truth. \r\n\r\n \r\n Peter was being shaken down to the core and he is no longer boasting in his own abilities.\r\n\r\n\r\nthought \r\nPeter is about to leave and give up, Peter thinks that is untrue, The reason why  he come back , because he has the revelation knowledge .\r\nIn the body of Christ we need to have the stability, neede to have a revelation, so we wont get offended easily.\r\n3. Agape the unconditional love that God  has. The  love of Peter is not Agape but Phileo, ( love of the world )',	'2017-10-26 10:05:34',	'2017-10-26 10:05:34'),
(41898,	2006,	272,	'God gave us the free will to choose, God did not create us like a “ robot “ . God wants us to love Him with all our might, heart, mind, and soul. He wants us to choose Him, to worship Him in Spirit and in truth.',	'2017-10-26 10:05:34',	'2017-10-26 10:05:34'),
(41899,	2006,	273,	'Peter is about to leave and give up, Peter thinks that is untrue, The reason why  he come back , because he has the revelation knowledge .\r\nIn the body of Christ we need to have the stability, need to have a revelation, so we wont get offended easily.',	'2017-10-26 10:05:34',	'2017-10-26 10:05:34'),
(41900,	2007,	3421,	'If we learned from experience, it becomes a part of our life.\r\nFor instruction to be effective, it must be accompanied by the opportunity to experiment to do what is being taught( to be put into practice what is being taught\r\nEverytime the pastor grows in God, he provides room for everybody below him to move up.',	'2017-10-26 10:13:10',	'2017-10-26 10:13:10'),
(41901,	2007,	3422,	'What we learned we must put into action.',	'2017-10-26 10:13:10',	'2017-10-26 10:13:10'),
(41902,	2007,	3423,	'Truly sometimes God allows us to experience something if He want us to learn ex faith. we cannot just say we have faith, but being an overcomer of a situation that only God can your faith become whole',	'2017-10-26 10:13:10',	'2017-10-26 10:13:10'),
(41903,	2006,	286,	'1. In Ministry of Jesus, Jesus is the  Rock of Offense,  everywhere He go, He offended people, And also He offended His family members.\r\n2. When you obey God, God will take care of your family\r\n3. Believe meant  to Obey\r\nUnbelief and not obeying are synonyms.',	'2017-10-26 10:15:46',	'2017-10-26 10:15:46'),
(41904,	2006,	287,	'A person who preach the truth, is a  person that  preach the character of God.  Jesus commanded  to preach the Gospel and obey the Gospel. As a believers of Christ, we need to study, and ask the revelation of God, Ready to  give an answer to the people that need the truth.',	'2017-10-26 10:15:46',	'2017-10-26 10:15:46'),
(41905,	2006,	288,	'Obedience is better than Sacrifice..\r\nThe highest form of worship is Obedience. For every teaching,  preaching,  corrections, but don’t have obedience, all of that will fail. \r\nAnd also if your hungry  to the word of God, God will give the revelation.',	'2017-10-26 10:15:46',	'2017-10-26 10:15:46'),
(41906,	2007,	3436,	'It is not one person job to do everything.\r\nThe care ministry causes the pastor\'s effectiveness to be strengthened. It  provides the responsibilities and opportunities for the saints to learn to minister  and to lead\r\nMany saints are frusrtated because they have no outlet for their godly desires to serve.',	'2017-10-26 10:20:55',	'2017-10-26 10:20:55'),
(41907,	2007,	3437,	'We will give room to everybody to serve God.',	'2017-10-26 10:20:55',	'2017-10-26 10:20:55'),
(41908,	2007,	3438,	'One thing s that learned is that delegating  will help members to be involve in the ministry.',	'2017-10-26 10:20:55',	'2017-10-26 10:20:55'),
(41909,	2006,	301,	'1. Sons and daughters of the kings benefits the tax collected from the  strangers.  The one who pay taxes  are the strangers . Jesus said to Peter, I am  tax  free, but for them not to offend, Jesus and Peter pay the tax\r\n2. We have to know when is the right time to offend and when its not the right time to offend.  Avoid offensive behaviour\r\n3. Don’t judge one another, don’t judge the person that has weaker in faith',	'2017-10-26 10:25:32',	'2017-10-26 10:25:32'),
(41910,	2006,	302,	'True love serve one another and not offending people with your own rights.  Do not use the oppurtunity to serve yourself but rather use to serve one another, and to love another.\r\nThere is freedom  in serving your brothers and sisters in the Lord.',	'2017-10-26 10:25:32',	'2017-10-26 10:25:32'),
(41911,	2006,	303,	'When you are working in a Company and you want to get promoted,  the secret is , start serving instead of working.  Manager in a company looking for a worker that wants to serve more than just work.   The same thing to the Lord, why we love to serve God, because we love Him.',	'2017-10-26 10:25:32',	'2017-10-26 10:25:32'),
(41912,	2007,	3451,	'A part of learning is asking.\r\nThere are 4 things that is involve in reaching people, God, message, me, my method.Only two are eternal God and m message.\r\nGrowth is the function of change. We do not change the message but the methods to reach the world.',	'2017-10-26 10:27:54',	'2017-10-26 10:27:54'),
(41913,	2007,	3452,	'Everybody is a part of the body, so we have the responsibility to preach and  teach unto them.',	'2017-10-26 10:27:54',	'2017-10-26 10:27:54'),
(41914,	2007,	3453,	'When we don\'t get tried of teaching to people eventually they will bear fruits.',	'2017-10-26 10:27:54',	'2017-10-26 10:27:54'),
(41915,	2006,	316,	'1. Mathew  18: 25-30\r\nIn this verse, the servant who forgiven to  his debt, don’t have the heart to forgive the debt to him. In fact this servant that is forgiven by his master has much higher debt than the one that has debt to him. This servant has no forgiveness,  he was punished by his master.\r\n2. A person in the church who refuses to forgive, or both brethren doesn’t want to forgive, both of them will be in hell.\r\n3. In Proverbs 6:16 Six things that Lord hates, seven are in abomination to Him, one who sow discord among brethren , gossips.',	'2017-10-26 10:35:53',	'2017-10-26 10:35:53'),
(41916,	2006,	317,	'In the Lord’s prayer it says “ forgive us our debts, as we forgive our debtors”.\r\nGod wrote this parable (Mathew 18: 25-30 ) to set an example. Now a days , I don’t know if there are still people like his master,  forgave the debt of his servant   ( 10 thousand talents or 3 bIllions US dollars ) regardless of the  amount, after trhe servant fell down and ask for forgivness to his master, and the master had a compassion to his servant. \r\nA brother that cannot forgive his brother,  God called them a murderer.\r\nGod paid the unpayable debt, He died on the cross for our sins. His love is  what  forgave us. \r\nWe have the ability to forgive',	'2017-10-26 10:35:53',	'2017-10-26 10:35:53'),
(41917,	2006,	318,	'Proverbs 6: 6-19\r\nSix things the Lord hates, indeed seven is abomination to Him. In verse 19 He who sows discord among his brethren. \r\nDiscord means quarreling, conflict, harsh. \r\nThis happen when a brethren don’t have enough love to God, because no revelation yet from God. Gossips starts until the conflict begins. And that is abomination to God,',	'2017-10-26 10:35:53',	'2017-10-26 10:35:53'),
(41918,	2007,	3466,	'If i\'m still doing today what i always done,i\'m dead i\'m not growing\r\nIf the message exalt the name of Jesus and exalt Him as God no matter what style it does not matter, the message is what it scriptural\r\nThere will be more people save if we use the biblical method.The adversity knows that as long as he can keep us preaching truth but through tradition vehicle , it will not be as effective as the Lord did because there is somebody being save, but how many more be save if we are using biblical concept instead of relion.',	'2017-10-26 10:42:21',	'2017-10-26 10:42:21'),
(41919,	2007,	3467,	'Will do the biblical approach to harvest souls.',	'2017-10-26 10:42:21',	'2017-10-26 10:42:21'),
(41920,	2007,	3468,	'I always pray that the new convert today have the desire to serve God as of the time of our conversion',	'2017-10-26 10:42:21',	'2017-10-26 10:42:21'),
(41921,	2007,	3481,	'Religious tradition is not ok, let us serve the Lord on how the disciple did, one Sunday service must not be the same as other Sundays.\r\nNone preacher is better than the other, the difference is that the one is  using non traditional but biblical apostolic principles and the other is using what is always done.\r\nWe must not focus on the facilities but as long as it incorporates the principles and concept and acceptable to God sending people out for preaching  and take care if the lost,  He will bless it.',	'2017-10-29 11:36:06',	'2017-10-29 11:36:06'),
(41922,	2007,	3482,	'I will not get tired of taking care new convert and teach them God\'s principles.',	'2017-10-29 11:36:06',	'2017-10-29 11:36:06'),
(41923,	2007,	3483,	'As i grow in the Kingdom of God i was able to be more patient and caring to people.',	'2017-10-29 11:36:06',	'2017-10-29 11:36:06'),
(41924,	2006,	331,	'1. The offense is literally a trap of the devil to destroy the call of God in your life in His last days.\r\n2. We never know the heavyness of the punishment of the Lord, if we still continue to the unforgiveness  offense that we have.\r\n3. Revenge thinking is the way of the world.',	'2017-10-26 10:48:21',	'2017-10-26 10:48:21'),
(41925,	2006,	332,	'Kingdom level thinking\r\nMathew 5: 39- 42 But I tell you not to resist an evil person. But whoever slaps you on your right cheek,turn the other to him, If anyone wants to sue you and take away your tunic, let him have your cloak  also.  And whoever compels you to go one mile, go with him two. Give to him who ask you, and from him who wants to borrow from you do not turn away.\r\n Come up the Level of  thinking  and living of God .',	'2017-10-26 10:48:21',	'2017-10-26 10:48:21'),
(41926,	2006,	333,	'We have to examine our heart  very carefully.  \r\nStart from the root, comes is the seed.  Seed is the 0ffense. When the seed  watered and nurtured it start to grow. It will be destructive to your life and it will defile you.  If you hear something offensive  to  your brethren  that hurts your feeling.  And that brethren  didn’t meant to say , no meaning, and you started to put the wall, and started not speaking to that brethren, it will be a big destructive to  your life, because you did not confront the brethren and you don’t have any closure that makes you offend.  And you start telling to other brethren your offense, until offense takes longer and begin to hate that brethren.  \r\nDealing with the one offend you is very important. Honest  confrontation makes the offense solve. Let God be center of the conversation.',	'2017-10-26 10:48:21',	'2017-10-26 10:48:21'),
(41927,	2006,	346,	'1. Even the person is offended , still has the powerfull ministry because the annointing  to minister  people. It will not affect the ministry.\r\n2. Wounds don’t healed overnight, if not properly treated wounds never healed . The same with the offense, it will not healed if not properly treated.\r\n3. People  that has in a strong Spirit, meaning exercising his/her faith consistently praying, reading the word of God, has the revelation from God, and has a strong relationship with the Lord, they are people that is not easily offended .',	'2017-10-26 10:59:59',	'2017-10-26 10:59:59'),
(41928,	2006,	347,	'Mathew 5:44 But I say to you love your enemies, bless those who curse you ,do good those who hate you,and pray for those who spitefully use you and persecute you.  Jesus forgave us before we say sorry to Him. Jesus mistreated, and abuse but He never got offended. God truly love us.',	'2017-10-26 10:59:59',	'2017-10-26 10:59:59'),
(41929,	2006,	348,	'It is written in the word of God that it is impossible that the offense will not come. If we are aware in the word of God, many instructions, teaching, that God wrote in His words. We need to obey every word  that He said for us to be save and have an eternal life with the Lord. \r\nIt is our sin that separate us from God. When you realize, you sin against God by holding the offense, then you open up the door to get free. \r\nWhat you do with the offense will determine your future.',	'2017-10-26 10:59:59',	'2017-10-26 10:59:59'),
(41930,	2110,	301,	'When you wound a weak brother’s conscience, you sin against Christ. If a privilege that you have causes another to sin, cut it!\r\nGalatians 5:13\r\nFor you, brethren, have been called to liberty; only do not use liberty as an opportunity for the flesh, but through love serve one another.\r\nJesus offends concerning truth but He doesn’t offend somebody of his personal rights.',	'2017-10-27 09:04:45',	'2017-10-27 09:04:45'),
(41931,	2110,	302,	'Jesus offends concerning truth but He doesn’t offend somebody of his personal rights.\r\n\r\nWe should know when to offend and not to offend. Our priority is not to stumble our brothers.',	'2017-10-27 09:04:45',	'2017-10-27 09:04:45'),
(41932,	2110,	303,	'As a convert, from a catholic to\r\nan apostolic pentecosal, there are many moments that I can offend my family and friends who remain catholics. Jesus taught us how we will use our privilege to serve others. We gotta determine when we stumble our brothers or when we offend them. Stand the truth but never compromise. Follow Jesus\' footsteps in approaching people.',	'2017-10-27 09:04:45',	'2017-10-27 09:04:45'),
(41933,	2116,	3301,	'Single-parent families are not as healthy as double-parent families\r\nDay-to-day life discipline\r\nShepherds don\'t grow flocks, they take care of the flocks.',	'2017-10-26 16:54:35',	'2017-10-26 16:54:35'),
(41934,	2116,	3302,	'To have a day-to-day life discipline. According to the scriptures, \"ee are being changed from glory to glory.\"',	'2017-10-26 16:54:35',	'2017-10-26 16:54:35'),
(41935,	2116,	3303,	'This lesson gave a better description/definition and what it does about the father dimension versus the mother dimension in the church ministry.',	'2017-10-26 16:54:35',	'2017-10-26 16:54:35'),
(41936,	2116,	3316,	'Love is a choice\r\nSpiritual people who never truly develop a loving relationship with other saints, becomes judgemental of others and never learned to have compassion with others\r\nVertical or spiritual relationship with God is dependent to Horizontal relationship with our brothers and sisters in Christ',	'2017-10-26 17:23:36',	'2017-10-26 17:23:36'),
(41937,	2116,	3317,	'To truly develop a loving relationship with other saints and learned to have compassion with others',	'2017-10-26 17:23:36',	'2017-10-26 17:23:36'),
