(41939,	2116,	3331,	'God\'s goal for us is to mature and therefore us to be fruitful\r\nWe are called to steadfastly proclaim our apostolic doctrine\r\nBeing spiritual and a true relationship are equally essential',	'2017-10-26 17:34:29',	'2017-10-26 17:34:29'),
(41940,	2116,	3332,	'To be committed, be trained and be involved',	'2017-10-26 17:34:29',	'2017-10-26 17:34:29'),
(41941,	2116,	3333,	'One of the things that stood out to me in this lesson in addition to the points mentioned above was, having unity as we will received anointing; as quoted by Bishop - \"if we dont have unity, we can\'t have true anointing; to check our motives as it is critical. It\'s not about ourselves/ our performance, but God and his plan.',	'2017-10-26 17:34:29',	'2017-10-26 17:34:29'),
(41942,	973,	1306,	'heart of the leader makes different leaderships\r\n1) life enhancing leader\r\n2) life draining leader\r\nhonouring leadership: Sees his or her vision as the vehicle to serve the people.\r\nWisdom is shown to be right by its results.\r\nYour fruit will show what your motives are.',	'2017-10-26 17:42:37',	'2017-10-26 17:42:37'),
(41943,	973,	1307,	'to make my motivation right for entrusted ones.',	'2017-10-26 17:42:37',	'2017-10-26 17:42:37'),
(41944,	973,	1308,	'Sometimes when I am swayed with daily life, I feel my motive at work is to glorify myself, not Jesus. When my motive is wrong, my behaviour and my fruit will be not good as well.',	'2017-10-26 17:42:37',	'2017-10-26 17:42:37'),
(41945,	2116,	3346,	'Proclaimer or announcer of good news\r\nJesus is the church builder\r\nMature child of God is being taught or trained one',	'2017-10-26 17:48:03',	'2017-10-26 17:48:03'),
