(41948,	3892,	5896,	'When we know we are right with God and our heart does not condemn us, then we have confidence toward God.\r\nFor the church to have authority in prayer, we must have complete faith and no doubt at all.\r\nFor us to use authoritative prayer, we must be subject to God\'s authority and commandments.',	'2017-10-26 20:21:27',	'2017-10-26 20:21:27'),
