(41954,	2000,	301,	'There is freedom in serving, but bondage in slavery.\r\nJesus offends concerning truth but He doesn’t offend somebody of his personal rights.\r\nKeep before us the law of love so that we will not bring offense.',	'2017-10-27 05:14:18',	'2017-10-27 05:14:18'),
