(41956,	2000,	303,	'Don’t use your privilege to serve yourself but through love serve one another. A great reminder to combat what seems to be a rampant attitude nowadays - self entitlement.',	'2017-10-27 05:14:18',	'2017-10-27 05:14:18'),
(41957,	2000,	316,	'We were forgiven of unpayable debt when Jesus died on the cross.\r\nA person who cannot forgive is a person that has forgotten that he had been forgiven.\r\nA person that refuses to forgive is a person that will cost them their salvation.',	'2017-10-27 05:44:23',	'2017-10-27 05:44:23'),
