(41963,	2004,	3376,	'Our goal as a christian is to minister the world to reach God\r\nMinistry need to has an apostolic structure, we need to plan, prepare making specific preparation so anything we want to reach for our church.\r\nTraining of Jesus Christ to the disciple was not easy, It took more than 3 years in preparing then in training and used them.',	'2017-10-28 04:22:00',	'2017-10-28 04:22:00'),
