(41966,	2110,	316,	'We were forgiven of unpayable debt when Jesus died on the cross. The claims of justice were satisfied.\r\nEvery one of us justly deserve to burn in hell forever!\r\nMatthew 6:14‐15\r\n“For if you forgive men their trespasses, your heavenly Father will also forgive you. But if you do not forgive men their trespasses, neither will your Father forgive your trespasses.',	'2017-10-27 09:53:36',	'2017-10-27 09:53:36'),
(41967,	2110,	317,	'Matthew 6:14‐15\r\n“For if you forgive men their trespasses, your heavenly Father will also forgive you. But if you do not forgive men their trespasses, neither will your Father forgive your trespasses.\r\n\r\nWe ought to forgive even how much we get offended because God forgave us from an unpayable debt.',	'2017-10-27 09:53:36',	'2017-10-27 09:53:36'),
(41968,	2110,	318,	'Forgiveness is crucial for our salvation. We deserved to burn in hell, but because of God\'s love and forgiveness we can be saved if we also forgive others and follow Jesus.',	'2017-10-27 09:53:36',	'2017-10-27 09:53:36'),
(41969,	231,	3346,	'Everyone should have a teaching ministry to this world - one of the processes of maturity\r\n\r\n“For though by this time you ought to be teachers, you need someone to teach you again the basic principles of the oracles of God. You need milk, not solid food,”\r\n‭‭Hebrews‬ ‭5:12‬ ‭ESV‬‬\r\n\r\nThis was written to the saints, not the preachers.\r\nWe should not really be a movement of preachers.\r\nPreaching says \"tie your shoes\", teaching teaches the child how to do it - and sometimes you have to do it more than one time.',	'2017-10-28 15:39:26',	'2017-10-28 15:39:26'),
(41970,	231,	3347,	'To prepare myself for teaching, whether planned or incidental learning - the burden shouldn\'t always be on pastor.',	'2017-10-28 15:39:26',	'2017-10-28 15:39:26'),
(41971,	231,	3348,	'Sometimes I get exasperated because someone will be dealing with an issue and a lot of times my thought is, \"I\'ve already told you but you didn\'t listen/there is no change\" etc. But actually Bishop\'s example is really true - if I have to teach/tell a child something more than once, adults are no different (including myself!). The same way I am patient with children, I should be to others and my self.',	'2017-10-28 15:39:26',	'2017-10-28 15:39:26'),
(41972,	2000,	346,	'Look out when your heart is getting colder and colder towards someone.\r\nThere are some offenses that wound. However, wounds don’t heal overnight. If not properly treated, wounds never heal.\r\nPeople who are strong in the Spirit don’t get injured easily by offences.',	'2017-10-27 13:32:13',	'2017-10-27 13:32:13'),
(41973,	2000,	347,	'Always have time for spiritual exercise.',	'2017-10-27 13:32:13',	'2017-10-27 13:32:13'),
(41974,	2000,	348,	'Jesus said that it is impossible that no offenses should come - therefore we should always be ready/prepared by having spiritual exercise.\n\nThere\'s so much more that I learned from these lesson that I cannot put into writing at the moment, but I thank the Lord Jesus Christ for these.',	'2017-10-27 13:32:13',	'2017-10-27 13:32:13'),
