(41996,	2008,	3286,	'Natural things are examples given to us by God to help us understand \r\nspiritual things.\r\nThe ministry of saints is the motherly dimension of leadership.\r\nWe are mutually dependent on one another and are our brother’s keeper.',	'2017-10-27 16:44:48',	'2017-10-27 16:44:48'),
