(41998,	2008,	3288,	'As part of the body of Christ, we are all connected to each other and each of us are accountable for the growth of each other. We have to care for our brethren and be willing to help nurture them specially if we  have already been a saint/church member for a long time and considered elders. As elders, we have to be willing to give ourselves more to serve our brethren.',	'2017-10-27 16:44:48',	'2017-10-27 16:44:48'),
(41999,	3892,	5926,	'Authoritative prayer is commanding rather than asking God to cast the mountain in the sea.\r\nWeather and nature can be controlled. God did it in the bible, so he can still do it today.\r\nWe can contain the secret activities of evil spirits by prayer.',	'2017-10-27 19:26:49',	'2017-10-27 19:26:49'),
(42000,	3892,	5927,	'That by praying for every service, you can actually help set the spiritual tone of that service.',	'2017-10-27 19:26:49',	'2017-10-27 19:26:49'),
(42001,	3892,	5928,	'That no one can be an overcomer without being a prayer warrior, and the church cannot overcome without having prayer warriors. To take authority over situations and command for yourself the blockage (mountain)  in your life to flee.',	'2017-10-27 19:26:49',	'2017-10-27 19:26:49'),
(42002,	3892,	5941,	'Evil spirits not only work openly, but they also work secretly trying to inject thoughts of terror, suspicion, disappointment, imagination, distortion to deceive and upset.\r\nThe power behind the name of Jesus lies in the blood of Jesus.\r\nWe are sojourners on earth. In reality we are heavenly people with heavenly authority.',	'2017-10-27 20:53:08',	'2017-10-27 20:53:08'),
(42003,	3892,	5942,	'To fully grasp the need of binding spirits before service, before trying to minister to others and before important conversations.',	'2017-10-27 20:53:08',	'2017-10-27 20:53:08'),
(42004,	3892,	5943,	'Loved the example of the blood of Jesus being like a huge blood bank. Where the supply never runs out and when we use the name of Jesus its like us signing a check and putting in what ever needs to be  covered by the blood in the amount part of the check. That the power behind the name of Jesus lies in the blood of Jesus, because his blood cleanses all sin, it heals every sickness, and it delivers and sets people free.',	'2017-10-27 20:53:08',	'2017-10-27 20:53:08'),
(42005,	2008,	3301,	'What goes on at church service should be the focus of the father dimension of ministry.\r\nWhat goes outside of church service should be the focus of the mother\r\n dimension of ministry.\r\nFor children, nurturing is more important than discipline.',	'2017-10-27 22:15:43',	'2017-10-27 22:15:43'),
(42006,	2008,	3302,	'We have to learn to take care of spiritual babies, to nurture and guide them. We have to have plans on what to do on how to \'feed\' them immediately and consistently to avoid spiritual infant mortality.',	'2017-10-27 22:15:43',	'2017-10-27 22:15:43'),
(42007,	2008,	3303,	'This was an amazing video, giving me a clearer picture regarding the difference in the responsibility between Pastor and disciples (members). If we would like to have growth and revival, we must be willing to equip everyone and eventually trust them to take responsibility to go to the field and actively participate in the spiritual harvest.',	'2017-10-27 22:15:43',	'2017-10-27 22:15:43'),
(42008,	2008,	3316,	'Unity is not uniformity.\r\nTrue unity only takes place through an environment that promotes and accomplishes koinonia (fellowship).\r\nThere is no opportunity nor choice given to love those who have different preferences from them when we are constantly in a clique, and thus the absence of koinonia (fellowship).',	'2017-10-28 15:23:19',	'2017-10-28 15:23:19'),
(42009,	2008,	3317,	'I have to show love to those that are different from me.  This is how God wants the member of the church to be, to love one another despite the differences they have.',	'2017-10-28 15:23:19',	'2017-10-28 15:23:19'),
(42010,	2008,	3318,	'Learn to have compassion to one another is something that is really hard to do because we have preferences to people that we want to be with. However, we have to allow God to work in our hearts and be able to accept the differences of one another and be able to love the same.',	'2017-10-28 15:23:19',	'2017-10-28 15:23:19'),
(42011,	3992,	181,	'The first point that stood out to me was how the disciples suddenly asked the Lord to increase their faith. They\'ve seen Him do many miracles and they know the power of God, but when it came to forgiving those who have hurt them they asked for faith. That shows the significance of forgiveness and just how difficult it can be. Difficult, but not impossible.\r\nSomething else that stood out to me is how just a single negative thing directed towards us can steal our joy if we allow it to. It can also change our thoughts about the church. Because not only when we get hurt do we associate it with the person we associate it with the place as well. One negative thing said by a fellow church person hurts more than a stranger.\r\nOne last point that stood out to me was how hate was the equivalent of murder. In todays society murder is taken very seriously but hate is a word thrown around every day. We need to be wise about our emotions and words or else we\'re just as good as a convicted murderer.',	'2017-10-28 04:22:43',	'2017-10-28 04:22:43'),
(42012,	3992,	182,	'I will endeavor to apply the concept of forgiveness. I do not want to be built of walls and bitterness. I want that freedom in the love of God.',	'2017-10-28 04:22:43',	'2017-10-28 04:22:43'),
(42013,	3992,	183,	'This video made me aware of my thoughts towards people who have wronged me and I am ashamed of those thoughts. It made me realize that through this program I WILL grow!',	'2017-10-28 04:22:43',	'2017-10-28 04:22:43'),
(42014,	3782,	5866,	'We don\'t have to be afraid , God has given us authority he\'s put us in a position of power\r\nI don\'t talk nicely to the devil\r\nGods ready and able to do it at anytime but if we\'re not ready to receive it then we\'re not going to be able to anything anyway',	'2017-10-28 05:52:37',	'2017-10-28 05:52:37'),
(42015,	3782,	5867,	'I will be more consistent with prayer',	'2017-10-28 05:52:37',	'2017-10-28 05:52:37'),
(42016,	3782,	5868,	'It\'s an honor and privilege to be able to pray',	'2017-10-28 05:52:37',	'2017-10-28 05:52:37'),
(42017,	2111,	181,	'Offense is a trap\r\nSatan is so cunning he sets baits of offense, and you\'re trap before you even know it\r\nReasonings are thought processes that are in contrary with the Word of God',	'2017-10-28 06:39:01',	'2017-10-28 06:39:01'),
(42018,	2111,	182,	'To watch out for offense, and endeavor to forgive those who offend me. Offense is a breeding ground for deception.',	'2017-10-28 06:39:01',	'2017-10-28 06:39:01'),
(42019,	2111,	183,	'Offense may either make you when you get over it, or break you when you let it in...',	'2017-10-28 06:39:01',	'2017-10-28 06:39:01'),
(42020,	2110,	331,	'Offense is the Bait of Satan that pulls you into captivity.\r\nThe way the love of God works is that the love of God will risk being hurt again.\r\nJesus Christ died on the cross for your unfulfilled revenge.',	'2017-10-28 12:48:39',	'2017-10-28 12:48:39'),
(42021,	2110,	332,	'Jesus Christ died on the cross for your unfulfilled revenge.\r\n\r\nTherefore, we don\'t need to revenge when someone offended us because God died on the cross for us. He forgave us already before we ask for forgiveness. He set an example of meekness and how he prayed for people who hurted him. He also is the only lawgiver and judge for all the people.',	'2017-10-28 12:48:39',	'2017-10-28 12:48:39'),
(42022,	2110,	333,	'“Be holy for I am holy.”\r\n\r\nRegarding holiness, John Bevere explained on a different angle and its a new revelation for me. He said that the words “Be holy for I am holy\" means our relationship with God. He said that God wants us to think, act, speak, be like Him. We need to reach or attain that level of relationship with Him. Becoming a disciple, becoming in His image and likeness.',	'2017-10-28 12:48:39',	'2017-10-28 12:48:39'),
(42023,	2111,	196,	'Gossip is poison\r\nNobody can get you out of His will, but you\r\nComplaining makes God look incompetent',	'2017-10-28 10:36:07',	'2017-10-28 10:36:07'),
(42024,	2111,	197,	'Word of God says \"All things work together for good...\", therefore, I will strive to not complain with anything that comes my way...',	'2017-10-28 10:36:07',	'2017-10-28 10:36:07'),
(42025,	2111,	198,	'God knows what He\'s doing, so we just have to do what He says without question like a good soldier.',	'2017-10-28 10:36:07',	'2017-10-28 10:36:07'),
(42026,	2000,	3196,	'Creating methods for the ministry.\r\nDimensions on how to handle God\'s increase.\r\nBeing an Apostolic is not just living by Apostolic Doctrine but also following Apostles\' methods.',	'2017-10-28 11:00:28',	'2017-10-28 11:00:28'),
(42027,	2000,	3197,	'Preparing to recieve the promise.',	'2017-10-28 11:00:28',	'2017-10-28 11:00:28'),
(42028,	2000,	3198,	'It\'s good to know that Care Ministry should not just be another method that the Church has - but should be a revelation for everyone.',	'2017-10-28 11:00:28',	'2017-10-28 11:00:28'),
(42029,	2000,	3211,	'There\'s something about joining together for a spiritual fellowship. Cleansing of the body.\r\nIn order for the parts of the body to be alive - they all should be connected.\r\nBonding effect when meals are shared throughout the scriptures.',	'2017-10-28 11:34:28',	'2017-10-28 11:34:28'),
(42030,	2000,	3212,	'Building horizontal relationships.',	'2017-10-28 11:34:28',	'2017-10-28 11:34:28'),
(42031,	2000,	3213,	'I\'ve learned the real importance of getting to know people, the balance/stability of vertical and horizontal relationship.',	'2017-10-28 11:34:28',	'2017-10-28 11:34:28'),
(42032,	2111,	211,	'People whom we have high expectations are more likely to hurt us one way or another than others\r\nHarsh leaders serve as instruments of refinement\r\nBeing bitter only brings no good but harm',	'2017-10-29 11:44:25',	'2017-10-29 11:44:25'),
(42033,	2111,	212,	'\"I will not stretch out my hand against my lord, for he is the Lord’s anointed.’\"',	'2017-10-29 11:44:25',	'2017-10-29 11:44:25'),
(42034,	2111,	213,	'Being bitter only brings no good but harm',	'2017-10-29 11:44:25',	'2017-10-29 11:44:25'),
(42035,	2111,	226,	'When God avenges, it is a righteous thing\r\nWhen you do good to your enemies, you speed up the judgment process of God\r\nOffended people will gravitate with each other',	'2017-10-29 12:03:50',	'2017-10-29 12:03:50'),
(42036,	2111,	227,	'When God puts me where He wants me to, I must not leave until He says so',	'2017-10-29 12:03:50',	'2017-10-29 12:03:50'),
(42037,	2111,	228,	'You don\'t get to choose where you go to church...',	'2017-10-29 12:03:50',	'2017-10-29 12:03:50'),
(42038,	2111,	241,	'The more you defend yourself, the more offense you take on\r\nYou have a chance to either pick up your offense, or let God avenge you\r\nDo not repay evil with evil',	'2017-10-29 12:37:43',	'2017-10-29 12:37:43'),
(42039,	2111,	242,	'Do not repay evil with evil',	'2017-10-29 12:37:43',	'2017-10-29 12:37:43'),
(42040,	2111,	243,	'God is setting you up for victory when you let Him avenge you',	'2017-10-29 12:37:43',	'2017-10-29 12:37:43'),
(42041,	2111,	256,	'Revealed knowledge makes one stable\r\nRevelation knowledge comes to those who are extremely hungry\r\nBacksliding starts when one lose interest in God',	'2017-10-30 18:00:44',	'2017-10-30 18:00:44'),
(42042,	2111,	257,	'Be hungry, and revelation will come',	'2017-10-30 18:00:44',	'2017-10-30 18:00:44'),
(42043,	2111,	258,	'Be hungry, and revelation will come',	'2017-10-30 18:00:44',	'2017-10-30 18:00:44'),
(42044,	2111,	271,	'Pride attracts the enemy\r\nDifference in strengths between soul and spirit comes to light when pressure comes\r\nThere\'s gonna be shaking when there\'s a need to:\r\n - bring closer\r\n - remove what is dead\r\n - awaken\r\n - unify or mix together',	'2017-10-30 18:27:13',	'2017-10-30 18:27:13'),
(42045,	2111,	272,	'Prevent thoughts or actions that attracts the enemy',	'2017-10-30 18:27:13',	'2017-10-30 18:27:13'),
(42046,	2111,	273,	'Prevent thoughts or actions that attracts the enemy',	'2017-10-30 18:27:13',	'2017-10-30 18:27:13'),
(42047,	2111,	286,	'The word \"believe\" in the Bible originally meant \"to obey\"\r\nUnbelief is tantamount to disobedience\r\nJesus offended those whose foundations are wrong',	'2017-10-31 00:10:59',	'2017-10-31 00:10:59'),
(42048,	2111,	287,	'Ensure right foundation',	'2017-10-31 00:10:59',	'2017-10-31 00:10:59'),
(42049,	2111,	288,	'God will uproot those He has not planted',	'2017-10-31 00:10:59',	'2017-10-31 00:10:59'),
(42050,	2111,	301,	'We believers sometimes do not know when to have offensive behavior, and when not to have it\r\nA slave is required to serve, while a servant get an opportunity to serve\r\nGod\'s not looking for slaves... He\'s looking for servants',	'2017-10-31 01:21:47',	'2017-10-31 01:21:47'),
(42051,	2111,	302,	'Stop working, and start serving',	'2017-10-31 01:21:47',	'2017-10-31 01:21:47'),
(42052,	2111,	303,	'Most of the time, we got the wrong idea of serving God, and our fellows.',	'2017-10-31 01:21:47',	'2017-10-31 01:21:47'),
(42053,	231,	3361,	'Jesus invested himself in the committed.\r\nThe ministry of Jesus was diverse because the needs of the people were diverse.\r\npreaching proclaims, teaching explains\r\npreaching inspires, teaching equips\r\npreaching incites, teaching imparts',	'2017-10-28 16:46:46',	'2017-10-28 16:46:46'),
(42054,	231,	3362,	'Not to rely solely on the pulpit ministry but be aware that I am part of the body\'s ministry to reach the lost.',	'2017-10-28 16:46:46',	'2017-10-28 16:46:46'),
(42055,	231,	3363,	'It\'s really amazing to see how this is working out in our Hyphen group. Even though we don\'t see ourselves really as teachers, but in our conversations with one another, that is essentially what we are doing - sharing the godly and biblical principles that have guided us through situation sin life.',	'2017-10-28 16:46:46',	'2017-10-28 16:46:46'),
(42056,	231,	3376,	'ministry must have a conduit (structure to be effective (if not it will be destructive)\r\na church that believes there is revival is going to prepare for it\r\nif you don’t make plans for people to give, you are making plans for people to feel dissatisfied.',	'2017-10-28 17:49:23',	'2017-10-28 17:49:23'),
(42057,	231,	3377,	'Find out what the plan is (to facilitate revival or a large harvest) and follow it.',	'2017-10-28 17:49:23',	'2017-10-28 17:49:23'),
(42058,	231,	3378,	'I feel like this lesson has just showed me that I am not doing what I thought I have spent my whole life doing - making plans. HAHA. Essentially the kind of plans I should be making (or following) have to do with the harvest but that is not what my plans have thus far revolved around!',	'2017-10-28 17:49:23',	'2017-10-28 17:49:23'),
(42059,	2111,	316,	'The person who cannot forgive is the person who forgot what he had been forgiven of\r\nSowing discord among the brethren is an abomination\r\nWe deserved Hell, until God paid our debt and forgave us.',	'2017-10-31 06:32:58',	'2017-10-31 06:32:58'),
(42060,	2111,	317,	'Forgiveness is not an easy task, but is a critical requirement of God from His servants, as they were also forgiven their unpayable debt.',	'2017-10-31 06:32:58',	'2017-10-31 06:32:58'),
(42061,	2111,	318,	'Forgive, and God\'s blessings will continue to flow',	'2017-10-31 06:32:58',	'2017-10-31 06:32:58'),
(42062,	231,	3391,	'A full building is a problem - people won’t attend a full building, people won’t put up with it\r\nYou can build a crowd but that is not necessarily the church.\r\nAdam could not have children without Eve. The five fold ministry needs the body of Christ to be complete - the mother dimension. The preacher is incomplete without the ministry of the body of Christ.',	'2017-10-28 18:49:50',	'2017-10-28 18:49:50'),
(42063,	231,	3392,	'To get with the programme - the church will have babies with or without me. I might as well be a part of it.',	'2017-10-28 18:49:50',	'2017-10-28 18:49:50'),
(42064,	231,	3393,	'I feel like Pastor has really gone to great lengths to get us out from the traditional church mindset into a more apostolic model.',	'2017-10-28 18:49:50',	'2017-10-28 18:49:50'),
(42065,	231,	3406,	'If sheep walk ahead of the shepherd, they get lost.\r\nBut the head is not the body and cannot replace the function of the body\r\nThe only thing holding our church back is the lack of preparation as a result of our lack of faith',	'2017-10-28 19:20:52',	'2017-10-28 19:20:52'),
(42066,	231,	3407,	'Do the ministry!',	'2017-10-28 19:20:52',	'2017-10-28 19:20:52'),
(42067,	231,	3408,	'You lead sheep and herd goats. So the question is, do i want to allow myself to be led or do i need to be herded?',	'2017-10-28 19:20:52',	'2017-10-28 19:20:52'),
(42068,	231,	3421,	'For you to get the theory/concepts - you have to be in a situation to practice and experience what you have just been taught.\r\nConcepts but no organised application of concepts = failure\r\nTime is saved by teaching and training. Life is saved by teaching and training.',	'2017-10-28 19:47:02',	'2017-10-28 19:47:02'),
(42069,	231,	3422,	'To be a part of a training program',	'2017-10-28 19:47:02',	'2017-10-28 19:47:02'),
(42070,	231,	3423,	'I love how this is already happening in TJ to a certain extent!',	'2017-10-28 19:47:02',	'2017-10-28 19:47:02'),
(42071,	2000,	3226,	'Giving is a key sign of mature Christian.\r\nMaturity is a process.\r\nWe should advace from foundational principles to grow.',	'2017-10-28 21:37:18',	'2017-10-28 21:37:18'),
(42072,	2000,	3227,	'Reaching the place of maturity - completeness.',	'2017-10-28 21:37:18',	'2017-10-28 21:37:18'),
(42073,	2000,	3228,	'If I want more of God, I should make room for God - by giving away.',	'2017-10-28 21:37:18',	'2017-10-28 21:37:18'),
(42074,	2000,	3241,	'Teachings about the foundation of church should be the foundation of our lives.\r\nThe reason we are not growing is we are not preparing to grow.\r\nRigid in principle, flexible in application.',	'2017-10-29 02:37:29',	'2017-10-29 02:37:29'),
(42075,	2000,	3242,	'Spiritual newborns/babies should never be considered as inconvenience.',	'2017-10-29 02:37:29',	'2017-10-29 02:37:29'),
(42076,	2000,	3243,	'We should make an effort to take care of spiritual newborns/babies so that they should not feel neglected.',	'2017-10-29 02:37:29',	'2017-10-29 02:37:29'),
(42077,	2008,	3331,	'If you are not in unity, your motive is wrong.\r\nAnointing oil is the direct result of unity.\r\nNo flesh is gonna glory in His presence.',	'2017-10-29 10:56:38',	'2017-10-29 10:56:38'),
(42078,	2008,	3332,	'We have to be united as one body and one mind to reach the goal of the church. We all have to look at the same direction because in this way, we will be able to visualize our goals and be more motivated to reach for that goal.',	'2017-10-29 10:56:38',	'2017-10-29 10:56:38'),
(42079,	2008,	3333,	'No flesh is gonna glory in His presence. Any wrong motive inside the church will be made known and will not be honored by God.',	'2017-10-29 10:56:38',	'2017-10-29 10:56:38'),
(42080,	2000,	3256,	'When God introduces a concept, He introduces in an application at it\'s extreme.\r\nWe will get burn out by doing what we think is right but it\'s not what God wants us to do.\r\nGod wanted His people to be involved/included in his work.',	'2017-10-29 08:21:18',	'2017-10-29 08:21:18'),
(42081,	2000,	3257,	'Pray for the people, tell the people about God\'s word, how to live and what work we must do - we should all be included in this.',	'2017-10-29 08:21:18',	'2017-10-29 08:21:18'),
(42082,	2000,	3258,	'It\'s getting clearer for me what Care Ministry is for - not only to tend to newborns in the Church but also be a help/co laborers in the ministry.',	'2017-10-29 08:21:18',	'2017-10-29 08:21:18'),
(42083,	2000,	3271,	'\"The focal point of the ministry is not the barn, but the field.\"\r\n\"The shepherd does not produce the sheep, the sheep produce the sheep.\"\r\nWherever the Church meets, it would be the Church.',	'2017-10-29 09:05:14',	'2017-10-29 09:05:14'),
(42084,	2000,	3272,	'Keeping in mind that the the assembly of the called out ones is already the church regardless where it is.',	'2017-10-29 09:05:14',	'2017-10-29 09:05:14'),
(42085,	2000,	3273,	'You can produce converts but not disciples through the flesh - a good reminder/gauge if what we are doing in the ministry is aligned to what God wants us to do.',	'2017-10-29 09:05:14',	'2017-10-29 09:05:14'),
(42086,	2008,	3346,	'Though not everyone is called to preach, every believer should have a teaching\r\n ministry to this world.\r\nA mature child of God or a disciple is defined as taught or trained one.\r\nJesus’ ministry was relational; while John the Baptist’s ministry was proclamation.',	'2017-10-29 12:19:17',	'2017-10-29 12:19:17'),
(42087,	2008,	3347,	'I have to bring back my passion to teaching bible studies and be spiritually fruitful.',	'2017-10-29 12:19:17',	'2017-10-29 12:19:17'),
(42088,	2008,	3348,	'Indeed, Jesus\' ministry was relational. It emphasized how we ought to show compassion to people around us, and be more willing to fellowship and serve one another.',	'2017-10-29 12:19:17',	'2017-10-29 12:19:17'),
(42089,	2008,	3361,	'Jesus multiplied His ministry.\r\nExplanations call for commitment.\r\nBefore people will receive our message, we have to meet their needs.',	'2017-10-29 13:25:54',	'2017-10-29 13:25:54'),
(42090,	2008,	3362,	'We have to discern the needs of people around us and help meet their needs before they would be willing and ready to receive our message. As A part of the body of Christ, we shouldn\'t be the one running around asking for help from the people outside the church or for them to bless us. Instead, we should be the one to willingly be used as a channel of blessing to people that aren\'t in the church yet, so they will be more willing to listen to our message.',	'2017-10-29 13:25:54',	'2017-10-29 13:25:54'),
(42091,	2008,	3363,	'Being a \'parent\' is more than just setting rules to children. It is also setting a good example oh how to live your life. Like in church, as elders, we have to set an example of the love of Christ and be able to let that love flow through. Like a \'parent,\' we also have to teach individuals and help them find their ministry and fulfill the ministry that God called them to do, as a parent guides his children, we also have to guide our brethren to grow and be fruitful.',	'2017-10-29 13:25:54',	'2017-10-29 13:25:54'),
(42092,	2008,	3376,	'It may be our church\'s structure that is limiting our growth.\r\nMinistry must have a conduit to flow through.\r\nThe CARE ministry involves the whole body to take care of the whole harvest.',	'2017-10-29 14:45:37',	'2017-10-29 14:45:37'),
(42093,	2008,	3377,	'I will try to actively participate in the end-time harvest. I will endeavour to become an empty vessel for the blessing of God to flow through me towards other people and be willing to share the gospel anytime needed.',	'2017-10-29 14:45:37',	'2017-10-29 14:45:37'),
(42094,	2008,	3378,	'We have to empower ourselves, through the help of our elders, and also by our own means (prayer, fasting and supplication, studying His word, etc.) so that we may be ready to to be part of the revival that God is going to do.',	'2017-10-29 14:45:37',	'2017-10-29 14:45:37'),
(42095,	2008,	3391,	'The 5-fold gifting have to have the saints operating in tandem in order for their ministries to be complete.\r\nA \'man\' may build a \'crowd\' but will have a hard time building the church.\r\nGod establishes His concepts and principles by using the most adverse circumstances and extreme challenges.',	'2017-10-29 15:40:58',	'2017-10-29 15:40:58'),
(42096,	2008,	3392,	'Since a church cannot be built in the pulpit, we, as those \'in front of the pulpit\' have to initiate effort to be used to reach out to people, which cannot be done solely by our pastor. We have to know our gifting and use it for God\'s glory, specially to take care of those in the church that need guidance, and also to help meet the needs of those outside the church for them to be ready to receive the message (gospel) that we are about to relay to them.',	'2017-10-29 15:40:58',	'2017-10-29 15:40:58'),
(42097,	2008,	3393,	'I have taken the motivational gift test and have discovered that I am a \'server,\' and knowing that this is my gift, I will try to take extra measures to be willing and available to serve my brethren specially those that are weak and are new -born in the church.',	'2017-10-29 15:40:58',	'2017-10-29 15:40:58'),
(42098,	2008,	3406,	'The primary job of the pastor is to feed the sheep with knowledge and understanding.\r\nThe head is extremely important for the function of the body, yet the former cannot replace the purpose and the function of the latter.\r\nOur faith ought to propel us into action and that action ought to be preparation',	'2017-10-30 14:41:28',	'2017-10-30 14:41:28'),
(42099,	2008,	3407,	'As part of the body of Christ, I have to work in  one accord with my brethren and be willing to go the extra measures to fellowship with those who are weak and to reach out for people that are lost.',	'2017-10-30 14:41:28',	'2017-10-30 14:41:28'),
(42100,	2008,	3408,	'If I would pray that may God use me for His kingdom, then I have to prepare myself to be used for His kingdom... He has promised the harvest, and it will only come to those that are ready for it.',	'2017-10-30 14:41:28',	'2017-10-30 14:41:28'),
(42101,	231,	3436,	'Many pastors carry the expectations of people, what they’ve been told to do traditionally and they get burned out.\r\n\r\nIf the entire body is involved in ministry, then no one person will be destroyed/burned out.\r\nCare ministry provides a structure where the load can be shared.\r\nCare ministry -> fellowship -> unity -> stability',	'2017-10-29 16:48:28',	'2017-10-29 16:48:28'),
(42102,	231,	3437,	'To be a part of the load sharing so that no one gets burned out.',	'2017-10-29 16:48:28',	'2017-10-29 16:48:28'),
(42103,	231,	3438,	'#9 doesn\'t make sense\r\n\r\nI think the reason why I\'ve resisted any idea of \"leadership\" for so long is because the idea I have in my head is that of traditional church, and very honestly, the role of a traditional church leader or minister is a very unattractive one. It seems both ambitious, public, tiring and thankless all at the same time. Now I don\'t really think that way because I see that I can be who I feel God made me to be and use the giftings and the personality that He gave me.',	'2017-10-29 16:48:28',	'2017-10-29 16:48:28'),
(42104,	231,	3451,	'Care ministry provides a completely different doorway to the church\r\nJesus told us to go to the world, not for the world to come to us.\r\nJesus knew there was strength in not being alone - he never sent them out alone.',	'2017-10-29 17:09:01',	'2017-10-29 17:09:01'),
(42105,	231,	3452,	'To not engage in evangelism efforts alone',	'2017-10-29 17:09:01',	'2017-10-29 17:09:01'),
(42106,	231,	3453,	'Such a good reminder that we should go to the world and search for the hungry, not wait for them to find us.',	'2017-10-29 17:09:01',	'2017-10-29 17:09:01'),
(42107,	973,	1321,	'Women and men are are joint heir of grace of God. Women are not spiritually inferior to men\r\nwhen a man dishonors his wife, his prayers will not be heard\r\nA church without a mother’s voice is as dysfunctional as a home without the mother’s voice',	'2017-10-29 17:12:09',	'2017-10-29 17:12:09'),
(42108,	973,	1322,	'-',	'2017-10-29 17:12:09',	'2017-10-29 17:12:09'),
(42109,	973,	1323,	'I found awesome that this kind of teaching was taught in such a time when there was significant discrimination between men and women. I feel bible respects women as daughters of God as joint heir of grace of God and wonder at the same time that if \'being motherly\' is the only way to contribute to the kingdom of God. because I don\'t feel I am having it for now..',	'2017-10-29 17:12:09',	'2017-10-29 17:12:09'),
(42110,	2003,	3241,	'That a child or a babe in the church that is unskillful and never grows up is considered afflicted.\r\nT he Lord expects us to take what taught us the foundation of the church to be in our lives.\r\nThat there has to be a preparation in the church though He promised us revival.',	'2017-10-29 17:35:00',	'2017-10-29 17:35:00'),
(42111,	2003,	3242,	'To be prepared to teach other people aboutbthe church foundation and all the lesson that had been taught.',	'2017-10-29 17:35:00',	'2017-10-29 17:35:00'),
(42112,	2003,	3243,	'Our relationship with God is supposed to be personal..between us and the Lord.',	'2017-10-29 17:35:00',	'2017-10-29 17:35:00'),
(42113,	231,	3466,	'Heritage is not bad but it should not lead to religious tradition\r\nReligious tradition holds back the advancement of the gospel\r\nIt’s possible to transgress the commandments of God because of our tradition',	'2017-10-29 17:39:50',	'2017-10-29 17:39:50'),
(42114,	231,	3467,	'-',	'2017-10-29 17:39:50',	'2017-10-29 17:39:50'),
(42115,	231,	3468,	'At this point I do feel like religious tradition is the reason why a lot of people have left the church or found that this does not work out for them - either we were too traditional and couldn\'t retain the people or TJ was changing and becoming more apostolic but there were certain religious traditions that people were holding on to and they could not accept the change - almost like that change was a threat.',	'2017-10-29 17:39:50',	'2017-10-29 17:39:50'),
(42116,	231,	3481,	'It’s possible to transgress the commandments of God because of our tradition\r\nThe ability (structure) to disciple and care for new believers is crucial to revival\r\nPeople come to a God-event because someone reached out to them - the result/product of the body working together',	'2017-10-29 18:11:09',	'2017-10-29 18:11:09'),
(42117,	231,	3482,	'To be conscious to adopt Apostolic principles in our methods of doing life as the body of Christ and reaching the lost and discipling new believers',	'2017-10-29 18:11:09',	'2017-10-29 18:11:09'),
(42118,	231,	3483,	'Structure is not the end all and be all but it is crucial to the success of our discipleship and evangelistic efforts',	'2017-10-29 18:11:09',	'2017-10-29 18:11:09'),
(42119,	2000,	3286,	'God compares heavenly things to earthly thIngs for us to understand heavenly things.\r\nWe are mutually dependent on one another.\r\nLife takes place in the cell.',	'2017-10-29 21:28:09',	'2017-10-29 21:28:09'),
(42120,	2000,	3287,	'We are our brother\'s keeper.',	'2017-10-29 21:28:09',	'2017-10-29 21:28:09'),
(42121,	2000,	3288,	'As the family needs the Father/Mother dimension of leadership, the Church needs it the same, so we must function into these dimensions in the ministry.',	'2017-10-29 21:28:09',	'2017-10-29 21:28:09'),
(42122,	2000,	3301,	'Two dimensions of ministry, two structures.\r\nThere\'s intimacy/bonding in \"feeding\".\r\nSingle parent families are considered dysfucntional.',	'2017-10-29 21:58:09',	'2017-10-29 21:58:09'),
(42123,	2000,	3302,	'Observing God\'s plan/progression.',	'2017-10-29 21:58:09',	'2017-10-29 21:58:09'),
(42124,	2000,	3303,	'It\'s very important for both dimensions to work hand in hand and trust each other.',	'2017-10-29 21:58:09',	'2017-10-29 21:58:09'),
(42125,	2002,	3346,	'That John was a bold proclaimer while Jeus was a gentle teacher in their ministry.\r\nThat preaching is supposed to be essentially the proclaiming of good news which is supposed to bring us to a place of repentance and is a valid necessary ministry to bring people to Christ.\r\nThat the purpose of the five fold ministry is to fully equipped the saintS that they may do the works of the ministry.',	'2017-10-30 00:32:16',	'2017-10-30 00:32:16'),
(42126,	2002,	3347,	'To be part of the teaching ministry of the church.',	'2017-10-30 00:32:16',	'2017-10-30 00:32:16'),
(42127,	2002,	3348,	'Lack of teaching ministry will produce immature christians/saints. They should be taught what to do and guide them so that they will learn and take them to maturity.',	'2017-10-30 00:32:16',	'2017-10-30 00:32:16'),
(42128,	2002,	3361,	'That every person/individuals in the church has a ministry to do especially to the lost and to the new members.\r\nThat every people/saints needs to be taught and trained in the church to be a disciple.\r\nThat it is impossible to make a disciple through preaching. Preaching proclaims while Teaching explains, inspires and equips.',	'2017-10-30 01:18:24',	'2017-10-30 01:18:24'),
(42129,	2002,	3362,	'To help, assist and supports in teaching ministry. Also, to find their place for the purpose of Christ in their lives.',	'2017-10-30 01:18:24',	'2017-10-30 01:18:24'),
(42130,	2002,	3363,	'That only those who have hunger and thirst to the Lord will remain. And through teaching they will be more fed and to be successful in their ministry.',	'2017-10-30 01:18:24',	'2017-10-30 01:18:24'),
(42131,	2110,	346,	'Why do some people get injured more easily than others? There are some people that don’t exercise – not praying, not reading the word, and not studying the Word.\r\nThe first step is to create an atmosphere that is conducive for reconciliation. The love of God covers a multitude of sins!\r\nWhat you do with an offence will determine your future.',	'2017-10-30 02:51:32',	'2017-10-30 02:51:32'),
(42132,	2110,	347,	'Why do some people get injured more easily than others? There are some people that don’t exercise – not praying, not reading the word, and not studying the Word.\r\n\r\nI learned that in order for me to overcome offenses and escape the trap of satan by exercising my faith through prayer. As a soldier of Christ, being equipped is important to avoid injuries or casualty on spiritual war. Praying for the person who offended us is the way to escape the trap of offenses. Praying with love as we pray for our loved ones is the key.',	'2017-10-30 02:51:32',	'2017-10-30 02:51:32'),
(42133,	2110,	348,	'After listening to the 12 videos of this lesson, I learned so much on how to act on the bait of satan. I learned the right wat of praying, the right way to think and respond to offenses, the right way to reconcile, honor and forgive. This principles, biblical principles are very important in our journey as a Christian. This is a life changing lesson. Thank God for all the teachings and for all the people He is using to teach us. Thank God for His immeasurable love for us.',	'2017-10-30 02:51:32',	'2017-10-30 02:51:32'),
(42134,	2002,	3376,	'That the CARE ministry involves the whole body to take care of the harvest or new converts.\r\nThat God has given us the ministry of reconciliation. Reconciling man to Him.\r\nA church that needs revival, must have a preparation to make.',	'2017-10-30 13:20:18',	'2017-10-30 13:20:18'),
(42135,	2002,	3377,	'To be a conduit and also to be part in taking care of  babies or new converts.',	'2017-10-30 13:20:18',	'2017-10-30 13:20:18'),
(42136,	2002,	3378,	'We should be available and have a place in the ministry.   For whatever we freely received from God must also be freely give to others.',	'2017-10-30 13:20:18',	'2017-10-30 13:20:18'),
(42137,	2002,	3391,	'That John Wesley and his ministry is in the roots of the apostolic movement. The structure he was using is identical to the Apostolic in the first century.\r\nBiblically and historically home groups and small groups ministry is in our heritage and it is part of the apostolic root.\r\nDiscipleship classes is much needed in nurturing, equipping and training in a church.',	'2017-10-30 13:56:00',	'2017-10-30 13:56:00'),
(42138,	2002,	3392,	'To be part and to support in taking care of  babies or new converts.',	'2017-10-30 13:56:00',	'2017-10-30 13:56:00'),
(42139,	2002,	3393,	'That mothers are equipped not fathers in taking care of babies.',	'2017-10-30 13:56:00',	'2017-10-30 13:56:00'),
(42140,	2000,	3316,	'Unity is not uniformity.\r\nTrue unity only takes place through an environment that promotes fellowship.\r\nChurches full of clique have no unity.',	'2017-10-30 14:09:57',	'2017-10-30 14:09:57'),
(42141,	2000,	3317,	'Reaching people nobody wants.',	'2017-10-30 14:09:57',	'2017-10-30 14:09:57'),
(42142,	2000,	3318,	'Making room for unity/fellowship by reaching people and removing our preferences.',	'2017-10-30 14:09:57',	'2017-10-30 14:09:57'),
(42143,	2000,	3331,	'Every single person has a place in the body of Christ.\r\nA joint problem is a relationship problem in the church.\r\nIf the joint of the body is healthy, the body will be strong.',	'2017-10-30 14:48:47',	'2017-10-30 14:48:47'),
(42144,	2000,	3332,	'Be an enforcer of unity, when we are united - the anointing of God flows upon us.',	'2017-10-30 14:48:47',	'2017-10-30 14:48:47'),
(42145,	2000,	3333,	'Becoming like Jesus is being one with God and each other - we should not be in competition with one another, rather we should always be united in purpose.',	'2017-10-30 14:48:47',	'2017-10-30 14:48:47'),
(42146,	2008,	3421,	'Care ministry provides opportunities for saints to apply what they are taught.\r\nEvery time the pastor grows in God, he provides room for everybody below him to move up.\r\nIt is one thing for God to save you. It is another thing for God to use you. The most difficult thing God does is to save a person after He has mightily use him.',	'2017-10-30 16:20:25',	'2017-10-30 16:20:25'),
(42147,	2008,	3422,	'We have to take every opportunity to apply what we are taught. If we are asked to be involved in a specific ministry, as much as possible, we have to say yes specially if we are already trained.',	'2017-10-30 16:20:25',	'2017-10-30 16:20:25'),
(42148,	2008,	3423,	'Being willing to be more involved in the ministry, whatever it is, is a great responsibility. The more that each saint is involved in a ministry, the more the blessing, the greater the harvest will be.',	'2017-10-30 16:20:25',	'2017-10-30 16:20:25'),
(42149,	2000,	3346,	'Preaching ministry is to prepare the way of the Lord into our lives.\r\nPreaching ministry will not bring you to maturity.\r\nWe need to get our concepts and methods from the Lord Jesus Christ, because the source determines the fruit.',	'2017-10-30 16:18:07',	'2017-10-30 16:18:07'),
(42150,	2000,	3347,	'Aim to be a teacher and play the role of mother dimension in the church.',	'2017-10-30 16:18:07',	'2017-10-30 16:18:07'),
(42151,	2000,	3348,	'Teaching is building relationships - giving emphasis on the value of Care Ministry.',	'2017-10-30 16:18:07',	'2017-10-30 16:18:07'),
(42152,	2116,	3361,	'Cannot build a church from a pulpit\r\nYou can\'t raise children through proclamation, declaration, warnings, you have to raise children by teaching them\r\nFocus of the leaders in the church must be preparing and equipping saints for the work of the ministry.',	'2017-10-30 16:26:56',	'2017-10-30 16:26:56'),
(42153,	2116,	3362,	'Church needs commited people, to train the saints to participate in the ministry in reaching the world.',	'2017-10-30 16:26:56',	'2017-10-30 16:26:56'),
(42154,	2116,	3363,	'One of the good points I got from this lesson was, the importance and calling to teach and train every individual in the church, specially for leaders/elders.',	'2017-10-30 16:26:56',	'2017-10-30 16:26:56'),
(42155,	2005,	3211,	'The lack of ministry at home\r\nThat there is a bonding effect when meal was being shared...\r\nThat we must be connected.',	'2017-10-31 06:22:20',	'2017-10-31 06:22:20'),
(42156,	2005,	3212,	'To have ministry at home',	'2017-10-31 06:22:20',	'2017-10-31 06:22:20'),
(42157,	2005,	3213,	'Praise the Lord',	'2017-10-31 06:22:20',	'2017-10-31 06:22:20'),
(42158,	2005,	3226,	'That the key sign of a mature Christian is one who forgives.\r\nThat maturity is a process - a day by day process.\r\nThat the fruit of maturity is fruitfulness',	'2017-10-31 06:28:12',	'2017-10-31 06:28:12'),
(42159,	2005,	3227,	'To seek and gave the lost - God',	'2017-10-31 06:28:12',	'2017-10-31 06:28:12'),
(42160,	2005,	3228,	'Praise God!',	'2017-10-31 06:28:12',	'2017-10-31 06:28:12'),
(42161,	2005,	3241,	'That we take the teachings of the foundation of the church to become our foundation of our life.\r\nThat the church will prepare for the arrival of the promised babies, exactly true.\r\nGrowth is change.',	'2017-10-31 06:35:32',	'2017-10-31 06:35:32'),
(42162,	2005,	3242,	'Rigid in principle, flexible in application',	'2017-10-31 06:35:32',	'2017-10-31 06:35:32'),
(42163,	2005,	3243,	'Praise God.',	'2017-10-31 06:35:32',	'2017-10-31 06:35:32'),
(42164,	2005,	3271,	'That we can produce converts but not disciple through the flesh\r\nThat it is easier to have spiritual intimacy at home.\r\nThat the focal point of the ministry is the field not the barn.',	'2017-10-31 06:51:42',	'2017-10-31 06:51:42'),
(42165,	2005,	3272,	'Applying the Apostolic principle for harvesting of souls',	'2017-10-31 06:51:42',	'2017-10-31 06:51:42'),
(42166,	2005,	3273,	'Praise God.',	'2017-10-31 06:51:42',	'2017-10-31 06:51:42'),
(42167,	2005,	3286,	'That the body grows because the cells divide.\r\nThat the body cannot live when the cell is dead\r\nthat the structure of the human body stays the same throughout',	'2017-10-31 06:59:06',	'2017-10-31 06:59:06'),
(42168,	2005,	3287,	'connect always to every cell in the body',	'2017-10-31 06:59:06',	'2017-10-31 06:59:06'),
(42169,	2005,	3288,	'Praise the Lord',	'2017-10-31 06:59:06',	'2017-10-31 06:59:06'),
(42170,	2005,	3301,	'Shepherd do not produce sheep\r\nThat love is not what you get but what you give\r\nThat reasons behind infant mortality is because they are not fed consistently....',	'2017-10-31 07:06:55',	'2017-10-31 07:06:55'),
(42171,	2005,	3302,	'Nurturing my children is more important than discipline',	'2017-10-31 07:06:55',	'2017-10-31 07:06:55'),
(42172,	2005,	3303,	'Praise God',	'2017-10-31 07:06:55',	'2017-10-31 07:06:55'),
(42173,	2005,	3316,	'That when we reach people nobody wants, God will give you the people everybody wants.\r\nThat unity is not uniformity.\r\nthat help meet means the other half of self.',	'2017-10-31 07:13:47',	'2017-10-31 07:13:47'),
(42174,	2005,	3317,	'To reach the world',	'2017-10-31 07:13:47',	'2017-10-31 07:13:47'),
(42175,	2005,	3318,	'Praise the Lord',	'2017-10-31 07:13:47',	'2017-10-31 07:13:47'),
(42176,	2005,	3331,	'That the joints represent the relationships between the members of the body\r\nThat revival is not possible without unity in the body\r\nThat an indicator of wrong motives is when we are not in unity.',	'2017-10-31 07:19:30',	'2017-10-31 07:19:30'),
(42177,	2005,	3332,	'Be matured and bear fruits',	'2017-10-31 07:19:30',	'2017-10-31 07:19:30'),
(42178,	2005,	3333,	'Praise You Jesus',	'2017-10-31 07:19:30',	'2017-10-31 07:19:30'),
(42179,	2005,	3346,	'Jesus ministry was declarational\r\nThat we cannot make disciple by preaching\r\nThat the source of the methods and concepts determine what the fruit is.',	'2017-10-31 07:24:12',	'2017-10-31 07:24:12'),
(42180,	2005,	3347,	'Always preparing the way of the Lord into our lives.',	'2017-10-31 07:24:12',	'2017-10-31 07:24:12'),
(42181,	2005,	3348,	'Thank you Lord.',	'2017-10-31 07:24:12',	'2017-10-31 07:24:12'),
(42182,	2005,	3361,	'That there has to be a transition from the ministry of John to the ministry of Jesus.\r\nThat by being a parent, is synonymous to a teacher.\r\nThat we are facilitator to help new converts find their place in the ministry',	'2017-10-31 07:32:56',	'2017-10-31 07:32:56'),
(42183,	2005,	3362,	'Being an elder, i am responsible to help each individual to find their place in God\'s plan and purpose.',	'2017-10-31 07:32:56',	'2017-10-31 07:32:56'),
(42184,	2005,	3363,	'Thank you Lord.',	'2017-10-31 07:32:56',	'2017-10-31 07:32:56'),
(42185,	2005,	3391,	'That God establishes HIs concepts and principles by using the most adverse circumstances and extreme challenges\r\nPraise God\r\nThank you Jesus',	'2017-10-31 07:44:47',	'2017-10-31 07:44:47'),
(42186,	2005,	3392,	'Be a disciple maker',	'2017-10-31 07:44:47',	'2017-10-31 07:44:47'),
(42187,	2005,	3393,	'Praise God',	'2017-10-31 07:44:47',	'2017-10-31 07:44:47'),
(42188,	2005,	3406,	'That pastor must give account of their sheep to God.\r\nThat the shepherd really is in the upfront of his flock of sheep\r\nThe head gives the direction and the body is the doing.',	'2017-10-31 07:49:12',	'2017-10-31 07:49:12'),
(42189,	2005,	3407,	'Feed the sheep with knowledge and understanding',	'2017-10-31 07:49:12',	'2017-10-31 07:49:12'),
(42190,	2005,	3408,	'Praise God',	'2017-10-31 07:49:12',	'2017-10-31 07:49:12'),
(42191,	2005,	3481,	'That we must overcome the expectation created by religious traditions if we want to be prepared for promised harvest.\r\nGod\'s principles and patterns do not change with culture nor time.\r\n...',	'2017-10-31 08:28:20',	'2017-10-31 08:28:20'),
(42192,	2005,	3482,	'Not to make the commandment of God of none effect by sticking to our methods',	'2017-10-31 08:28:20',	'2017-10-31 08:28:20'),
(42193,	2005,	3483,	'Praise the Lord',	'2017-10-31 08:28:20',	'2017-10-31 08:28:20'),
(42194,	2008,	3436,	'The stability of the church is improved with CARE ministry.\r\nMany saints are frustrated because they have no outlet for their godly desires to serve.\r\nWhen the saints are involved, they too are given the same opportunity to experience the same fullness and joy of ministry that the pastors/bishops have.',	'2017-10-30 20:20:08',	'2017-10-30 20:20:08'),
(42195,	2008,	3437,	'As leaders, we have to make sure that we give each saint the opportunity to minister. It gives them the outlet to for their godly desires to serve and helps them to grow more spiritually, because they are investing their time and effort on Godly things.',	'2017-10-30 20:20:08',	'2017-10-30 20:20:08'),
(42196,	2008,	3438,	'It is true that it is frustrating if your godly desire to serve is not given an outlet. This is denying the saint the fullness of joy that they could have felt if they are able to minister and be used for God. This way, we have to ensure that every member of the church is given the teaching, the training and the opportunity to to be used in the ministry.',	'2017-10-30 20:20:08',	'2017-10-30 20:20:08'),
(42197,	3892,	5956,	'A witness is someone who has seen or experienced something for themselves.\r\nYou have to have the gifts of the spirit operating in the correct way,  for the glory of God. The church has to start seeing the power of God happening.\r\nThe most effective way of presenting the gospel is with the proof of signs and wonders.',	'2017-10-30 20:36:54',	'2017-10-30 20:36:54'),
(42198,	3892,	5957,	'That miracles should be a norm in christianity. That the power is not of us but from God and I need to just believe him for it.',	'2017-10-30 20:36:54',	'2017-10-30 20:36:54'),
(42199,	3892,	5958,	'That our faith should not  stand in the wisdom of men,but in the power of God, Also that love should be the influencing factor behind the use of all the spiritual gifts.',	'2017-10-30 20:36:54',	'2017-10-30 20:36:54'),
(42200,	2008,	3451,	'Growth is a function of change.\r\nCARE ministry takes the church to the people.\r\nCARE ministry makes evangelism a group effort',	'2017-10-30 21:04:51',	'2017-10-30 21:04:51'),
(42201,	2008,	3452,	'Being part of the CARE ministry means that I will allow myself to be a vessel to take the church to the people. I can minister to people outside the church even if I am not a pastor because I belong to a CARE ministry that helps me to have the opportunity to discern the needs of other people and be able to minister to those discerned needs.',	'2017-10-30 21:04:51',	'2017-10-30 21:04:51'),
(42202,	2008,	3453,	'This kind of ministry has helped me a lot when I was in Singapore and was a part of a care group. When I would come to the fellowship with a heavy heart, brethren are willingly ministering to me by allowing the wisdom of God and the love of God to flow through them to help me and guide me. It is truly a powerful ministry that is a life-changing experience.',	'2017-10-30 21:04:51',	'2017-10-30 21:04:51'),
(42203,	3892,	5971,	'If we lack wisdom we can just ask God for it.\r\nGod wants us to understand how to operate in the gifts of the spirit.\r\nThe gift of discernment of spirits is a weapon that God has given us, to deal with people  that are creating havoc in the church and constantly keeping the church unsettled.',	'2017-10-30 21:24:11',	'2017-10-30 21:24:11'),
(42204,	3892,	5972,	'To operate the gifts of the spirit correctly and for the glory of God.',	'2017-10-30 21:24:11',	'2017-10-30 21:24:11'),
(42205,	3892,	5973,	'To become more sensitive to Gods spirit and  to be able to discern more whether something is a physical issue or a spiritual one.',	'2017-10-30 21:24:11',	'2017-10-30 21:24:11'),
(42206,	2008,	3466,	'The common barrier to us receiving and implementing the concept of CARE ministry is religious tradition.\r\nThe problem is we continue to try make things work the way it had worked for someone else previously.\r\nReligious tradition suppresses and binds structure\r\n and methodology.',	'2017-10-31 12:43:19',	'2017-10-31 12:43:19'),
(42207,	2008,	3467,	'I have to always remember that I should not be bound with religious traditions if I want to be part of God\'s promised harvest. As long as the messagr of God is the same, I should\'t be hesitant to follow new methods that my leaders would like to adapt.',	'2017-10-31 12:43:19',	'2017-10-31 12:43:19'),
(42208,	2008,	3468,	'When I first attended a care group in Sg, it was a completely different thing to me, but now as I look back, this was definitely a life-changing experience that helped me grow tremendously with my walk with God.',	'2017-10-31 12:43:19',	'2017-10-31 12:43:19'),
(42209,	2003,	3256,	'That discipleship is a process of making a disciple by teaching.\r\nThat there would be multiplication of people in the ministry upon the structure were put in proper place.\r\nWhen God introduces a concept or principle,itvshould be applied in an extreme fashion.',	'2017-10-30 22:37:22',	'2017-10-30 22:37:22'),
(42210,	2003,	3257,	'By this lesson,reaching people whether in reaching,sharing or witnessing,it should also be in the truth of the word of God.',	'2017-10-30 22:37:22',	'2017-10-30 22:37:22'),
(42211,	2003,	3258,	'To declare to them and tell how God is good..to pray for them  and initiate what they must do.',	'2017-10-30 22:37:22',	'2017-10-30 22:37:22'),
(42212,	2008,	3481,	'We can make the commandment of God of none effect by sticking to our methods.\r\nThe end result of tradition is we worship God in vain.\r\nPersonal convictions are not doctrinal even if they are from God.',	'2017-10-31 12:51:12',	'2017-10-31 12:51:12'),
(42213,	2008,	3482,	'I shouldn\'t stick to tradition and I should learn to explore other ways on how to help the church horizontally and vertically.',	'2017-10-31 12:51:12',	'2017-10-31 12:51:12'),
(42214,	2008,	3483,	'There are a lot of things that we thought are supposed to be done that specific way, not realizing that there are other options on how to relay God\'s message to everyone. We have to be open to new ideas, as long as it is still teaching the message of God from the bible to be able to get a different and better result with our efforts to grow.',	'2017-10-31 12:51:12',	'2017-10-31 12:51:12'),
(42215,	2003,	3271,	'The five fold gifting were given for the ministry to the church to be equipped.\r\nThat from hundred years ago after the birth of the church..the focus now is on the ministry.\r\nThat the apostolic principles,lessons and teachings,should be applied.',	'2017-10-31 00:17:57',	'2017-10-31 00:17:57'),
(42216,	2003,	3272,	'To study much more of the word of God for equipping,to be able to teach other also.',	'2017-10-31 00:17:57',	'2017-10-31 00:17:57'),
(42217,	2003,	3273,	'Care group ministry could be perfectly made for the people to teach them the word of God.',	'2017-10-31 00:17:57',	'2017-10-31 00:17:57'),
(42218,	2002,	3406,	'That the primary role of the pastor is to feed the saints with knowledge and understanding.\r\nThat the body is the doing and the head is the direction. The heas is extremely important for the function of the body.\r\nThat Shepherds must provide leadership to their sheep for them to be involved in the ministry.',	'2017-10-31 01:01:57',	'2017-10-31 01:01:57'),
(42219,	2002,	3407,	'To get involved or be part of the ministry in feeding those who are have hunger and thirst for God.',	'2017-10-31 01:01:57',	'2017-10-31 01:01:57'),
(42220,	2002,	3408,	'It is important for Pastor not to lose sight for the people in the church.',	'2017-10-31 01:01:57',	'2017-10-31 01:01:57'),
(42221,	2002,	3421,	'That Pastor is called to be a trainer of saints.\r\nThat whatever is being taught must be put in practice.\r\nThat head knowledge is not enough in impartation but also life experiences to foundational experience.',	'2017-10-31 01:27:58',	'2017-10-31 01:27:58'),
(42222,	2002,	3422,	'To be use by God and to put into practice whatever is being taught in the church.',	'2017-10-31 01:27:58',	'2017-10-31 01:27:58'),
(42223,	2002,	3423,	'To keep on learning, growing  and be faithful in the church.',	'2017-10-31 01:27:58',	'2017-10-31 01:27:58'),
(42224,	2002,	3436,	'That Pastors are not paid by the people but by the tithes which belongs to God.\r\nThat the Care ministry provides the responsibilities and opportunities for the saints to learn and to lead.\r\nIt is not one persons job to do the works of the ministry but rather everybody must get involved and participate.',	'2017-10-31 01:42:38',	'2017-10-31 01:42:38'),
(42225,	2002,	3437,	'To give into prayer and the ministry of the word,.. the will of God.',	'2017-10-31 01:42:38',	'2017-10-31 01:42:38'),
(42226,	2002,	3438,	'I thanked God for the trust He has given me and to hear His voice.',	'2017-10-31 01:42:38',	'2017-10-31 01:42:38'),
(42227,	2310,	1201,	'all honor starts from the heart and it shows from the reaction of Hannah to the arrogant attitude of Eli\r\nthat understanding of God\'s kingdom with a democratic mindset is not healthy and brings separation. He is not manifest in this mindset. God\'s kingdom has a rank, order and authority.\r\nthe true born again have come to know God and it manifest in their lives because they come to know His authority and it is not inseparable. but the person with no regard, no honor and no reputation to authority is not born again',	'2017-10-31 03:25:37',	'2017-10-31 03:25:37'),
(42228,	2310,	1202,	'be subjected to all authority no matter how bad or cruel are them except their command is violation to the written word of God and to apply the kingdom principle in my life.',	'2017-10-31 03:25:37',	'2017-10-31 03:25:37'),
(42229,	2310,	1203,	'me and my hometown friend were working in Manila as a building electrician and we are in different group or ethnic working there, Visayans, Ilocanos, and Bicolanos, but me and my friend are minorities in that group and there was a strong rivalry that time. I was wondered because we were assign in the position of a lead man. I thought that we have an ability to create a harmonious worked attitude to our department and this is why our engineer have a feeling of jealousy on us. One day, i have a slight fever but the job is in full blast and all of us were need to overtime. i have to excuse myself to our engineer because i am working 9 hours already and i need to rest but he is arrogant, he want me to do the job by force. after our dinner my co-workers backed to their work upstairs. but i have not been able to go there. i\'ll got the brace of fabricated hungers painting that pieces. after an hour, my engineer saw what i am doing, he scolded me and said. i have to go back home and i said with the polite manner, in our province, people are happy because our culture is when somebody have a free time, we are used to help other for free, and i am willingly do the job for free. now i see that it was the type of honoring no matter the authorities are arrogant or unjust. to God be the glory!',	'2017-10-31 03:25:37',	'2017-10-31 03:25:37'),
(42230,	2310,	1216,	'when we have the fear of God, we honor all people because it will outflow from the heart\r\nlot of joy is the greatest reward of honoring, it cannot be buy\r\nthat the fear of the Lord, when it comes to honoring civil authority is i am looking to God    whom they are appointed, therefore, they have my respect',	'2017-10-31 03:56:54',	'2017-10-31 03:56:54'),
(42231,	2310,	1217,	'that i cannot judge any civil authority by their appearance, attitude or intellect (outward or inward). i want them feel my respect.',	'2017-10-31 03:56:54',	'2017-10-31 03:56:54'),
(42232,	2310,	1218,	'there was a checkpoint a distant from my place, i know that i am driving without license. and i have an opportunity to make a U turn to flee, but i did not do that, i am driving slowly and voluntarily stopped. and i said to the traffic police in a polite conduct, that i have done a violation and i am accepting my penalty. I am shocked because he set me free from my violation and with a smile he said to me to get a drivers license and keeping my driving safely. i thanked God, and to him saying i am thankful and he do job well. i know that i commit mistakes to the Lord and i repent.',	'2017-10-31 03:56:54',	'2017-10-31 03:56:54'),
(42233,	2000,	3361,	'God did his ultimate plans through humans.\r\nPreaching proclaims, teaching explains.\r\nGod expects us to help the new members find their place in the ministry.',	'2017-10-31 04:16:16',	'2017-10-31 04:16:16'),
(42234,	2000,	3362,	'Allowing Jesus to work through me so that He can use me to reach for more people.',	'2017-10-31 04:16:16',	'2017-10-31 04:16:16'),
(42235,	2000,	3363,	'There\'s no limit in what God can do through us - we must be willing to be used by Him.',	'2017-10-31 04:16:16',	'2017-10-31 04:16:16'),
(42236,	2310,	1231,	'the evidence of the true Christianity in employees not because of preaching but because they display they characters in difficult situation and they work ethics, they work harder than any trusted employees and never argue, complain or back talking.\r\nthe result of honoring and being respectful because Paul said to those who in opposition, in meekness correcting them, let correcting them with gentleness and teachable spirit\r\nthere are difference in slave and servant, slave does a minimum requirement while servant does a maximum potential',	'2017-10-31 05:25:48',	'2017-10-31 05:25:48'),
(42237,	2310,	1232,	'i don\'t want to be slave, i have maintain my servant attitude at all times to the authorities. so i will serve my Master. and i want to be teachable in spirit.',	'2017-10-31 05:25:48',	'2017-10-31 05:25:48'),
(42238,	2310,	1233,	'because i am a lead man in electrical department, all electricians became my buddies. my job is to guide, lead, instruct and teach them about our job. so we will developed a harmonious atmosphere in our department. my engineer had a feeling of jealousy, he tried me to separate to my team. then my brother called me for help, he had a project, so i resigned to the office. i thanked all the workers of every department there for their cooperation with us in case of trouble. they welcome me and gave me a farewell wished. my buddies knows my decision and they told me that they were resign also. i told them that they don\'t do that because not only our engineer suffer but the management were suffer too. i instructed my hometown friend to continue our legacy which we have started because he was remained working there, to bring an atmosphere of cooperation with each other. in this project, one of my buddy asked me if i am a pastor? i said NO! the rest is history. God will appoint His servant!',	'2017-10-31 05:25:48',	'2017-10-31 05:25:48'),
(42239,	2000,	3376,	'God has given us the ministry of reconciliation.\r\nThere is a functional limitation on how many people one can minister outside of the pulpit.\r\nIt we believe that there is a revival, we must be prepared to be involved in it.',	'2017-10-31 05:06:31',	'2017-10-31 05:06:31'),
(42240,	2000,	3377,	'Studying, getting equipped, and preparing for the harvest.',	'2017-10-31 05:06:31',	'2017-10-31 05:06:31'),
(42241,	2000,	3378,	'As Ambassadors of Christ we must do what He has done on earth and more - through Him and for His glory.',	'2017-10-31 05:06:31',	'2017-10-31 05:06:31'),
(42242,	2310,	1246,	'the evidence of the true believers are they keep the commandments of God.\r\ndishonoring is when there is something wrong if the attitude of the young people are irreverent, speak flipping to their parents in regular basis,and displaying outwardly disobedience and character of the people rejoicing for the mistake of their leaders showing the wrong heart.\r\nby showing behavior of the wives, despite that they were mistreated, dishonored, but they continuing adore, love and honoring their husbands. they will pretty sure winning their husbands.',	'2017-10-31 06:01:47',	'2017-10-31 06:01:47'),
(42243,	2310,	1247,	'in the Philippines where the culture is family oriented, even though i am a family man, i want keep honoring my parents and taking care of them in our home and as a husband, i give my very best to be a good domestic leader in our home.',	'2017-10-31 06:01:47',	'2017-10-31 06:01:47'),
(42244,	2310,	1248,	'me and my wife tend to counsel our sister with a problem about her unbelieving husband, she used to change her husband by force many times. we advise her many times too, that she have to changed her attitude to show respect, adoration and love. and do the chores of their home despite of her busy days. she need to show Jesus in the eyes of her husband. in the end she learned. when she doing our advised. her husband converts and it is not secret for his mother and brother. now he prayed for his family to know Jesus. we bring good news to other when Jesus shown on us.',	'2017-10-31 06:01:47',	'2017-10-31 06:01:47'),
(42245,	2000,	3391,	'Home/Care Group Ministry is in our heritage.\r\nChurches endure and flourish in Russia/China through Home Groups.\r\nIf you have a \"church facility\" and that\'s the main focus of the ministry - the you\'re limited.',	'2017-10-31 05:40:16',	'2017-10-31 05:40:16'),
(42246,	2000,	3392,	'Looking forward in preparing and having these lessons incorporated in our currrent Care Group Ministry.',	'2017-10-31 05:40:16',	'2017-10-31 05:40:16'),
(42247,	2000,	3393,	'I\'m getting excited on what the Care Ministry will bring into our Church by hearing the Korean Church\' testimony.',	'2017-10-31 05:40:16',	'2017-10-31 05:40:16'),
(42248,	4015,	1336,	'You can honor those in need by helping them financially.\r\nPeople can usually tell when you\'re showing them fake honor.\r\nHonoring anything above God is dishonoring Him.',	'2017-10-31 06:00:22',	'2017-10-31 06:00:22'),
(42249,	4015,	1337,	'To honor my peers and strangers in available opportunities to.',	'2017-10-31 06:00:22',	'2017-10-31 06:00:22'),
(42250,	4015,	1338,	'We learn honor by being humble in spirit.',	'2017-10-31 06:00:22',	'2017-10-31 06:00:22'),
(42251,	2310,	1261,	'there are kingdom principles, there are rank, order and authority. and to honor the church leader is honoring Jesus because they give warning to us, and this warning saves us.\r\nthere are two master, God and money, and to honor our church leader we have to cooperatively present ourselves in participating duties. and when we do that, our time and labor represents money and we value God for wisdom He given to us, because money is not our master. and God\'s prosper us because we know how to use money in all aspects of lives.\r\nthat cynical people are those who believe that all people have selfish motives and is commonly used by demonic attack on us, so Paul said to Timothy as one of the pioneer church leader protect the believers from becoming cynical.',	'2017-10-31 06:33:16',	'2017-10-31 06:33:16'),
(42252,	2310,	1262,	'that the honor still keeps in my heart no matter who they are (our church leaders) because i will understand that i can still receives what heavens rewards to those leaders.',	'2017-10-31 06:33:16',	'2017-10-31 06:33:16'),
(42253,	2310,	1263,	'i was new converts when it happens to our home, when my cousin back talking to his pastor, my sister gave warning to my cousin that she would not do back talking to his pastor because sometime he groom and gave a spiritual word to her. because i was a baby Christian, i thought that it was ridiculous, I know that our doctrine is truth so there is a thought on me that it is the time to join her in our congregation. when i was grown in spirit, i repent, i praise God for teaching me because He used my sister  how to honor the church leaders. she was my spiritual mom. I thanked Jesus, that she gave to us.',	'2017-10-31 06:33:16',	'2017-10-31 06:33:16'),
(42254,	2005,	3256,	'That God can tame our unruly tongue and he has the power over our lives too...\r\nYou make disciple by teaching\r\nThat we cannot make a disciple by preaching...',	'2017-10-31 06:45:10',	'2017-10-31 06:45:10'),
(42255,	2005,	3257,	'Inquiring always the will of God in all things.',	'2017-10-31 06:45:10',	'2017-10-31 06:45:10'),
(42256,	2005,	3258,	'All the Glory to God',	'2017-10-31 06:45:10',	'2017-10-31 06:45:10'),
(42257,	2000,	3406,	'The primary job of the pastor is to feed the sheep with knowldege and understanding.\r\nThe head gives directions the body is the doing.\r\nThe Lord is not looking for goats, He\'s looking for sheeps.',	'2017-10-31 07:11:00',	'2017-10-31 07:11:00'),
(42258,	2000,	3407,	'Doing the ministry.',	'2017-10-31 07:11:00',	'2017-10-31 07:11:00'),
