(42260,	2310,	1321,	'in creation, man and woman are representation of the perfect image of God, He made man and woman equal in the grace of life.\r\nhusbands must honoring his wives, nurturing her by giving what she needs to grow and when a husband honor his wife the gifts in her will be flourish\r\nif the husband dishonor his wife, he will strife, holding back the full blessings, because their prayers would not be heard causes that he never fulfill his destiny',	'2017-10-31 07:17:07',	'2017-10-31 07:17:07'),
(42261,	2310,	1322,	'always keeping honor to my wife, nurture her by giving what he needs to grow, and protect her as a \"weaker vessel\" physically.',	'2017-10-31 07:17:07',	'2017-10-31 07:17:07'),
(42262,	2310,	1323,	'when i am single, i am prone to temptation because i have a forbidden relationship in the past and i am trying to brake my sinful situation in my life so i went to Manila for two reasons working and separate from that woman. she called me up and i told her that i am married, and i know, i will telling her a lie. then i prayed that i deliver Him in my situation. then i will backed again. i met a girl, she knows my case and we got married. the woman insist for her love to me, and my wife confront her and she stand to protect our marriage. and this girl did not resist at all and nothing happen until this day. now i see the social status of my wife in the family as equal with her husband that we are one body. i honored her because she is a God\'s gift for me but still I am the domestic leader of the home and she was submitted to me.',	'2017-10-31 07:17:07',	'2017-10-31 07:17:07'),
(42263,	2111,	331,	'Bitterness is unfulfilled revenge\r\nYou do not let the seed of offense germinate overnight\r\nGod forgave us before we even said we\'re sorry',	'2017-10-31 10:41:13',	'2017-10-31 10:41:13'),
(42264,	2111,	332,	'We must not be bitter, lest we be defiled',	'2017-10-31 10:41:13',	'2017-10-31 10:41:13'),
(42265,	2111,	333,	'Letting go of bitterness, and forgiving those who offend us restores us in the sight of God',	'2017-10-31 10:41:13',	'2017-10-31 10:41:13'),
(42266,	2310,	1336,	'honoring God is honor all people and there are so many different ways of honoring people by helping specific ministries; such as usher, nursery, outreach etc. , to help people to their destitute.\r\nGod offended by honoring anyone or anything, and there is a great consequence for this.\r\nGod gives reward to the one who honor him above all, and the fear of God leads to wisdom which attracts honor. but the fools tried to make the scripture fits into their lives.',	'2017-10-31 07:38:58',	'2017-10-31 07:38:58'),
(42267,	2310,	1337,	'i want to honor God above all.',	'2017-10-31 07:38:58',	'2017-10-31 07:38:58'),
(42268,	2310,	1338,	'there were many street children comes in to our house, we used to feed them regularly without feeling that it is an obligation or responsibility, and we thanked Him. now i know that is the way we honor God, the other one i remember is when my neighbor greet me for what i have done pleasant in their eyes, i used to say that it is not my glory, that is glory of God that he gave me a talent or a skillful hands. another one is when my pastor in one of the church i have attended told me not to raised my hands during worship because it is their church rules, i chose to raised my hands, because i keep His commandment in Lamentation 3:41 \"Let us lift up our heart with our hands unto God in the heavens\" and when i do that, my pastor let me what i have done in worship.',	'2017-10-31 07:38:58',	'2017-10-31 07:38:58'),
(42269,	2005,	3376,	'That it is the church structure that limit our growth\r\nThat Jesus spent 3 1/2 years of finding, training and preparing disciples\r\nPraise the Lord',	'2017-10-31 07:39:53',	'2017-10-31 07:39:53'),
