(42292,	2000,	3438,	'Before I took this lesson on care ministry, I was having a hard time dealing with some of the people God has entrusted under my care. But after taking this lesson, I had a better understanding on what God wants me to do and how to do it His way.',	'2017-10-31 10:21:11',	'2017-10-31 10:21:11'),
(42293,	2111,	346,	'Holding a grudge separates us from God\r\nLove your enemies\r\ntwo wrongs don\'t make a right',	'2017-10-31 11:25:41',	'2017-10-31 11:25:41'),
