(42296,	2000,	3451,	'You can\'t pray, fast, preach enough to make a non apostolic concept work\r\nThere is strength in not being alone. Evangelism is a group effort.\r\nWe do not change the message but the methods',	'2017-10-31 10:56:07',	'2017-10-31 10:56:07'),
(42297,	2000,	3452,	'Improve or change my methods Without changing the message.',	'2017-10-31 10:56:07',	'2017-10-31 10:56:07'),
(42298,	2000,	3453,	'For the past few months we have been doing care group meetings, we had no visitors or new people in our group. The existing members have also started to loose interest in having our meetings, including myself. I realized that we have failed to change our methods.  We had no variety of activities And we kept doing the same thing over and over again.',	'2017-10-31 10:56:07',	'2017-10-31 10:56:07'),
(42299,	2000,	3466,	'The common barrier receiving and implementing the Care Ministry is Religious Tradition.\r\nReligious tradition binds and suppresses structure amd methodology.\r\nGod does not change.',	'2017-10-31 14:41:21',	'2017-10-31 14:41:21'),
(42300,	2000,	3467,	'Changing - if we do not change over the course of time, we are dead.',	'2017-10-31 14:41:21',	'2017-10-31 14:41:21'),
(42301,	2000,	3468,	'It\'s possible to transgress the commandment of God by your tradition - we really should change, given we were obeying the will of God.',	'2017-10-31 14:41:21',	'2017-10-31 14:41:21'),
(42302,	2111,	3196,	'The CARE ministry allows people to establish relationship with God and other people in the church even before stepping into the church building.\r\nBeing an Apostolic is not just living by Apostolic doctrine, it is also following the apostles’ method\r\nThe CARE ministry opens up opportunities for people to have real responsibilities and real authority in taking care and nurturing people.',	'2017-10-31 12:43:04',	'2017-10-31 12:43:04'),
