(42305,	2310,	1276,	'the word double honor talking for finances. and if God says give double honor means bless your church leaders, take it to a dinner, just do something that is nice to him or her.\r\npurpose for tithes and offerings are: to provide on a personal level for ,to the appointed servants who minister to us, to provide for the ministers needs to do the work of the ministry that God has call them to do and to enable the minister to help the poor, the widow, the orphan and the outsider.\r\nthat by withholding more than they should for the work of the ministry is a type of dishonoring God by complaining resulting to shortcoming.',	'2017-10-31 12:42:33',	'2017-10-31 12:42:33'),
