(42320,	2111,	3211,	'The early church continued to fellowship and looked out for one another \r\nspiritually\r\nCleansing happens when the body is knitted together in fellowship.\r\nThe horizontal relationship provides opportunities to learn to forgive and be forgiven.',	'2017-10-31 14:25:07',	'2017-10-31 14:25:07'),
