(42983,	4232,	1,	'One point that stood out is how through disobedience Adam and Eve relinquished the covering of divine authority.\r\nAnother point would be how important it is to be in submission even when you feel as though you\'re doing the right thing.\r\nLastly, it really stood out, that when you resist authority; you are resisting God.',	'2017-11-19 05:12:23',	'2017-11-19 05:12:23'),
